<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Bɛkwyel</book>
  <para style="h">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal tɔ Mɛkana ɛ Matye</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Matye</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matye</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal tɔ Mɛkana ɛ Matye</para>
  <para style="mt2">Matye</para>
  <para style="imt">Mɛkpa mɛ mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Matye dyeebagwyák ɛ ekeletyɛ e kyee dik mbyak eYuda. Nyɛ nadi egu ɛnyɔɛpe Ekwyala ee nadi tɔ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa ɛ. Matye lɛɛ bot ɛ náá, Yezu nazyɛ ɛ́ étɛp ɛzɛsa náá, etɛp ee nakwyalaa tɔ bɛmɛkana menek ɛ neebela ɛsuk. Matye nakwyal ɛ́, é ghɛŋ ekeletyɛ e bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nazesɔaa tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɛ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ ezɛɛga bot ɛ nadi emyaal náá, bot ɛ membyak mesis sulal pɛ daa lɔɔ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yɛ bɛ Matye ɔ, nyɛy ke ɛ́ náá, Yezu ɛ́ <char style="bd">Lyoel </char> di lɛɛ nɛ eghɛŋ djas sa Zɛɛb di ewaab nɛ bot ɛ di dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Lyoel tak ɛpelyaal ɛzel na bes yii ɛmɛt mɛtiŋ mɛ di tɔ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa ɛ. Náá, Yezu ɛ́ <char style="bd">Mɛsia </char> eYuda nadi ebwood ɔ. É sok nyɛ di elii dum nɛ ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, nyɛ dyeebake ɛ́ náá: Zɛɛb ɛ́ Mɛkoozi, eghɛŋ bɛ pe eezenyen kɔ bɔs.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Matye baazodu ɛ́ ɛzel ɛ wat nɛ bak bɛsɔ bɛlɛl.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɛ tɔ ɛzel ɛ tak, Matye nasɛɛg mɛkpa ɛ Yezu ɛ́, tɔ mwoob mɛtɛn: etɛp ee nyɛ nalii kana tɔ mɛlaŋel mɛ etɛn kɛkum ɛlaŋel etɛn nɛ ebá ɛ, mɛkpa menek baadjóoaa ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ kɔ ɛtsok. Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ ko kyeed bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu nagoka nɛ ɛkɛ é tak ɛ. Ye nadyeebalyo ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, dáa bot di egoka nɛ ɛdi nɛ ɛgwakel pak'ɔɔ ɛ, nɛ dáa bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛgwakel bɛ nɛ Zɛɛb'ɔɔ ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ ekwyala ee nakan é ɛlaŋel kam ɔ, yenek lii ɛ́ dum nɛ ɛdul ɛ mɛlɔ nɛ mɛlyo étɛp bot aakɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɔ. Yɛ kabɛ mɛkpa mɛ di tɔ ɛlaŋel ɛ kam nɛ elɛl ɔ, yenek sɛɛg ɛ́ etɛp ee di elyo bot esa ee di esɛ́ɛ esok di náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ mɛkoozi ɛ. Tɔ ɛlaŋel kam nɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl, yenek lyaal ɛ́ dáa bot di nɛ ghwyil ɛdi é di wat bɛkɛl nɛ bɛdhem tɔ zɛɛga ekeletyɛ ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ ekwyala ee di kan tɔ ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ená kɛkum mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ etɛn ɔ, yenek lyaal ɛ́ dáa bɛdjekel di egoka nɛ ɛbwood mɛgham mɛ ɛsik ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛsok nɛ bɛ nɛ bela mɛkpa menek, nɛ bhii bɛ mɛkpa menek, mɛkana mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Matye kaada ɛ́ dáa Yezu nadi etsik bot ɛ, nɛ dáa nyɛ nadi edjɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot edee ɛ. Ye baakaadaa ɛ́ étɛp ɛpus bot náá, bɛ siiza ɛbuɛpe, nɛ ɛbe ɛ mɛso bɛ nɛ bɛlyoel yii eYuda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɛ mɛkɛn mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Matye, nyɛ kaada ɛ́ etɛp e ɛbyel ɛ Yezu, edhɔma bɛ, mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda (tɔ ɛlaŋel ɛ wat nɛ ɛlaŋel ɛ ebá). Pɛ mɛsik mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, Yezu, mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda eedjɛaa epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee nɛ ɛbemaa é Mɛlaaba (ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ etɛn nɛ ebá). Tin Zɛɛb naagomal nyɛ tɔ ɛsyee. Yezu eezɛtel bɛdjekel bɛ nyel. Nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ, bɛ kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak djas kɔ bɔs (ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛsok nɛ Yezu nɛ byel, nyɛ nadjóoaa ɛ́ <char style="bd">Emanuɛl</char>: ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ «Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ nena» (ɛlaŋel ɛ mɛkɛn, ze mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ elɛl). Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Matye sik ɛ nɛ ekɛk ɛ Yezu bak: «Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ nen sam wat mɛlu djas kɛkum dwoo bɔs aakɛsi ɛ» (ɛlaŋel mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ elɛl, ze mɛkam-mɛmbá). Yezu ɛ́ Zɛɛb tɔ bot.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Dhaad ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Beeka dhaad ɛ Yezu Klisto, dha ɛ Abalaam, dha ɛ Dhavid e:<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Ye ɛ́ Abalaam ɛ nabya Izak, Izak ɛ nabya Zakɔɔb, Zakɔɔb kabya yɛ ɛ Yuda nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg. <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Tin, Yuda ɛ nabya Pɛlɛɛz bɛ nɛ Zeedas. Din ɛ nyɛɛg'ɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ Tamaad. Pɛlɛɛz kabya ɛ Eslɔm, Eslɔm kabya yɛ ɛ Alam. <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Mɔn Alam kadi ɛ́ Aminadaab, Aminadaab nakabya yɛ ɛ Naasɔn. Naasɔn kabya ɛ Salman. <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salman naazɛbya Bhoaaz bɛ nɛ myɛl Layaab. Bhoaaz bɛ nɛ ngbɛ myɛl Luth nakabya ɛ Obɛɛd. Obɛɛd nakabya ɛ Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Yese ɛ́ nabya mɛkoozi Dhavid.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Mɛkoozi Dhavid naabya Salomɔŋ, nyɛ nabya Salomɔŋ ɛ bɛ nɛ mwaa Wyiili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mwaa Wyiili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadɛk nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mɔɔ sodja yɛ, din ɛ lɛ Huri.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Salomɔŋ nabɛ ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Loboam, Loboam nakabya yɛ ɛ Abiya, Abiya kazɛbya yɛ ɛ Asaf. <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asaf nazɛbya ɛ́ Yozafat, Yozafat kabya yɛ ɛ́ Yolam, mɔn Yolam nabɛ ɛ́ Ozias. <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Ozias nadi ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Yotam, Yotam kabya ɛ́ Akaaz, Akaaz eezɛbya Ezekias. <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Ezekias kabya ɛ́ Manase. Manase kabya yɛ ɛ́ Amɔn, Amɔn nakabya yɛ ɛ́ Yosias. <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Yosias kadi ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Yekonia nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg. Tin ɛ bɛ nazɛtɔ́ é ekwom pɛ kyee dik Bhabhilɔn.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Bhii bɔn Yisalaɛl natɔ́ é ekwom pɛ kyee dik Bhabhilɔn ɛ, Yekonya nakabya ɛ́ Salatyɛl, bhii tak Salatyɛl eezɛbya Zolobabɛl, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zolobabɛl kabya yɛ ɛ́ Abyuud, Abiyuud nabɛ ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Elyakim, Eliyakim kadi ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Azɔɔd; <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azɔɔd eezɛbya Sadɔk, Sadɔk kabya ɛ́ Akim, mɔn Akim kadi ɛ́ Eliyuud. <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliyuud kadi ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Eleazaad, Eleazaad kabya ɛ́ Matan. Matan eezɛbya Zakɔɔb, <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Zakɔɔb kadi ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Zozɛf ngom ɛ Maali. Ye ɛ́ Maali tak ɛ nabya Yezu bot di edjóo Mɛsia ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Tinaak, kana kɔkɔ mɛbyel ɛ Abalaam, kɛyaka nɛ yɛ Dhavid, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye naasa tyee ekɔkɔ e mɛbyel kam nɛ ená. Ye naabaasa tyee ekɔkɔ e mɛbyel kam nɛ ená kana ɛbyel ɛ Dhavid, kɛyaka nɛ membu mɛ bɔn Yisalaɛl natɔ́ é ekwom pɛ Bhabhilɔn ɛ. Kana membu mɛ bɔn Yisalaɛl natɔ́ é ekwom pɛ Bhabhilɔn ɛ kɛyaka nɛ ɛbyel ɛ Mɛsia, ye naasa tyee ekɔkɔ e mɛbyel kam nɛ ená.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbyel ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Gwakeka ɛsuk ɛ ɛbyel ɛ Yezu Klisto. Maali nyɛɛg nabɛ ɛ́ ghɔɔd ɛ Zozɛf. Ɛsok nɛ bɛ nɛ di moma nɛ motom, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Maali eezɛbela ɛbum nɛ ghwyil ɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Zozɛf, mwaaz'ɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mot epiki, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl ɛdhusal nyɛ é mis mɛ bot. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá, emwaaz bɛ nɛ Maali si tɔ syaab. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Dáa nyɛ nadi esiiza deenek ɛ, dhiiti fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt eezɛtuula nyɛ tɔ dhyam, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Zozɛf, dha ɛ Dhavid, nàbem ba étɛp ɛba Maali, etɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛ, nyɛ bela ɛbum. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Nyɛ waabya mɔn mɔɔ motom, bi aaget nyɛ ɛ Yezu, etɛɛ náá, nyɛy ɛ́ kwaatsik bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ tɔ mesyem mɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Esesɛɛ binek djas aasael ɛ, etɛɛ náá, etɛp djas Ghɛŋ nalɛɛ tɔ nuub ɛ ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb neebela ɛsuk. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá:<verse eid="MAT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>«Mɔn ɛsyes ɛ moma di ààgu botom ɔ waabela ɛbum. Bhii tak, nyɛ waabya mɔn mɔɔ motom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">nyɛ aaget nyɛ ɛ́ Emanuɛl.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Eza 7.14</ref></char></note>»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 1:23">Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: «Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ nena.»<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Dáa Zozɛf kadjem é gɔ ɛ, nyɛ zokasa ɛ́ dáa fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbeeb myɛl Maali. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààsɛɛga goŋ bɛ nɛ myɛl kɛkum dwoo myɛl nabya mɔn motom, Zozɛf naget Yezu ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot eezɛtɔ́ kɛduwal Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Yezu nabyel ɛ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Bheteleɛm pɛ kyee dik Yude é ghɛŋ Elood nadi mɛkoozi ɛ. É ghɛŋ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot naadus pɛ kyee ɛdjem ɛ dwoo, kum pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>Tin, bɛ moo zɛdji náá: «Mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda, mɔn di náá, nyɛ ààloo nɛ ɛbyel ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ wo? Bis eebee kwyikwyen yɛ edus pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo, bis ɛ́ bookazyɛ zɛduwal nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Dáa mɛkoozi Elood nagwak deenek ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye naakpaa nyɛ lyem ɛbuɛpe dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛdi kɔ ghaada Yeluzalɛm ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛdjóo bot ɛ nadi kɔ elo eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ djas, nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi djas, nyɛ needji bɛ di Mɛsia di esiŋa nɛ ɛbyel ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Pɛ Bheteleɛm, pɛ kyee dik Yude etɛɛ náá, ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nakwyal ɛ náá:<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>“Wɔy Bheteleɛm, kyee dik Yude</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ wɔ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbyaselaa pɛ kɔ mɛl mɛ di kɔ kyee dik Yude ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">etɛɛ náá, kɔ lɔ'ɛ aapaawyis boo kukuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">mot aadjɛɛd mbyak'am Yisalaɛl ɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:1">Mis 5.1</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Deenek, wɔ gwaa, mɛkoozi Elood zɛdjóo bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot binɔk tɔ syaab. Tin, bɛ eezɛlɛɛ nyɛ sum di nɛ ɛwala ɛ kwyikwyen tak nanyen tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ pɛ Bheteleɛm. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka kɛsaa, da bi ɛ́ gu etɛp djas dum nɛ mɔn tak, dɔɔ nɛ zeza nɛ di nyɛ di ɔ. Bi ɛ́ bela ɔɔ, da bi ɛ́ lɛɛ mɛ, etɛɛ náá, mam pe neezyɛ, zɛduwal nyɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Bhii bɛ nazegwak dáa mɛkoozi nalii nɛ nɔɔ ɛ, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel dhaa yɔɔ. Tin, kwyikwyen bɛ nadi ebee pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo ɛ, moo kɛ pɛ sok bhwoob'ɔɔ pɛ ɛko, é sok bɛ nakum zeza nɛ di mɔn tak nadi ɛ́, Wɔ gwaa kwyikwyen zɛtyaa piki, é di wat, ààkabaakɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Dáa bɛ nabee kwyikwyen ɛ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naamyaala ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛni tɔ ndjaa, zɛbela mɔn bɛ nɛ nyɛɛg Maali tin. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si étɛp ɛduwal mɔn. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛkɛɛ mɛkɔm mɔɔ. Bɛ eezɛpɛk nyɛ nɛ elɔɔd, nɛ bɛmɛnanas di edikaa tɔ du ɛ, zɛnɔɔ mul mɛ di djóoaa miid ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Bhii tak, wɔ gwaa Zɛɛb zɛlu bɛ tɔ dhyam náá, bɛ nàdhaa pɛ daa Elood. Tin, é ɛsik ɛ lɔɔ pɛ dɛl ɛ lɔɔ, bɛ nakadhaŋ ɛ́, pɛ ze sis.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zozɛf nɛ Maali zɛnɔɔ mɔn'ɔɔ Yezu, kaab tɔ́ pɛ Eziptɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Bhis bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot binɔk natɔ́ ɛ, fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt eezɛtuula Zozɛf tɔ dhyam. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyɛla. Nɔŋa mwalɔ nɛ mɔn, da bi ɛ́ kaab, tɔ́, kɛsɔwa pɛ Eziptɛ. Kɛdi penek, kɛkum dwoo mɛ aake náá, wɔ bula ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, Elood ɛ́ waasaa mɔn étɛp nyɛ neegó nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Tin, Zozɛf ɛ́ boozɛwyɛl, nɔɔ mɔn nɛ myɛl, zɛkaab pum-ɛ-pum, tɔ́, kɛsɔwa pɛ Eziptɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Zozɛf zokadi penek ɛ kɛkum ɛlu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ Elood. Ye nasɛɛ deenek ɛ, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee Ghɛŋ naloolɛɛ tɔ nuub ngoolel-mɛkpa mɛ ɛ, neebela ɛsuk. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá: «Mɛ eedjóo mɔn'am étɛp nyɛ neewyis tɔ dɛl ɛ Eziptɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Oze 11.1</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Elood eezɛgó bɔɔ dhyeeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Bhis Elood nazɛgu náá, bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot binɔk naakɔɔ nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ naazɛbiyo ɛlyelɛpe. Wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛdjɛ ɛlee nɛ bot bɛ náá, bɛ tɔ́ pɛ Bheteleɛm nɛ mɛl mɛ di é mengwoob ɛ djas, kɛgó bɔn botom djas di náá, bɛ dinaa ààpaakum membu membá ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, ndem bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá, mɔn tak nadi ɛ́, tɔ lɔɔg membu menek. <verse eid="MAT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Tin, etɛp ee ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Zelemi nalɛɛ ɛ́ boo zɛbela ɛsuk. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naake náá:<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>«Etsim ɛpegék pɛ dɛl ɛ Lama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">etsim e boo mɛgwyɛ nɛ mezuk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Ye ɛ́ Lasɛl ɛ di edje bɔn bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Nyɛ aanàkwaakat ɛgwyɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɔn tokapɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Zel 31.15</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zozɛf nɛ Maali zɛnɔɔ mɔn'ɔɔ Yezu eezɛdus Eziptɛ, sik pɛ Nazalɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Bhis ɛsyee ɛ Elood, fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt eezɛtuula Zozɛf tɔ dhyam pɛ Eziptɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyɛla. Nɔŋa mwalɔ nɛ mɔn, da bi ɛ́ sik pɛ kyee dik Yisalaɛl etɛɛ náá, bot djas nadi ekwyɛl ɛgó mɔn'ɔ ɔ, bɛ eezesi “bhɛɛɛ”.» <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Tin, Zozɛf ɛ́ boozɛwyɛl, nɔɔ mɔn nɛ myɛl sik pɛ kyee dik Yisalaɛl. <verse eid="MAT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Tinaak, dáa nyɛ nagwak náá, Alselaɔs naadjila sɛɛg Elood kɔ bóó mɛkoozi pɛ Yude ɛ, bwoo naasa nyɛ é ɛtɔ́ pɛ yiizaag. Zɛɛb ɛ́ boobaazɛdjɛ nyɛ mɛlyo mɛsis tɔ dhyam. Tin, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dhiiti dɛl ɛsis, pɛ kyee dik Ghalile. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ kɛdi pɛ dhiiti dɛl, din ɛ dɛl ɛ tak ɛ́ Nazalɛt. Ye nasɛɛ deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, dhiiti etɛp ee Zɛɛb nalɛɛ tɔ enuub e bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, neebela ɛsuk. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá: «Bɛ aadjóo nyɛ mot Nazalɛt.»<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>É ghɛŋ tak ye nabɛ ɛ́ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot eetuula tɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ e kyee dik Yude. Nyɛ nadi elyo ɛ́ náá: <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>«Liigka elyem bin, etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, yɛ eezekunaa!» <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Ngoolel-mɛkpa Ezayi nalii étɛp'ɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«Mot ngɔt ɛpetuud kɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Koobalka mɛze ɛ Ghɛŋ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Tuuka nyɛ mɛze mɛ na looba-looba!”»<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Kaad Zaŋ nadi ebɔt ɛ nasael ɛ́ nɛ mya mɛ boo yaaga kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bhɛtɛ ket é kuu. Nyɛ nadedɛ ɛ́ etsemaaka nɛ egho. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Bot ɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm nɛ bot ɛ kyee dik Yude djas, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ nadidi mbaka-mbaka nɛ dii Yuldɛn ɔ nadi ezyɛ pɛ daa lɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Bɛ nadi evaa mesyem mɔɔ é mis mɛ bot. Bhii tak ɔ, Zaŋ zɛduu bɛ Zɛɛb tɔ dii Yuldɛn.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Dáa Zaŋ nabee náá, bɛtɛ nɛ eFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ nadi ezyɛ pɛ daa lɛ ɛbuɛpe zɛduwa Zɛɛb ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ mbyak mɛgel mak! Ɛzɛ lyo bin náá, bi kaab ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb ze kunaa nɛ ɛzyɛ enek? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Lyaalka nɛ esesɛɛ bin náá, ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi eezeliig elyem bin. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Betka ɛke biyɔ nɛ biyɔ náá: “Dhiiti sonok aanàkwaasa mena, etɛɛ náá: Abalaam ɛ́ bhaab'enaka.” Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛliig mɛkok mak ye liiza bɛdha ɛ Abalaam. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Ye nyɔ ɛ́ bi gu náá, zoŋ moo ɛ́ nɛɛga é ɛbok ɛ le étɛp ye neetsaal ekaŋal e tak. Ele ee di ààdjɛ mbɛɛ bhum ɔ djas, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkwyalaa. Bhii tak, da ye ɛ́ kɛmwasaa tɔ du.<verse eid="MAT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>«Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mam duu bin Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ mɛdii, étɛp ye neelyaal náá, bi eezeliig elyem. Yɛ kabɛ mot di zyɛ bhis'am ɔ, nyɛ aaduu bin Zɛɛb ɛ́, tɔ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ nɛ du. Nyɛ eedhaa mɛ nɛ mɛbwala. Mam aanàkwaakobela-bela duu ɛmalal étɛp ɛkotii-tiiak ekel ekoko bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Tɔ mɛmbɔ mɛ, nyɛ eemɛt wal étɛp nyɛ neewa mbɛk pak ezeeza nɛ bhum. Ezeeza pak wat, mbɛɛ bhum yak pak. Tin, nyɛ waakwom mbɛɛ bhum tɔ taa. Yɛ kabɛ ezeeza ɔ, nyɛ kakɛmwas yɛ ɛ tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛduwa Zɛɛb ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Dhiiti dwoo Yezu naazɛdus pɛ kyee dik Ghalile zɛkum pɛ dii Yuldɛn pɛ kyee Zaŋ nadi ɛ́, étɛp nyɛ needuwa Zɛɛb dáa Zaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Wɔ gwaa Zaŋ zɛbyen yɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Ye ɛ́ mam ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛzyɛ, zɛduwa Zɛɛb pɛ daa lɔ. Ghuna ye ɛ́ wɔy ɛ́ kazyɛ pɛ daa lam e!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ goka ɛ́ wɔ myaal náá, ye sɛ́ɛ deenek é ɛwala ɛlak. Etɛɛ náá, deenek mena sa ɛ́ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb.» Tin, Zaŋ ɛ́ boo zɛmyaal. <verse eid="MAT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Dáa Yezu naduwa Zɛɛb ɛ, wyisa nyɛ nazowyis tɔ mɛdii ɛ, é di tak wat, wɔ gwaa gwoo zɛbɛŋel kɔ ɛko ɛ lɛ. Bhii tak, Sisim na Dɛɛ eezyɛ, zɛsul kɔ lɛ tyee ɛghum. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Dhiiti gwood eezɛgék tɔ gwoo náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ mɔn'am mɛ di kwyɛl ɔ. Mɛ eedyeebamyaala nɛ nɛ ɛbuɛpe.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Mɛbhowal ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Bhii tak, Sisim Zɛɛb eezɛwyel Yezu, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, etɛɛ náá, Dim mot mɛkɔŋ neekɛwa nyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Dáa nyɛ nazɛtsi edee étɛp mendjaala tyee mɛlu mɛkam-mɛná nɛ epum mɛkam-mɛná ɛ, za naazɛsa nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Tin, Satan, Mot mɛbhowal eezɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, kea nɛ mɛkok mak náá, ye liiza emapa.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Yezu eezebɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ekwyala ɛ Zɛɛb lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">“Ye tok emapa nɛ emapa di esa náá, mot di nɛ tsik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">Mot tsak ɛ́ nɛ mɛkpa djas di edus tɔ nuub Zɛɛb ɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Dɛt 8.3</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Bhii tak, Dim mot mɛkɔŋ eebaazɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ghaada na dɛɛ. Nyɛ eezɛgel nyɛ kɔ nges Ndjaa-ebuwa. <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>Nyɛy nɛ Yezu náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn Zɛɛb ɔɔ, tsela, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛduma pɛ si, etɛɛ náá, ekwyala ɛ Zɛɛb lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waake nɛ efofop bɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">Bɛ bɛp wɔ nɛ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">é kaab náá, wɔ ɛ́ zɛkɛbema ɛbɛk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Mɛd 91.11-12</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ekwyala baalɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Sa wɔ ààwa Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'ɔ tɔ mɛbhowal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Dɛt 6.16</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Dim mot mɛkɔŋ eebaazɛnɔɔ nyɛ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ kɔ dhiiti ɛtsok ɛ na vyɛɛgvyɛɛg. Nyɛ eezɛtel nyɛ mɛyoŋ mɛ bɔs djas nɛ mɛkas nɛ enɛm tak djas. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>Dim mot mɛkɔŋ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ waadjɛ wɔ esesɛɛ bak djas, wɔ kwyit mɛboŋ mɔ si mɛko mam, da wɔ ɛ́ duwal mɛ ɔɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Dusa tin, Satan! Etɛɛ náá, ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">“Ye ɛ́ Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'ɔ ɛ́ wɔ di egoka nɛ ɛduwal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">Wɔ goka nɛ ɛsa ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ met.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Dɛt 6.13</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>É sok'enek, Dim mot mɛkɔŋ eezɛbet nyɛ, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ yɛ. É di'enek, wɔ gwak efofop zokazyɛ zɛkwyee nyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eekan ɛsa mɛsa mɛ tɔ kyee dik Ghalile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Bhis Yezu nagwak náá, Zaŋ naamɛtaa é mbok ɛ, nyɛ naazɛtɔ́ pɛ Ghalile. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkosulal kɔ ghaada Nazalɛt. Tin, nyɛ nakwos ɛ́ ɛkɛdi pɛ ghaada Kapɛlnaum, ghaada tak nadi ɛ́ mbaka-mbaka nɛ boo soob na djato-djato Ghalile, pɛ pak kyee dik ɛ Zabulɔn nɛ Neftali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ngoolel-mɛkpa Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ́ neebela ɛsuk:<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>«Ekyee mɛdhik mɛ Zabulɔn nɛ Neftali</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">pɛ kyee ze boo soob na djato-djato pɛ yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">Ghalile, pɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda di ɔ! <verse eid="MAT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Mbyak di tɔ ghooghom ɛ waabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">boo ngel gwyɛ é kas tɔ lɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ di ekɔɔla tɔ ghooghom pɛ kyee dik ɛsyee ɔ, gwyes ɛ́ waakas kɔ lɔɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:23-9:1">Eza 8.23—9.1</ref> </char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Kana ɛwala ɛlenek, Yezu naazɛkan ɛlyo bot náá: «Liigka elyem, etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, yɛ eezekunaa!»<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ yii mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Dhiiti dwoo Yezu nadi ekɛ mbaka-mbaka nɛ boo soob na djato-djato e Ghalile. Dáa nyɛ nabee bɛlael ɛ mɛwyet bɛbá, dhyeeb nɛ tel, bɔɔ ela mɛwyet ɛ. Bot ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ Simɔŋ, mot nagetaa Pyɛɛd ɔ, zɛnɔɔ dhyeeb Andele ela ɛwyet tɔ dii. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Duka mɛ, mɛ waasa náá, bi di bɛlael ɛ mɛwyet étɛp ɛmɛt ɛ bot.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>É di'enek wat, bɛ eezɛdhuugal mɛwyet mɔɔ, étɛp ɛdu Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Bhii Yezu nakɛ ba «zii» ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛboma nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛsis, dhyeeb nɛ tel, Zak bɛ nɛ mɔn ɛ nyɛɛg Zaŋ, bɔn ɛ Zɛbɛdɛ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ elɛɛd, ekoobal mɛwyet mɔɔ, bɛ nɛ sɛɛg'ɔɔ. Tin, Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>É di'enek wat, bɛ eezɛdhuugal elɛɛd nɛ sɛɛg'ɔɔ, bɛ eezɛdu Yezu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu moo lyo nɛ ɛtsik ɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Tin, Yezu naazɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Ghalile djas, nyɛ nadi edjɛ mɛlyo tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nadi pɛ kyee dik tak ɛ. Nyɛ nadi egoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal dum nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛbaatsik bot ɛ nazyɛ nɛ mɛbɛ́ membi nɛ membi ɔ nɛ bot ɛ nadi nɛ edjam ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Ye nabɛ ɛ́, menduk mɛ naakɛ kɔ kyee dik Siili djas. Bɛ ɛ́ boodi zezyɛ nyɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi nɛ mɛbɛ́ membi nɛ membi ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ embee esisim nadi edhe-dhek ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ nadi ebil djem ɔ nɛ eboka e bot. Yezu zokatsik bɔɔ djas. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi edu nyɛ ɔ, nadudus ɛ́ pɛ Ghalile, pɛ pak eghaada kam, pɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm, pɛ Yude nɛ bot ɛ kyee dik nadi pɛ yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdjɛ bot mɛlyo kɔ ɛtsok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Dáa Yezu nabee ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk ɛ, nyɛ naazɛbyet kɔ ɛtsok, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel'ɛ, disi. Bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛdisi e ngwoob'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>Nyɛ eezɛni é djɛ bɛ mɛlyo:<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɛtɛ mɛmyaala</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>«Mɛnyɔ nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot tɔ sisim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, ye ɛ́ yɔbɔ.<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di edje nenak ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:4">etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadis ghoŋ di tɔ elyem bɔɔ ɛ!<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di etela ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:5">etɛɛ náá, bɛ waabela kyee bɔs Zɛɛb nakɛk bɛ ɛ!<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ za nɛ gwyes ɛsa ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:6">etɛɛ náá, bɛ waadɛ, djil!<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di gek bot ɛsis ghoŋ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:7">etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waagek bɛ ghoŋ!<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ mbɛɛ elyem ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:8">etɛɛ náá, bɛ waabee Zɛɛb.<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di esaa egwyem pak'ɔɔ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:9">etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadiig bet náá, bɛ ɛ́ bɔn bɛ!<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Mɛnyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di tɔ tsik mezuk ɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">etɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛpesa ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, ye ɛ́ yɔbɔ!<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>Mɛnyɔ nɛ nen, yɛ bɛ náá, bot ɛpelee bin ɔ, nɛ ɛwa bin tɔ tsik mezuk ɔ, bɛ di esu bin etɛp mbɛs ɔ, nɛ ɛbaasaab dék'en, étɛp'am ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Myaalaka, da bi ɛ́ bɔl zɛŋ, etɛɛ náá, boo etuud bin ɛ́ nɛɛga pɛ tɔ gwoo. Etɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ bɛ nazuk bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nazyɛ ɛsok nɛ nen ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛdjekel ɛ́ mɛsɔn nɛ mɛkas kɔ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>«Ye ɛ́ biyɔ ɛ́ di mɛsɔn kɔ bɔs. Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛsɔn moo ɛ́, ààkagwom ɔ, ye goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsaaa dáa étɛp mɛsɔn neebaagwom? Deenek mɛsɔn aakadi ɛ́, ààbɛ nɛ mɛsa mɛ yɛ aasaaa nɛ yɛ ɛ. Deenek, ye goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛmwasaa pɛ kel, da bot ɛ́ nyal yɛ.<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>«Ye ɛ́ biyɔ ɛ́ di mɛkas kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs. Dɛl ɛ di suma kɔ ɛtsok ɔ, tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi syela. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Wɔ aanàkwaatuub lama, da wɔ ɛ́ wa yɛ si bhe. Yɛ ààseaa deenek, ye goka nɛ ɛkɛlaa ɛ́, pɛ kɔ tɛɛg é di bot djas aadi tɔ gwyɛ tak ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Deenek ɛ́ di egoka náá, mɛkas men nyen tɔ bot, étɛp bot neebee mɛnyɔ mɛ esesɛɛ bi di esa ɛ, étɛp bɛ needuwal Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ etsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>«Nàkeka náá, mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛgó etsi ɛ Moiiz nɛ mɛlyo mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ ɛ. Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ zɛgó etsi, mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛlyaal mɛsuk mɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Dáa ye di náá, gwoo nɛ bɔs dinaa ààpaadum ɛ, ye tok nɛ sa wat aadisaa tɔ etsi. Ye nakoozodi ba moo ɛtɔn nɛghu ba moo kyeeb, sa wat aanàdus tɔ etsi kɛkum dwoo mɛsik mɛ etɛp djas. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Étɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, mot aazodis tsi wat, ye nakoozotɔɔl, da nyɛ ɛ́ lyo bɔn nyɛɛg náá, bɛ sa dáa nyɛ sa ɔ, yenɔk aadi ɛ́, mɔɔ dhyeeb tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Tin, mot di eduwal etsi da nyɛ ɛ́ lyo bɔn nyɛɛg náá, bɛ sa dáa nyɛy ɔ, yenɔk aadi ɛ́ boo-mot tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Epiki bin é mis mɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ di ààdhaa yii bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaani tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp ɛbuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak náá, nyɛ nake nɛ bɛbhaab bina náá: “Sa wɔ ààgó mot. Mot ɛ́ gó sɔ mot ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ ye tɔ́aa nɛ nɛ é mis mɛ bɛtetɛp, nyɛ neepɛ́ɛaa.” <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Mot djas aagwak ɛbuk nɛ mɔn nyɛɛg ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bɛtetɛp pɛ́ɛ nyɛ. Mot aake nɛ sɔ mot náá, “wɔ ɛ́ wo ɔ”, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nyɛ tɔ́ kɛpɛ́ɛaa pɛ boo zɛɛga bɛtetɛp eYuda. Mot aake nɛ sɔ mot náá, “wɔ ɛ́ ndjemet ɔ”, ye goka ɛ́ náá, nyɛ kɛmwasaa tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛpetɔ́ pɛ mesa ebuwa étɛp ɛkɛduwal Zɛɛb nɛ esa bɔ ɔɔ, tin, wɔ siiza náá, mɔn nyoog ɛ́ nɛ tɛp nyɛ di ebwak wɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>pookobet esa e duu tak kɔ mesa ebuwa. Da wɔ ɛ́ pookokɛgwakel nɛ mɔn nyoog. Bhii tak ɛ wɔ aakazyɛ, zɛkaa Zɛɛb.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>«Mot ɛ́ kɛpit wɔy ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ di etɔ́ pɛ dáa bɛtetɛp ɔɔ, lela ɛgwakel nɛ nɛ é di bi dinaa é ze yenek, é kaab náá, mot tak ɛ́ zɛkɛka wɔ é mis mɛ bɛtetɛp. Bhii tak, da bɛtetɛp ɛ́ djɛ wɔ é mɛmbɔ mɛ esodja, da bɛ ɛ́ wa wɔ é membok. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Wɔ aanàkwaawyis tin, wɔ di ààtuud dɔɔ nɛ falanga ɛsik ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp mɛzɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak náá: “Sa wɔ ààsa ɛzɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Tin, mam kalɛɛ nɛ nen ɛ náá, motom djas aagwyák mwaa sɔ, da ɛ́ wyeeb nyɛ tɔ lyem ɔ, yenɔk tak eezesa ɛzɔ nɛ moma tak tɔ lyem'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, ye ɛ́ dis ɛ kyee mbɔ eghɛŋ bɔ ɛ́ di ebelal wɔ náá, wɔ sa mesyem ɔ, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛpiid ɛ yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ mwas yɛ ɛtsetaɛpe. Yɛ aadi ɛ́, ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ nɔ náá, wɔ dis dhiiti kyee nyel'ɔ, ààkabɛ náá, wɔ kɛdyak tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm nɛ nyel'ɔ djas. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, ye ɛ́, mbɔ eghɛŋ bɔ ɛ́ di esa náá, wɔ syem ɔ, tsaala yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ mwas yɛ ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɔ. Yɛ aadi ɛ́, ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ nɔ náá, wɔ tsaal dhiiti kyee nyel'ɔ, ààkabɛ náá, wɔ kɛdyak tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm nɛ nyel'ɔ djas.»<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ ɛbel ɛ ɛba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naabaake náá: “Mot ɛpɛɛ myɛl ɔɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdjɛ nyɛ mɛkana mɛ ɛbel ɛ ɛba.” <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔ, mɛ ke ɛ́ náá: motom djas di epɛɛ myɛl, ààmɛt nyɛ nɛ sa etsi di elu ɔ, motom tak saŋ ɛ́ náá, moma tak di moma mɛzɔ nyɛ baatɔ́ ɛba ɛ sis ɔɔ. Tin, motom aaba moma zebyenaa é ɛba ɔ, nyɛy baasa ɛ́ ɛzɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ ɛtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak dáa bɛ nake nɛ bɛbhaab binaka náá: “Sa wɔ ààgwakel nɛ mot, da wɔ ɛ́ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ bhii tak wɔ kadi ɛ́ ààsa sa wɔ nakɛk ɛ. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ sa sa wɔ kɛk é mis mɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá, sa mot ààtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ, da ɛ́ nɔɔ gwoo dáa tyaasɛs, etɛɛ náá, penek ɛ́ pɛ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ Zɛɛb di ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>Sa mot ààtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ nɛ bɔs, etɛɛ náá, bɔs ɛ́ di Zɛɛb di enyal nɛ mɛko mɛ ɔ. Sa mot ààtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ nɛ din ɛ Yeluzalɛm, etɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ ghaada ɛ boo Mɛkoozi. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Sa wɔ ààtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ, da ɛ́ wa lo'ɔ é ban, etɛɛ náá, wɔ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛswoola bhoo lo'ɔ náá, ye bhilal nɛghu ye pum. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ eemyaal tɛp ɔɔ, kea “Iyoo”. Yɛ kabɛ náá, wɔ eebyen ɔɔ, kea “ooh”, etɛɛ náá, ekɛla-ekɛla ee bot dyeebakɛl kɔ étɛp'enek dyeebadus ɛ́ pɛ daa Mbee mot.»<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp ɛbulal ɛ embee esesɛɛ bɛ sa wɔ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak náá: “Mot ɛ́ tuu sɔ dis ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, nyɛ baatuuaa yɛ. Mot ɛ́ bwak wɔ ɛdjɛ ɔɔ, da wɔy ɛ́ baabwak nyɛ ɛdjɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Deenek, mam kalɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Sa mot ààbulal ɛbiyo nɛ ɛbiyo. Mot ɛ́ nyuu wɔ bɛɛz é ɛmuk pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɔ, baaka nyɛ yak kyee ɛmuk. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Mot ɛ́ di esaa wɔ nɛ etɛp étɛp nyɛ neenɔɔ kuwa yɔ ɔɔ, beta nyɛ, nyɛ baanɔɔ dɔɔ nɛ ndjookuwa yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Mot ɛ́ besal wɔ náá, wɔ kɛ nɛŋ wat ɔɔ, kɛa enɛŋ ebá. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Gwyena nɛ mot di ewaab wɔ sonok ɔ. Yɛ bɛ náá, mot eenɔɔ sa yɔ ɔɔ, sa wɔ ààkabaakɛdu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Klisto eelyaal bɛdjekel bɛ náá, bɛ kwyɛl bot ɛ di bhina bɛ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>«Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naagwak náá: “Ye goka ɛ́, wɔ kwyɛl sɔ'ɔ mot, da wɔ ɛ́ byen mot mɛbhuka mɔ.” <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Yɛ bɛ mam ɔ, mɛ kalɛɛ bin ɛ náá: kwyɛlka bot ɛ mɛbhuka men. Djaalaka Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ di ezuk bin ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>Deenek ɛ́ bi aadi bɔn Sɛɛg'en di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb sa ɛ́ náá, gwyes kas kɔ bot djas: bɛmbee ɛ bot nɛ bɛtɛtɛ ɛ bot. Tyee wat, Zɛɛb sil bhi ɛ́, étɛp bot ɛ di sosoob ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ sosoob ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛzokwyɛl ɛ́ bot ɛ di ekwyɛl bin ɔ, étɛp ye bi di bun náá, bi ɛ́ waabela efute aadus pɛ ɛko ɛ? Dɔɔ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo zobaakwyɛl ɛ́, bot ɛ di ekwyɛl bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, bi zoswos ɛ́ bɔn nyɛɛg bin ɔ, bi bee tin ɛ́ náá, bi ɛpesa enɛm esa? Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, bɔɔ pe zobaasa ɛ deenek! <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Dika nɛ mbɛɛ elyem dáa Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ di nɛ mbɛɛ lyem ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ ɛgwyena nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>«Bi ɛ́ kotiibal dum nɛ dáa bi di esa enɛm esa nɛ bot étɛp ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Bi ɛ́ sa deenek é mis mɛ bot, étɛp bot djas neeke náá: “Biyɔ ɛ́ di bɛmbɛɛ bot” ɔ. Deenek, bi ɛ́ sa deenek ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaabela efute e Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo aadjɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>Wɔ kwyɛl ɛdjɛ djel mot sonok ɔɔ, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa yɛ tɔ sɔ, sa mot ààgu. Nàsa dáa bot ɛ luwalɛŋ di sa tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nɛ é egba ɛ. Bɛ sa deenek ɛ́ étɛp bot needuwal bɛ. Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Mbi bot binɔk eezebela yɔbɔ efute. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, mbɔ eghɛŋ bɔ ɛpedjɛ djel mot sonok ɔɔ, yɛ àànyɔ náá, mbɔ myɛl ɛ lɔ gu. <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Etɛɛ náá, ye goka ɛ́ náá, sa wɔ djɛ mot ɛ, ye di sɔ. Tin, Sɛɛg'en, mot di egu dáa wɔ di ekwyee bot tɔ sɔ ɛ, nyɛ waadjɛ wɔ yɔ efute.»<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ di edjaala ɔɔ, nàdika dáa bot ɛ di nɛ lualɛŋ, bɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛdjaala ɛ metetel tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nɛ é bɛman, étɛp bot neebee bɛ. Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: bot binɔk eezebela yɔbɔ efute. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔ, wɔ kwyɛl ɛdjaala Zɛɛb ɔɔ, nia tɔ dhɛŋ'ɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ diyal ɛbɛ. Bhii tak, da wɔ ɛ́ djaala nɛ Soog di tɔ di sɔ ɔ. Tin, Soog, mot di ebee esesɛɛ wɔ di esa tɔ sɔ ɔ, nyɛ waadjɛ wɔ efute.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>«É sok bi di edjaala ɛ́, sa mot ààbasal ɛkpa wat esok nɛ esok gwyes dáa bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Bɔɔ gek ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waagwak bɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nɛ bil mɛkpa ɛbuɛpe tɔ mendjaala mɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Sa mot ààbaŋa bɛ, etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛg'en nɛ gu sa elyem bin di ekwos ɛ, ɛsok nɛ bi nɛ waab nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Deenek, Gwakeka dáa bi di egoka nɛ ɛdjaala ɛ. Keka náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“Sɛɛg'es di tɔ gwoo ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">ye goka ɛ́ náá, mot nɛ mot gu náá, wɔ ɛ́ Zɛɛb na Dɛɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Mɛkoozi mɔ zyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">Beta náá, ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ sael kɔ bɔs, dáa ye di sael pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Djɛa bis mɛlu nɛ mɛlu edee di egoka nɛ nes ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Pela ɛbiyo ɛ bis zesa ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:12">etɛɛ náá, bisɔ pe, bis ɛpepel bot ɛ nazesa bis ɛbiyo ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Sa wɔ ààbet bis tɔ mɛbhowal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">Pɛka bis é mɛmbɔ mɛ Mbee mot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[etɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ wɔy ɛ́ di nɛ Mɛkoozi, nɛ mɛbwala, nɛ duma na kɔm-kɔm.]”»<verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>«Guka náá: Bi ɛ́ pel ɛbiyo ɛ bot ɛ di etɔ́ nɛ ɛsa bin ɔ, Sɛɛg'en di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ waabaapel yebɔ pe. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Tin, yɛ kabela náá, bi ààpel bɛsɔ bin ɔɔ, Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ aanàkwaabaapel ɛbiyo ɛ bi di esa ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp ɛtsi ɛ edee étɛp mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>«Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛpetsi edee ɔɔ, sa mot ààdi nɛ bhwoob ghoŋ dáa bot ɛ di nɛ lualɛŋ ɔ. Bɛ lyaal bhwoob ghoŋ deenek ɛ́, étɛp bot djas neegu náá, bɛ ɛpetsi edee. Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: bot binɔk eezebela yɔbɔ efute. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔ, wɔ tsi edee ɔɔ, gwyiia bhwoob, da wɔ ɛ́ lɔɔb mul é lo, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>etɛɛ náá, bot needi ààgu náá, wɔ ɛpetsi edee. Tin, ye ɛ́ Soog mot di tɔ sɔ ɔ di egu, deenek Soog, mot di ebee esesɛɛ djas wɔ di sa tɔ sɔ ɔ, nyɛ waadjɛ wɔ efute.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekum pɛ daa Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>«Nàsaaka ɛdi ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ekum é bɔs'ak. Ekum ee di náá, bɛsɛs nɛ emaa ɛ́ waapul ɛ. Ekum ee di náá, bot ɛ djii ɛ́ waakwak ɛbo ɛ ndjaa, da ɛ́ djii, nɔɔ, tɔ́ nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Kwomka ekum bin pɛ daa Zɛɛb. Penek, bot ɛ djii aanàkwaani kɛdjii yɛ, bɛsɛs nɛ emaa aanàkwaapul yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Etɛɛ náá, é di mot di ekwom esa bɛ ɔ, lyem'ɛ di ɛ́ tin.»<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lama nyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>«Mis mɛ mot ɛ́ dáa lama nyel. Yɛ bɛ náá, mis mɔ ɛpenyaasok ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, gua náá, nyel'ɔ djas ɛ́ tɔ selele. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Yɛ kabɛ náá, mis mɔ ɛpekpaŋ ɔɔ, nyel'ɔ djas ɛ́ tɔ ghooghom. Yɛ kabɛ náá, ngel di tɔ lɔ eezedim ɔɔ, tin, kwaa yenek mɛghomla aanɔŋel nɛ yé?»<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nɛghu epata, nɛghu Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>Mot ngɔt aanàkwaadi mot-mɛsa mɛ ekukuma ebá. Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, nyɛ waabhina ngɔt, da nyɛ ɛ́ kwyɛl nwyak ngɔt, nɛghu nyɛ kaseya nɛ mot ɛsok ɔɔ, nyɛ waapɛɛ nwyak ngɔt. Bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb nɛ mɛsa mɛ epata é di wat.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>«Étɛp tak ɛ́ mɛ di elɛɛ nɛ nen náá: Nàbemka ba dum nɛ tɛp edee, nɛ gwyes mɛdii nɛ tɛp eduuba. Etɛɛ náá, tsik eedhaa edee nɛ mɛnyɔ. Nyel eedhaa ekaad nɛ mɛtaŋ. Etsal é? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Beeka enen pɛ ɛko, bɛ ààbɛ epyeeb, ààbɔ́k edee di ewum tɔ epyeeb ɛ. Bɛ ààkwom edee tɔ mɛbhwaa nɛ kɔ etaa. Tin, dhi Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ, di djɛ bɛ edee! Bi ààpadhaa enen nɛ boo mɛtaŋ é mis mɛ Zɛɛb é? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛpebem ba ɔɔ, ɛzɛ pak'en di nɛ ghwyil ɛbil ba ɛlu ɛ wat kɔ mɛlu mɛ tsik'ɛ?»<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>«Étɛp ye bi di bem ba kɔ ɛsu ɛ ekaad? Beeka dáa mɛzɛm di ekwyil nɛ wyee tɔ pyeeb ɛ. Mɛzɛm mɛ tak ààsa mɛsa, ààlat ekaad. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Tin, mɛ ɛpelɛɛ bin náá, dɔɔ nɛ Salomɔŋ, nɛ boo duu yɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ mbɛɛ kaad na nyɔ dhaa wat tɔ kɔkɔ mɛzɛm menek. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛpebet eka ee di tɔ dik mos, da djɛmɛn ye ɛ́ nɔŋaa, dikaa tɔ du ɔɔ, tin, nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsa deenek nɛ lyem'ɛ met étɛp'en é? Ye nakoozodi náá, bi tok nɛ boo ɛmyaal nɛ nɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>«Nàbemka ba é ɛkeke náá: “Mena aadɛka yé? Mena aadɛka yaa mɛdii? Mena aabɔtka yé?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Yenek djas, ye ɛ́ bot ɛ bɔs ɛ́ di ebwos esesɛɛ binek mɛlu djas. Tin, Sɛɛg'en mot di tɔ gwoo ɔ nɛ gu náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes tak. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Pookosaaka sok Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tsik tɔ epiki nyɛ di ewaab ɛ. Tin, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadjɛ bin esa djas bi di nɛ gwyes tak ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Nàbemka ba nɛ etɛp aasael djɛmɛn ɛ, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee djɛmɛn aagwyɛ lo ɛ́ nyɛ ɛmet. Dwoo nɛ dwoo ɛ́ nɛ yɛ ɛkwosak.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Klisto eelyaal bɛdjekel bɛ náá, sa bɛ ààpɛ́ɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>«Sa bi ààdidi é pɛ́ɛ bot, deenek Zɛɛb aanàkwaapɛ́ɛ bin. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb aapɛ́ɛ bin ɛ dáa bi di epɛ́ɛ bɛsɔ bin ɛ. Nyɛ aalwoodal bhwaŋ'en ɛ dáa bi di elwoodal bhwaa bɛsɔ bin ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>É tɛp yé wɔ gwyák kwyɛɛzyoŋ di tɔ dis ɛ sɔ'ɔ mot, wɔ kadi ɛ́ ààbee pek le di tɔ dis ɛ lɔ ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Wɔ nàkwaake nɛ sɔ'ɔ mot náá: “Mɔn nyaag'am, beta mɛ dis kwyɛɛzyoŋ tɔ dis ɛ lɔ,” wɔy ààbɛ é bee pɛk le di tɔ yɔ dis ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Wɔy mot mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si, pookodis sok pɛk le tɔ dis ɛ lɔ ɛ! Bhii tak ɛ́ wɔ waanyaa sok, étɛp wɔ needis kwyɛɛzyoŋ di tɔ dis ɛ mɔn nyoog ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>«Nàdjɛka esa ee di dɛɛ ɛ nɛ bɛbhyɛ, é kaab náá, bhii tak bɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛbula zɛduma wɔ é nyel nɛ mɛkwaala. Nàmwaska mɛvunga sok bhwoob bɛghwyee, é kaab náá, bɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛnyal yɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Waabka, saaka, diigka é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>«Waabka, bi ɛ́ waadjɛaa. Saaka, bi ɛ́ waabela. Diigka, bɛ waadii bin ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Étɛp tak ɛ́ ye di náá, mot ɛ́ waab ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛpedjɛaa. Mot ɛ́ saŋ ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛpebela. Ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaŋ aadiiaa ɛ́, étɛp mot diig ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Ye ɛ́ nɛ mot ngɔt pak'en di nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ mɔn'ɛ ɛkok bela náá, mɔn waab ɛ́ mapa? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Nɛghu ɛzɛ di nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ mɔn nyɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɛ ke deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, eYuda ààdɛ bɛnyɔ.</char></note>, yɛ bɛ náá, mɔn waab ɛ́ su ɔɔ? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Kwyii biyɔ, bɛmbee ɛ bot, di gu ɛdjɛ embɛɛ esonok nɛ bɔn bin, gwyata nɛ Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ aapaadi ààdjɛ embɛɛ esonok nɛ mot aawaab nyɛ sonok ɔ!<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>«Kanka ɛsa sok nɛ bɛsɔ bin esesɛɛ bi di ekwyɛl náá, bot sa bin yɛ ɛ. Deenek ɛ́ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz nɛ yii bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di elyo.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa na maad-maad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>«Nika tɔ ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa na maad-maad, etɛɛ náá, ze di eniigal mot pɛ dɛl ɛ ɛsyee ɛ, ye nɛ bɔk. Bɛtɛ nɛ bot dyeebakwyɛl ɛdhaŋ ɛ́ penek. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Tin, guka náá, ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa tak nɛ maad, bela náá, pɛ ze di edul bot pɛ ze tsik ɛ, ye nɛ pata. Étɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, bot ɛbuɛpe ààdyeebadu yɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>«Bi ɛ́ di nɛ etsoŋ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ. Bɛ zyɛ pɛ daa len ɛ́, nɛ ɛzaaba dáa mɔn ɛ taa, ghuna bɛ ɛ́ eben, bɛ zosyel ɛ mya mɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Bi aagu bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ tak ɛ nɛ mɛfulu mɔɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bum le vin ààbɔ́kaa tɔ mɛkpak mɛ mɛgɔk nɛghu bum fiig kɔ le mɛgɔk. <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Etɛɛ náá, mbɛɛ le zodjɛ ɛ́ mbɛɛ bhum. Mbee le kadjɛ ɛ́ mbee bhum. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Mbɛɛ le tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ mbee bhum. Tyee wat nɛ mbee le. Ye tok nɛ ghwyil djɛ mbɛɛ bhum. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Ele djas di ààdjɛ bhum ɛ, ye goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkwyalaa, bhii tak da ye ɛ́ mwasaa tɔ du. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Étɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, bi aagu bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ tak ɛ́ nɛ embee mɛfulu mɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛlɛɛ nɛ ɛsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>«Ye tok bot djas di djóo mɛ: “Ghɛŋ, Ghɛŋ!” ɔ, aani tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ. Bot aani ɛ́, ye ɛ́ bot ɛ di esa ɛkwosak ɛ Saag'am di tɔ gwoo ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>É dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ waake nɛ nam náá: “Ghɛŋ, Ghɛŋ”, ye ɛ́ nɛ din ɛ lɔ ɛ bis nadi bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb! Etsal é? Ye ɛ́ nɛ din ɛ lɔ ɛ bis nadi esesɔ mɛlyeeb! Etsal é? Ye ɛ́ nɛ din ɛ lɔ ɛ bis nasa bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala! Etsal é? <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Tin, mɛ waalɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ é mis mɛ bot náá: “Mɛ nabɛ ààgu bin. Duska é mis mam, tɔ́ka ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nam, biyɔ, bot ɛ di esa embee esesɛɛ ɔ!”»<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mendjaa membá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>«Gwakeka, mɛ pookolyaal bin mbi mot zyɛ pɛ daa lam ɔ. Nyɛ gwak mɛkpa mam, da nyɛ ɛ́ kɛ tyee tak ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot etsoŋ di esum ndjaŋ'ɛ kɔ ɛkok ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Wɔ gwaa bhi zɛnee ɛbuɛpe, tyee bhyoŋ natuula nɛ ghuu na lyel-lyel ɛ, ye naanyuŋa é ndjaŋ'enek. Ààbik, etɛɛ náá, ndjaa tak nasumel ɛ́, ɛnyɔɛpe kɔ ɛkok. <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>Tin, mot di egwak mɛkpa mam, da nyɛ ɛ́ kadi ààkɛ tyee mɛkpa mɛ tak di elɛɛ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ dáa ndjemet mot di esum ndjaa kɔ bɔs bɛsyɛ, ààwyɛl epap kɔ ɛkok ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Dáa bhi nakanee ɛbuɛpe ɛ, tin, tyee bhyoŋ nakatuula ɛ, ghuu na lyel-lyel eezɛnyuŋa é epap e ndjaŋ'enek, epap eezɛbik “syɛɛɛ” é di tak wat.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eghɛŋ ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Dáa Yezu nasilal ɛlyo bɛmɛlyo mɛ ɛ, mɛdhuu mɛ bot naadyeebadjoka dáa nyɛ nadi elelyo ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààlyo dáa bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nalelyo ɛ́, nyɛ nalelyo ɛ́, nɛ eghɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik dhiiti mot nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Dáa Yezu nasul kɔ ɛtsok ɛ, zukamwaa nɛ mot naazɛdu nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Tin, wɔ gwaa dhiiti mot nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɔ, zɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si, zɛdjaala nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ! Mɛ nɛ gu náá: wɔ kwyɛl ɔɔ, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik mɛ, nyel'am bula dɛɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛsɛɛb mbɔ, mɛt nyɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ eekwyɛl. Tsaka!» É di tak wat, wɔ gwaa, ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam mot'enɔk zɛsi. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Gwaka mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe: Sa wɔ ààlɛɛ mot sa dhaa wak ɛ. Tɔ́a, kɛlyaal nyel pɛ daa bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛdjɛ esa e ɛgwyena dáa Moiiz nalyo ɛ, étɛp wɔ neelyaal bot djas náá, wɔ eetsak.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik mot-mɛsa ɛ komanda esodja e Lɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Dáa Yezu nadi eni tɔ ghaada Kapɛlnaum ɛ, wɔ gwaa dhiiti kukuma tɔ lɔɔg esodja zɛzyɛ pɛ daa lɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ zɛkwyee nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, mot-mɛsa mam ngɔt ɛ́ ndjaasi pɛ ndjaŋ'am, nyɛ eezesɔɔb nyɛ ɛpebɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ ɛpetɔ́, kɛtsik nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>É di'enek, kukuma tɔ lɔɔg esodja binɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, mam ɛ yam zɛ, wɔ neezɛni tɔ ndjaŋ'am. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ zolóo ɛkpa wat, étɛp mot-mɛsa mam neetsak. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Di mɛ di'aak, ye ɛ́ nɛ ekukuma bam ɛ, mɛ di egwak esesɛɛ mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛsa nɛ nɔɔ ɛ. Dɔɔ nɛ mam pe, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ esodja si mɛko mam. Mɛ ke nɛ nɔɔ: “Tɔ́ka” ɔɔ, bɛ ɛpetɔ́; “Bulaka” ɔɔ, bɛ ɛpebula; “Saka dáak” ɔɔ, bɛ ɛpesa.» <verse eid="MAT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Dáa Yezu nagwak eyala e kukuma yenɔk ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naadyeebamyaala. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ bot ɛ nadi egyee bɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: mɛ dinaa ààpaabee mot di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, kɔ Yisalaɛl dáa mot'ak. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Betka mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ waadus pɛ ɛbil ɛ dwoo nɛ pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo. Bɛ waazyɛ, zɛdi kɔ mesa wat, bɛ nɛ bɔn Abalaam, Izak nɛ Zakɔɔb tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Tin, bot ɛ nagoka nɛ ɛdi ɛ bot ɛ ɛyoŋ ɛ tak ɔ, bɛ aadi ɛ́, wusa pɛ kel, tɔ ghooghom pɛ baadi edje mɛgwyɛ nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ kukuma esodja binɔk náá: «Sika pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ etɛɛ náá, kɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb, Zɛɛb eedjɛ wɔ sa lyem'ɔ di ekwos ɛ!» É di tak wat, ye nabɛ ɛ́, mot-mɛsa ɛ kukuma esodja binɔk naatsak.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Yezu eezɛwyis, tɔ́ pɛ daa Pyɛɛd. Ghuna tsi yɛ yii moma nadi ɛ́ ndjaasi nɛ mɛkosa ɛkpaŋɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Nyɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ é mbɔ, mɛkosa eezɛsi. É di tak wat, moma yenɔk eezɛwyɛl, nyɛ moo zɛbe bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Dáa dwoo nadi esila ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛzyɛ nyɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛlyeeb nadi edhek ɔ. Dáa Yezu nadi elii kɔ membel menɔk ɛ, embee esisim nadi ewyis tɔ lɔɔ, tin, nyɛ naatsik dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ djas. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, esesɛɛ ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ́ neebela ɛsuk. Nyɛ nake ɛ́ náá: «Nyɛ naanɔɔ edjam bina nɛ mɛbɛ́ mena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Eza 53.4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛdu Yezu ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Bhii tak dáa Yezu nabee ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi edu nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá, bɛ sɛɛ dhaa pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Wɔ gwaa dhiiti ghaa mɛkana mɛ etsi zɛzyɛ pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Lyoel, mɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛdu ɛ wɔ é mɛze djas wɔ aadi tɔ́ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Deenek Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bɛbhɛk ɛ́ nɛ eku bɛ di djaasi tɔ tak ɛ, enen ɛ́ nɛ mɛk mɔɔ. Yɛ kabɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɔ, nyɛ tok nɛ zeza nɛ di nyɛ aadi ndiindil nɛ ɛdja ɛ gɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Dhiiti mot ngɔt pak bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, ɛsok nɛ mɛ nɛ du wɔ, pookobet mɛ, mɛ pookokɛdel saag'am.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Tin, Yezu eebɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Dua mɛ. Beta bot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ tsik ɔ, bɛ delel pak'ɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlyak ghuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛni tɔ boo elɛɛd sama wat nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Ààbɔya deenek, kasɛka ɛ́ boo ghuu na lyel-lyel eezɛkan ɛpupal kɔ boo soob na djato-djato. Mɛpupal mɛ tak eezɛghɛɛ ɛbhyeeb ɛ mɛdii zɛkɛɛza é elɛɛd. Ye kabela tin ɛ́, Yezu edja gɔ́. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Tin, bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛtiila pɛ pak nyɛ nadi tɔ elɛɛd ɛ. Bɛ eezɛdjem nyɛ nɛ etsim: «Ghɛŋ, tsika bis! Ɛsyee ɛ́ yak!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>É di'enek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu naazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di nɛ kɛŋ? Ɛbwaalel ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tɔɔl!» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛwyɛl, zɛbhɛm ghuu, nɛ dii, nyɛ eezɛlyak ghuu. Nyɛy nɛ dii náá: «Sila ghulal'ɔ ye di gwyem.» Wɔ gwaa, ghuu zɛsila, bhwak moo tin «kup». <verse eid="MAT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Bɔɔ djas nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naadyeebadjoka. Tin, bɔɔ náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ nwyaa kwaambi mot di náá, dɔɔ nɛ ghuu nɛ boo soob na djato-djato ɛpegwak nyɛ?»<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik bot ɛbá yii embee esisim nadi edhek ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Dáa Yezu nasɛɛ pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato pɛ kyee dik Ghadasa ɛ, wɔ gwaa bot ɛbá zɛtuula tɔ mɛvit, bɛ neezɛboma nɛ nɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ embee sisim nadi dhek ɔ, bɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ mbee mɛnyan dhaa tyɛ, bot nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛdhaa é ngwoob mɛvit mɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Bot binɔk moo tin etsim náá: «Bis sa wɔ yé, wɔy Mɔn Zɛɛb? Wɔ zyɛ wak ɛ́ zɛzɛm bis, sonok ɛwala ɛ tak dinaa ààdjala?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Ba ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ di tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee nadi egɔɔ tin ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Embee esisim eezɛdjaala nɛ Yezu, bɔɔ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl ɛsɔ bis ɔɔ, kyeeda bis tɔ ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee bak.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Yezu eezɛmyaal, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ tɔ́. Tin, wɔ gwaa embee esisim zɛwyis tɔ bot binɔk, zɛni tɔ ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee binɔk. Bhii tak, ɛsaa djas eezɛsul ɛtsok pɛ bɛ nadi ɛ́, kaab, kɛghaaga tɔ dii, bɔɔ djas si na «bhɛɛɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Bot ɛ nadi ebaal ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee tak ɔ, zokazɛkaab, sik pɛ dɛl. Bɛ moo tin ebaŋa bot ɛ dɛl edjema bɛ bee penek dum nɛ bot ɛbá binɔk. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Tin, wɔ gwaa bot ɛ dɛl djas zokazɛwyis, kɛboma nɛ Yezu. Dáa bɛ naboma nɛ nɛ ɛ, bɛ naazɛdjaala nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ dus kɔ kyee dik'ɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik dhiiti mot nazesɔɔb nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛni tɔ elɛɛd, sɛɛ boo soob na djato-djato, sik pɛ dɛl. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Tin, bɛdhiiti bot zokazyɛ nɛ mot ngɔt nazesɔɔb nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔ, byaala kɔ mwaala. Dáa Yezu nabee ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ bot ɛ nazyɛ nɛ mbel tak ɛ, nyɛ naazɛke nɛ mbel náá: «Sa mɛghaaz mɔn'am, mesyem mɔ eepelel!» <verse eid="MAT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Dáa bɛ nabee deenek ɛ, bɛdhiiti bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo nyiiŋla pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nwyak mot ɛpebyasal Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="MAT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>É di tak wat, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu naagu esiiza bɔɔ. Nyɛ boozɛke náá: «Étɛp yé bi di nɛ mbee esiiza tɔ elyem bin deenek? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Ɛyé di elyel nɛ nen, ɛke ɛ́ nɛ mot ɛbɛ́ náá: “Mesyem mɔ eepelel” ooho, nɛghu ɛke náá: “Wyɛla, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛ”? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Ye goka ɛ́ bi ɛ́ gu náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpel mesyem mɛ bot kɔ bɔs.» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ mot zesɔɔb nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔ náá: «Wyɛla, nɔŋa mwaala yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ sik pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>É di'enek, mot'enɔk eezɛwyɛl, sik pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>É di'enek wat, dáa ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ nabee deenek ɛ, bɛ naadyeebadjoka ɛlyelɛpe. Bhii tak, bɛ moo eduwal Zɛɛb dáa nyɛ nadjɛ mbi yenek mɛbwala nɛ bot ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdjóo Matye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yezu eezɛdus tin, dáa nyɛ nadi edhaŋ ɛ, nyɛ naazɛbee dhiiti mot, din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Matye, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ndiindil é di mɛsa mɛ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɔŋel epata e lapo. Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ: «Dua mɛ!» Matye eezɛwyɛl «ngbat», bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdu nyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nadi edɛ edee pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ Matye. Wɔ gwaa, bɛtɛ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo nɛ bot ɛ mesyem zokazɛlwood tin, zɛdɛ bɛ nɛ bɛ nɔɔ djas kɔ mesa wat. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Dáa eFalizyɛ nabee deenek ɛ, bɛ naazɛdji bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Étɛp ye lyoel yen di edɛ edee é di wat bɛ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo nɛ bot ɛ na mbee dék?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yezu eegwak dáa bɛ nadi elii ɛ, tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bot ɛ di nɛ mɛnyel ɛnyɔɛpe ɔ tok nɛ gwyes dhɔkɔtɔlɔ nyɛ neegwom bɛ. Ye ɛ́ membel ɛ di nɛ gwyes mɛgwoma. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Tɔ́ka, kɛdjekeka ɛsuk ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di eke náá: “Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ enɛm esa, dhaa ebuwa e bɛtit.” Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ zɛsaa bot ɛ epiki. Mam nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛsaa bot ɛ di egu náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mesyem ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo ɛ Yezu dum nɛ tɛp ɛtsi edee étɛp mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Dhiiti dwoo, bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot naazyɛ zɛdji Yezu náá: «Étɛp yé bisɔ nɛ eFalizyɛ di etsi edee étɛp mendjaala, dhi bɛdjekel bɔ di ààtsi edee étɛp mendjaala?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nakobee sok paa náá, bɛsɔ ɛ mwaaz di tɔ ghoŋ dwoo ɛba, dhi bɛ di lɔɔg wat nɛ mwaaz, mot paazyɛ, zɛba moma ɔ? Yenek ààsael! Deenek ɛwala tak ɛpezyɛ, ɛwala ɛ di náá, mot zɛba moma ɔ waadisaa pak'ɔɔ. É di tak ɛ́ bɛ aatsi edee.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>«Ye tok nɛ mot aanyaa pes bes kaad étɛp ɛkoobal put kaad nɛ yɛ. Wɔ sa deenek ɔɔ, é sok wɔ aagwyii kaad tak ɛ, bes kaad ɛ́ waanyaa put kaad, da ɛ́ bek ɛlen ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Mɛnyok mɛ na bes ààwaaa tɔ bhɛɛb na mwa. Yɛ sɛɛ deenek ɔɔ, bhɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbel, da mɛnyok ɛ́ see, deenek bhɛɛb eepulel. Étɛp tak ɛ́ di lɛɛaa náá, yɛ ààgoka deenek, etɛɛ náá, mɛnyok mɛ bes goka ɛ́ tɔ ebes e bhɛɛb.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik dhiiti moma, da gomal ɛsyes ɛ Zayilus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Dáa Yezu nadi elii nɛ nɔɔ deenek ɛ, wɔ gwaa dhiiti kukuma eYuda zɛzyɛ pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko mɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Ɛsyes ɛ lam ààlóo nɛ pɛka. Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, wɔ zɛkɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ lɛ étɛp nyɛ neegom!» <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Yezu eezɛwyɛl, «ngbat», bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, du nyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Dhiiti moma nadi ebɛ́ ɛbɛ́ ɛ ghiya, ghiya nadi ekekɛk nyɛ é nyel ààbɛ nɛ ɛtsek. Ɛbɛ́ ɛ tak naaboya nɛ nɛ é di membu kam nɛ ebá. Moma tak zokazɛtiila pɛ bhii koŋ ɛ Yezu, nyɛ eezɛmɛt kyee ɛghɔ ɛ kaad ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Étɛp nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eeke tɔ lyem'ɛ náá: «Mɛ zomɛt kaad'ɛ ɔɔ, mɛ ɛpetsak!» <verse eid="MAT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛliig mis, gwyák nyɛ. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Sa mɛghaaz ɛsyes ɛ lam! Ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb eetsik wɔ.» É di tak wat, moma yenɔk naazɛtsak.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ndjaa kukuma eYuda é tak. Dáa bɛ nakum ɛ, bɛ kabela bot ɛ, é ebwom ngɔmbi, zɛnɔɔ bak bot é sa yɔbɔ ɛzɛm pɛ ndjaa tak étɛp ɛkoobal esesɛɛ, bɛ neetɔ́ ndela. <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Wyiska pɛ kel, etɛɛ náá, ɛsyes ɛlak ààpagwyɛ, nyɛ dja ɛ́ gɔ́.» É di'enek, bɛ moo tin eduk Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Dáa bɛ nawyisal ɛdhuu ɛ bot pɛ kel ɛ, Yezu eezɛni tɔ dhɛŋ, nyɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ é mbɔ, wɔ gwaa ɛsyes ɛlenɔk zɛwyɛl. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Menduk mɛ tɛp'enek naakɛ kɔ kyee dik'enek djas.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik bot ɛ edhim bɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Dáa Yezu nadus tin ɛ, wɔ gwaa bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ mɛ edhim bɛbá zokazɛni edu nyɛ bhii koŋ nɛ etsim: «Mɔn Dhavid, geka bis ghoŋ!»<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Dáa Yezu nakum pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ na edhim binɔk zɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi eemyaal náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa sa bi di ewaab'enek é?» Bot binɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Iyoo, Ghɛŋ! Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛmɛt bɛ é mis. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Zɛɛb eedjɛ bin sa djala nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>É di tak wat, wɔ gwaa bɛ nyaasok. Yezu eezɛlu bɛ ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Gwakeka mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe: sa mot ngɔt ààgu sa sɛɛ wak ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Tin, bot binɔk katɔ́ ɛ́, elɛɛ tɔ kyee dik'enek djas esesɛɛ Yezu nasa ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik dhiiti bubu mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>É sok bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛtɔ́ ɛ, bɛdhiiti bot nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ eezyɛ Yezu nɛ mot ngɔt nadi bubu ɔ, etɛɛ náá, embee sisim nadi edhek nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Dáa Yezu nasɔ mbee sisim tak ɛ, é di tak wat mot'enɔk nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ moo elii. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi edi tak ɔ, moo tin edjoka. Bɔɔ náá: «Bis dinaa ààpaakobee kɔkɔ mbi yak sonok tɔ Yisalaɛl.» <verse eid="MAT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Yɛ kabɛ eFalizyɛ ɔ, bɔɔ nake yɔbɔ ɛ́ náá: «Ye ɛ́ kukuma embee esisim ɛ di edjɛ Yezu mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ di esɔ embee sisim nɛ yɛ ɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ɛ́ nɛ ghoŋ nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yezu nadi ekɛ kɔ boo eghaada nɛ kɔ mɛl. Nyɛ nadi elelyo mɛdhuu mɛ bot tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Nyɛ nadi egoola bɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal dum nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ nadi etsik bot ɛ di nɛ epel ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ nadi nɛ edjam ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ghoŋ naasa nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe dum nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ tak nadi ɛ́ bɛ eezewak dáa mɛsaa mɛ ebhata di ààbɛ nɛ mbaalel ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Bhum nɛ bu tɔ bok, tin, bot ɛ ɛbɔ́k ààbu. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Ye goka ɛ́, bi djaala nɛ nakuma pyeeb náá, nyɛ baadhis bot ɛ mɛsa étɛp bɛ neezɛsa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb'ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu kam nɛ bɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yezu naazɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛ eghɛŋ ɛsɔ embee esisim nɛ ɛtsik ɛ bot ɛ di nɛ epel, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ́ nadi nɛ edjam ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Beeka min mɛ bot ɛ lwoma kam nɛ bɛbá tak e: Mot mɛkɛn ɛ́ Simɔŋ nadjɛaa din ɛ Pyɛɛd ɔ, nɛ dhyeeb Andele, Zak bɛ nɛ dhyeeb Zaŋ, bɔɔ bɛbá nabɛ ɛ́ bɔn Zɛbɛdɛ, <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filip nɛ Bhaatelemi, Toma zɛnɔɔ Matye nɔŋel epata e lapo, baazɛnɔɔ Zak mɔn Alfe, wɔ kabela ɛ́ Tade, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simɔŋ, mot di tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi edjóoaa eZɛlɔt ɔ, zɛnɔɔ Yudas Iskaliɔt mot naka Yezu ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛsa mɛ bɛdjekel nalwomaa ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Yezu zokazɛlwom bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá étɛp esa mɛsa mɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ kookyee mɛl mɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Sa bi ààni pɛ tɔ eghaada e bot ɛ Samali. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Bi goka nɛ ɛtɔ́ ɛ́, pɛ daa ebhata e bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl nazewo ze ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Ze ɛ ze, gheegoolaka nɛ bot náá: “Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, moo ɛ́ ɛkunaaɛpe!” <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Tsikeka bot ɛ mɛbɛ́. Gomalka bot ɛ ze gwyɛ ɔ. Gelalka bot mɛbɛ́ mɛ zezam, ezezam bɔɔ. Sɔka embee esisim. Esa ee bi bela ààbɔm-bɔmak ɛ, djɛka bot yɛ yii toto. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Nànɔɔka elɔɔd, àànɔɔ epata, ààbaanɔɔ-nɔŋak dɔɔ nɛ meea étɛp ɛwa tɔ mengwyɛ da ɛ́ tɔ́ nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>Nànɔɔka mɛkoo mɛ di tɔ́aa nɛ yɛ mɛdjoŋ ɛ. Nànɔɔka dhiiti kuwa. Nànɔɔka bɛdhiiti ekoko. Nànɔɔka sek, étɛp ɛtɔ́ mɛdjoŋ nɛ yɛ, etɛɛ náá, mot di esa mɛsa ɔ goka ɛ́ nyɛ bela sa dek.<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>«Bi ɛ́ kum kɔ dhiiti mɔɔ dɛl nɛghu kɔ ghaada ɔɔ, saaka mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛmyaal bin náá, bi sulal pɛ daa lɛ ɔ. Dika pɛ daa mot'enɔk. Bi dus tin ɛ, yɛ bɛ bi moo twol kɔ dɛl ɛ tak ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Bi ɛ́ ni tɔ ndjaa mot ɔ, keka náá: “Bis eeswos bin hoo.” <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, bot ɛ ndjaa tak eemyaal bin ɔɔ, tin, egwyem bin di nɛ nɔɔ. Tin, bɛ pɛɛ náá, bi nàsulal tɔ mendjaa mɔɔ ɔɔ, betka egwyem bin sik nɛ nen. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, kɔ dhiiti dɛl nɛghu tɔ dhiiti ndjaa bɛ eepɛɛ náá, bi nàsulal ɔɔ, bɛ byen ɛgwak bin ɔɔ, wyiska yebɔ kɔ dɛl ɛ́ tak, nɛghu tɔ ndjaa tak, da bi ɛ́ kut piib mɛko men. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp etsɛɛtsɛ náá, é dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, dɛl ɛlenek aapɛ́ɛaa ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe dhaa-dhaŋak epɛ́ɛ bot ɛ kyee mɛl mɛ Sodɔm nɛ Ghomɔɔd.»<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mezuk mɛ di ezyɛ pɛ sok ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>«Gwakeka! Mɛ kyeed bin ɛ́ dáa ebhata kuku eben. Dika nɛ etsoŋ dáa bɛnyɔ, da bi ɛ́ di bot ɛ edɛɛ dáa mɛgum. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Dika bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ waakɛpit bin sok bhwoob bɛtetɛp, bi ɛ́ waanyuuŋaa nɛ eghwyɛs tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam, bi ɛ́ waakɛtaŋal pɛ daa ekukuma nɛ bɛmɛkoozi, zɛnɔɔ pɛ daa bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, étɛp bi needi bɛtyaasɛs ɛ etɛp ee bi nazebee ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>É sok bɛ aatɔ́ nɛ nen sok bhwoob bɛtetɛp ɛ, sa mot ààbem ba étɛp mɛkpa aawyis tɔ enuub bin nɛ dáa bi aataŋal ɛ. Mɛkpa mɛ taŋal ɛ́ waadjɛaa bin é di'enek wat. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Etɛɛ náá, ye tok biyɔ aakalii tin. Ye ɛ́ Sisim Sɛɛg'en ɛ́ aapakalii é di'enek.»<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>«Bɔn mɔ ngɔt waakɛkael pak'ɔɔ é ɛsaŋ ɛ náá, mɔn nyɛɛg'ɔɔ neegóaa, dɔɔ nɛ bɛsɛɛg ɛ bɔn aazobaasa ɛ́ deenek nɛ bɔn bɔɔ. Bɔn ɛ́ waapit bɛbyael bɔɔ, bɔɔ kɛmɛtaa, kwyɛ ndjɛ sɔs, góaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Bot djas ɛ́ waabhina bin, etɛɛ din ɛ lam. Ye ɛ́ bot ɛ aamaad lyem kɛkum pɛ ɛsik ɔ aapaabela tsik. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>É sok bi aadi kɔ dhiiti ghaada ɛ, bot ɛ́ ghaada tak ɛ́ di esa bin esa e kokok nɛ etɛp ɛpes nɛ mezuk ɔ, kaabka, da bi ɛ́ tɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ sis. Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi aanàkwaasilal ɛkɛ kɔ mɛl mɛ di kɔ kyee dik Yisalaɛl ɔ djas, ɛsok nɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot zyɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>«Ye tok nɛ djekel aadhaa mot di elyo nyɛ ɔ. Ye tok nɛ mot-mɛsa di edhaa kukuma yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Djekel goka ɛ́, nyɛ di dáa lyoel yɛ. Da mot-mɛsa ɛ́ di dáa kukuma yɛ. Kwyii nakuma mɛbyel ɛ́ koodjóoaa Bɛlzebul, “Aah” gwyata nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ! Bɛ aazoleleeaa ɛ́ leea.»<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot bi di egoka nɛ ɛkaab ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>«Étɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, sa mot ààkaab bɛmbee bot binɔk. Dhiiti dwoo ɛ́ tak, dwoo di náá, esesɛɛ djas di syela ɛ́ waawyis é gwyɛ ɛ. Esesɛɛ djas di tɔ syaab ɛ waaguaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Tɛp mɛ di elɛɛ bin tɔ ghooghom ɛ, lɛɛka yɛ popoopwon é mwos dwoo. Etɛp ee bi nadi nyiiŋlaa tɔ ɛlɔ ɛ, tuudka yɛ ɛlyelɛpe kɔ emii e mendjaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Nàkaabka bot ɛ di egu ɛgó epuud ɔ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ aanàkwaagó sisim. Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkaab ɛ Zɛɛb mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛgó sisim nɛ epuud tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Tin, bɔɔ enen ebá tok wak ebɔmsaa nɛ ba mɔɔ pata wat é? Bela náá, ngɔt pak'ɔɔ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkwyit é bɔs, Sɛɛg'en ɛ di ààmyaal ɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ bɛ ɛmet ɔ, mɛko mɛ bhoo di tɔ elo bin djas ɛ́ elaŋa. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Sa mot ààbem ba etɛɛ náá, é mis mɛ Saag'am bi dhaa bɛtɛ nɛ bɔɔ enen nɛ boo mɛtaŋ!»<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛmyaal, nɛghu ɛbyen ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>«Mot aamyaal popoopwon é mis mɛ bot djas náá, nyɛ ɛ́ djekel'am ɔɔ, mam pe, mɛ waamyaal nyɛ é mis mɛ Saag'am di tɔ gwoo ɔ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ ngbam. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Bela náá, mot aakɛla popoopwon é mis mɛ bot djas náá, nyɛ tok djekel'am ɔɔ, mam pe, mɛ waakɛla nyɛ é mis mɛ Saag'am di tɔ gwoo ɔ náá, mɛ ààgu nyɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ étɛp ɛgwakel, nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛwa zyaala pak bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>«Nàgekeka náá, mɛ nazyɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ́, étɛp egwyem tɔ bot. Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ, zɛwa egwyem nɛ ɛgwakel tɔ bot. Mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛkus ɛghuub nɛ ɛzɛbɛk ɛ bot. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛwa membɛk pak sɛɛg nɛ mɔn motom, pak nyɛɛg nɛ mɔn moma, pak nakɔla nɛ bhɛɛbel. <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Bot ɛ mɛbhuka men aadi ɛ́, bot ɛ mɛbyel men met. <verse eid="MAT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>Mot di ekwyɛl mot ngɔt pak sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg, dhaa mɛ ɔɔ, mot tak ààkɔa nɛ nam. Mot di ekwyɛl mɔn'ɛ mɔɔ moma, nɛghu mɔn'ɛ mɔɔ motom dhaa mɛ ɔɔ, mot tak ààkɔa nɛ nam. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Mot ɛ di ààbɛp mɛlaaba mɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ du mɛ ɔɔ, mot tak ààkɔa nɛ nam. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Mot aakwyɛl ɛkwyɛɛg tsik'ɛ dhaa mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ waasu tsik'ɛ. Mot aakakwyɛl ɛsu tsik'ɛ étɛp ɛdu ɛ mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela tsik.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>«Mot aamyaal náá, bi sulal tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ myaal ɛ́ mam. Mot aamyaal mɛ tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ myaal ɛ́ mot nadhis mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Mot aamyaal ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ da dil nyɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela efute ee di egyee nɛ ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Mot di emyaal mot epiki, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot epiki ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela efute mot epiki di gyee nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mot aadjɛ dhiiti ba mɔɔ djekel'am ngɔt ba mɔɔ bɛɛlɛ mɛdii mɛtela, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ djekel'am ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela efute bɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Bot ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nalwom ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Dáa Yezu nasilal ɛlyo bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá ɛ, nyɛ eezɛdus tin, tɔ́ kɛlyo nɛ ɛkɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ eghaada kyee dik'enek.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Zaŋ Nduuel-bot pɛ nyɛ nadi tɔ ndjaa membok ɛ, nyɛ naagwak menduk ɛ Mɛsia. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boolwom bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel bɛ <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>bɛ kɛdji Yezu náá: «Ye ɛ́ wɔy ɛ́ di Mɛsia nabɛ náá, nyɛ ɛpezyɛ “ohoo”, nɛghu ye ɛ́ náá, ye baabwoodaa dhiiti di baazyɛ ɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Kɛlɛɛka Zaŋ sa bi bee ɛ́ nɛ yii bi gwak nɛ mɛlɔ men ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>Bot ɛ edhim moo nyaa sok. Eboka e bot moo kɛ. Bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ mɛ zezam eezetsak. Bɛ na endiila e mɛlɔ moo gwak, bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ, bɛ ɛ́ zegom. Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛpegoolel kɛkum pɛ daa bɛdjel ɛ bot. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Mɛnyɔ nɛ mot aadi ààdis ɛbwaalel ɛ lɛ kɔ lam ɔ!»<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Bhii bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ nasik ɛ, Yezu moo tin elii nɛ zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi tin ɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Zaŋ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nakɛbee yé pɛ tɔ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ? Bi nakɛbee ɛ́ mɔɔ le ghwaazok edheegel nɛ pup é? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>“Ha” bi nakɛbee yé pɛ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ? Bi nakɛbee ɛ́ mot ngɔt nɛ vaŋ mbi bhet é? Bi nɛ gu náá, bot ɛ dyeebabɔt evaŋ ekaad ɔ dyeebadi ɛ́ pɛ tɔ eboo mendjaa bɛmɛkoozi. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Bi nakɛbee yé? Bi nakɛbee ɛ́ ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb é? Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, nyɛ eedhaa-dhaŋak ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>Etɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Zaŋ ɛ ekwyala nalɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">“Ɛsok nɛ wɔ nɛ tɔ́, mɛ waalwom ngoola-ngoola yam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">nyɛ neekɛdii wɔ ze.”<verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>«Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: pɛ tɔ bot djas Zɛɛb nasa ɔ, ye tok nɛ mot dhaa Zaŋ Nduuel-bot. Tin, mot di mɔɔ dhyeeb tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, ɛ́ boo boo-mot nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Kɛkan membu mɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nadi elyo bot tɔ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, kɛyaka nɛ ɛlu ɛ mos, ɛni ɛ tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ nɛ lyel. Bot ɛ di nɛ mɛghaaz ɛ́ di nɛ ghwyil ɛdɛk yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Kana nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb djas, zɛnɔɔ etsi ɛ Moiiz, mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb naagoolel kɛkum membu mɛ ɛkwyil ɛ Zaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Bi ɛ́ kwyɛl ɛtiibal ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ Zaŋ ɛ́ di Eli, ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalookɛkaa náá, nyɛ waabula ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ mɛlɔ ɔɔ, gwakeka yɛ ɛnyɔɛpe!<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>«Mɛ gek bot ɛ membu mak nɛ bɛzɛ? Bɛ ɛ́ dáa zɛɛga bɔɔ dhyeeb mendiindil kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ bot djas di di ɛ, da bɛdhiiti ɛ́ gheetsim kɔ bɛsɔ bɔɔ náá: <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>“Bis eebwom bin ngɔmbi, bi ààpabɔl. Bis eedjeeb bin mɛdjeeb mɛ ɛsyee, bi ààpadje!” <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ eezyɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eetsi edee nɛ mɛnyok. Deenek, bot kake ɛ́ náá: “Ye ɛ́ embee esisim ɛ di sa nyɛ deenek!” <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot eezyɛ. Nyɛ ɛpedɛ yɛ edee nɛ mɛnyok me vin, bi kake ɛ́ náá: “Beeka nwyak é? Mɛsa mɛ ɛ́ ɛdɛ edee nɛ dɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin, nyɛ be mɛsɔ ɛ́ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ mbee tsik ɔ!” Tin, etsoŋ e Zɛɛb nadi enyen tɔ mɛsa mɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eghaada di ebyen ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛni nɛ mɛlyo mɛ ɛdul ɛ mɛlɔ mɛ bot ɛ eghaada ee nyɛ nasa bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala ɔ, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ eghaada tak nabɛ ɛ́ ààliig elyem bɔɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>«Haa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nɔ, dɛl ɛ Koodazin, kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nɔ, dɛl ɛ Bhɛtsaida! Etɛɛ náá, bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala nasael pɛ yebɔ ɔ, yɛ ɛpedi ɛ́ di náá, ye nasael ɛ́ pɛ eghaada Tiid nɛ Sidɔn ɔɔ, pe bot ɛ eghaada binɔk naaloobɔt kaad ɛpum, pe bɛ naazelɔɔba mɛsii, pe bɛ naaloozeliig elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Étɛp tak ɛ́ mɛ di elɛɛ nɛ nen náá, dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, yebɔ epɛ́ɛ ɛ́ waadhaa yii bot ɛ eghaada Tiid nɛ Sidɔn nɛ mɛlyel. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔɔ, dɛl ɛ Kapɛlnaum, wɔ gek ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ byet tɔ́ pɛ tɔ gwoo? Wɔ waasilaa kɛkum pɛ dɛl ɛ bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, endem e mɛbwala mɛ nasɛɛ penek ɛ, ye ɛpedi ɛ́ di náá, ye naasɛɛ ɛ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Sodɔm ɔɔ, pe dɛl ɛlenek dinaa tak dɔɔ nɛ mos. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Étɛp tak ɛ́ mɛ di elɛɛ bin náá, dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, epɛ́ɛ nyɛ aapɛ́ɛ bin ɛ, yɛ waadhaa yii bot ɛ ghaada Sodɔm nɛ mɛlyel.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">«Dhaka pɛ daa lam, mɛ needjɛ bin ɛwala!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>É ghɛŋ tak, Yezu naazɛke náá: «Hyee Bhaaba, Ghɛŋ gwoo nɛ bɔs, mɛ ɛpeghaapɛɛ wɔ, etɛɛ náá, esesɛɛ wɔ nasyel bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot nɛ bot ɛ di etselal ɔ, wɔ eelyaal yɛ nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Iyoo, Bhaaba, wɔ nakwyɛl ɛ́, ye sɛɛ deenek.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>«Saag'am naadjɛ mɛ esonok djas. Ye tok nɛ mot di egu Mɔn Zɛɛb, yɛ di ààbɛ Sɛɛg nyɛ ɛmet ɔ. Deenek, ye tok nɛ mot di egu Sɛɛg, yɛ di ààbɛ Mɔn nɛghu mot Mɔn aakwyɛl ɛlyaal ɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>«Biyɔ, bot ɛ zewak étɛp ɛbɛp edil-dil mɛkɔm men ɔ, dhaka pɛ daa lam, mɛ needjɛ bin ɛwala. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Bɛpka kɔm etɛp bam. Tin, betka náá, mɛ djɛ bin etsoŋ, etɛɛ náá, mam ɛ́ mot mɛsila nɛ ɛtela ɛ lyem. Tin, bi ɛ́ waabela di ɛwala biyɔ bɛ ɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Kɔm mɛ di edjɛ bin ɛ́, yɛ ààdil, ɛbɛp ɛ lam mɛ di djóo bin náá, bi zɛbɛp ɛ, ye nɛ gwyaa.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ tɛp dwoo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Dhiiti dwoo saba, Yezu nadi edhaa tɔ pyeeb kɔkɔ mbi bhek bhisa di edjóoaa ble ɛ. Tin, wɔ gwaa, za zɛbe bɛdjekel bɛ, bɛ moo tin ebɔ́k mɛbhisa mɛ tak étɛp ɛdɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Dáa eFalizyɛ nabee deenek ɛ, bɛ eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Beea, bɛdjekel bɔ ɛpesa esesɛɛ di náá, yɛ ààpadjɛaa bɛ ze dwoo saba ɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yezu zokazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààlaa sa Dhavid nasa é sok bɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi egyee bɛ nɛ bɛ nɔɔ nagwak za ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ lɔɔg'ɛ naani tɔ ndjaa Zɛɛb, bɔɔ zokakɛdɛ emapa ee nakaŋaa Zɛɛb ye ɛ́. Dhi ye di náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgoka nɛ ɛdɛ emapa e tak. Etɛɛ náá, etsi bina lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdɛ emapa e tak ɔ, ye ɛ́ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb bɔɔ bɛ ɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Nɛghu bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààlaa tɔ etsi ɛ Moiiz náá, bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nadi esa mɛsa tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa dwoo saba ɔ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi eduwal etsi e saba, dhi bɔɔ, ààbela ndjɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak é? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Tin, betka mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, wak, ye ɛ́ nɛ sonok wat di edhaa Ndjaa-ebuwa nɛ mɛbɔk ɔ! <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Bi ɛ́ pe di egu ɛnyɔɛpe sa ɛsuk ɛ ekwyala bak: “Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ enɛm esa, ààkabɛ ebuwa e bɛtit<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Oze 6.6</ref></char></note>” di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɔ, pe bi ààpazyɛ zɛpit bot ɛ di ààgu tɛp ɔ gwyes. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ di kukuma dwoo saba.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot na sɔɔbela mbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛdus tin, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda e tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot ngɔt nadi nɛ sɔɔbela mbɔ ɔ. Ɛkwosak ɛ eFalizyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, Yezu bela ndjɛ é mis mɔɔ. Étɛp tak ɛ́ bɛ nadji nyɛ náá: «Etsi bina ɛpemyaal náá, mot tsikaa dwoo saba?» <verse eid="MAT 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, mot ngɔt pak'en ɛ́ nɛ sim bhata ngɔt ɔɔ, nyɛ gwak náá, dwoo saba, sim bhata tak eekwyit tɔ guk na dim-dim ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaatɔ́ kɛwyisal nyɛ tɔ guk tak é? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Dáa ye di náá, mot eedhaa bhata nɛ mɛtaŋ ɛ, tin, etsi lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, mena saka bot enɛm esa dwoo saba.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ mot nadi nɛ sɔɔbela mbɔ ɔ náá: «Sɛɛba mbɔ'ɔ.» É di tak wat, mbɔ mot'enɔk eezɛbula ɛnyɔɛpe, dáa yak dhiiti mbɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Bhii tak, eFalizyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdus tin, tɔ́ yɔbɔ. Wɔ gwaa bɛ kɛsɛɛga é kwan, étɛp ɛdjek dáa bɛ aadjɛ nyɛ epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot-mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb nasɛ́ɛ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Dáa Yezu nagwak deenek ɛ, nyɛ eezɛdus tin, wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot zokadu nyɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokazɛtsik membel djas. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Tin, nyɛ eezɛlyak bɛ ɛlyelɛpe náá, bɛ nàsa náá, bot gu mbi mot nyɛ nadi ɛ́. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ́, ye neebela ɛsuk. Ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ́ náá:<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>«Zɛɛb lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Beea mot-mɛsa mam mɛ nasɛ́ɛ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">mot mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Lyem'am ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Mɛ waawa Sisim'am tɔ lɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Tin, nyɛy ɛ́ aapagoola nɛ bot ɛ membyak djas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">epiki bam mɛ aadhis ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Nyɛ aanàkwaawaya nɛ bot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">Nyɛ aanàkwaabiyo nɛ mot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">Bi aanàkwaagwak gwood'ɛ é gba.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Nyɛ aanàkwaabwak-bwakak mɔɔ le ghwaazok di náá yɛ eezenyaabel ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Nyɛ aanàkwaadimal mɔɔ ngel lama di esaa náá, ye dim ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Nyɛ aasa deenek, kɛkum dwoo epiki bɛ aanyen é mis mɛ bot ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Tin, bot djas di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, bɛ waawa ɛbwaalel ɛ lɔɔ kɔ lɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Eza 42.1-4</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu sɔ embee sisim nɛ ghwyil zɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Wɔ gwaa bɛ zokazyɛ Yezu nɛ dhiiti mot, mot tak nadi ɛ́, bubu nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ edhim. Ye ɛ́ embee sisim ɛ nasa mot tak deenek. Tin, Yezu eezɛtsik mot tak, nyɛ moo tin elii nɛ ɛnyaasok. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, naadyeebadjoka. Bɛ moo tin eke náá: «Wɔ ke ɛ́ nwyak tok Mɔn Dhavid é?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Dáa eFalizyɛ nagwak bot binɔk elii ɛ, bɛ boozɛke náá: «Mot tak sɔ embee sisim ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, Bɛlzebul kukuma embee sisim ɛ, di edjɛ nyɛ kɔkɔ yak mbi mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ di esɔ embee sisim nɛ yɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>É di'enek, Yezu nadi egu egeka e elyem bɔɔ, nyɛ boozɛlɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ di náá, mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ tak ɛ mɛwɔ nɛ edho pak'ɔɔ, ɛsik ɛyoŋ ɛ tak ɛ́ ɛbel nɛ ɛwaazel. Bot tɔ ghaada wat nɛghu bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ wat, ɛ di nɛ mɛwɔ nɛ etuub pak'ɔɔ ɔ, yenek mɛbyel nɛ yenek ghaada aanàkwaapyet ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, Satan moo sɔ sa di náá, ye ɛ́ yɛ Satan ɛ, bi ààbee náá, Satan kaduu tuub ɛ, bɛ nɛ nyel'ɛ met e? Tin, ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ aakapyet dáa?<verse eid="MAT 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>«Yɛ bɛ náá, mam sɔ embee sisim ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Bɛlzebul ɔɔ, ɛzɛ di edjɛ bot bin ghwyil bɔɔ di esɔ embee sisim nɛ yɛ ɛ? Mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, ye ɛ́ bɔɔ bɛ nakuma tak ɛ aapalyaal bin náá, bi tok nɛ gham. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Sa di tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ́ náá: mɛ sɔ embee sisim ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Sisim ɛ Zɛɛb. Yenek djas kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ wak nɛ nena é di wat.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>«Ye tok nɛ mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛni tɔ ndjaa mot mɛnyan, da ɛ́ nɔɔ esa e ndjaa mot tak, nyɛ di ààkɔl nyɛ mɛmbɔ nɛ mɛko ɔɔ. Ye ɛ́ bhis ɛkɔl nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ aakabela ghwyil ɛnɔɔ esa e ndjaŋ'ɛ djas, da nyɛ ɛ́ wyis tɔ́ nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>Mot di ààdi pɛ yam kyee ɔ, ye lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, mot tak ɛ́ mot di ebhina mɛ ɔ. Tin, mot di ààkwyee mɛ é ɛsɛɛg ɛ bot ɔ, nyɛ waaz ɛ́ waazak. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Étɛp tak ɛ́ mɛ di elɛɛ bin náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpel mesyem mɛ bot djas, ye nakoozodi ebyas nɛ embee esesɛɛ bɛ nasa Zɛɛb ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ náá, mot eebyasal Sisim na Dɛɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaapelaa. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Mot ɛ́ lii ɛbiyoɛpe nɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɔɔ, mesyem mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpelaa. Tin, mot ɛ́ lii ɛbiyoɛpe nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ ɔɔ, mesyem mɛ aanàkwaapelaa tɔ tsik mena dika mos'aak nɛghu tsik ɛbhis.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Le nɛ bhum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>«Étɛp wɔ neebela mbɛɛ bhum, ye goka ɛ́ le pookokan ɛdi sok mbɛɛ le. Etɛɛ náá, le ɛ́ di nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔɔ, bhum tak aabaazodi ɛ́ mɛbɛ́ nɛ mɛbɛ́, etɛɛ náá, le gwyakaa ɛ́ nɛ bhum di ekwyil é tak ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Mbyak mɛgel! Bi aakwak ɛlii embɛɛ etɛp dáa, bela náá bi ɛ́ bɛmbee ɛ bot? Etɛɛ náá, nuub dyeebawyisal ɛ́ etɛp ee zelwood tɔ lyem ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Mbɛɛ mot nɔɔ etɛtɛ etɛp ee nyɛ di lii ɛ́ tɔ ɛkwom ɛ mbɛɛ esesɛɛ bɛ. Tyɛ wat nɛ mbee mot, nyɛ nɔɔ embee etɛp ee nyɛ di elii ɛ́, tɔ ɛkwom ɛ mbee esesɛɛ bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>Betka mɛ lɛɛ bin, sa di tsɛɛtsɛ náá, dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, bot ɛ waatyaa sok bhwoob bɛtetɛp étɛp mɛlee mɛ bɛ nadi elee bot ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Etɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ kɔ mɛkpa mɔ met ɛ wɔ aabela gham nɛghu ɛkwyɛ ndjɛ sɔs é mis mɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngwyeebel ndem mɛbwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>É di'enek, bɛdhiiti bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ zokazɛdji Yezu náá: «Lyoel! Bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, wɔ lyaal bis dhiiti ndem mɛbwala.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp yé di náá, bot ɛ di ewaab mos dhiiti ndem mɛbwala pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɔ, di di bɛmbee ɛ bot, bot ɛ di ààbɛ sosoob é mis mɛ Zɛɛb ɔ? Tin, Zɛɛb aazolyaal bɛ ɛ́ ndem wat. Yɛ aadi ɛ́ kɔkɔ mbi ndem ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Yonas nabee ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Ye ɛ́ tyɛ wat nɛ dáa ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Yonas nakpaa emwos elɛl nɛ epum elɛl tɔ mɔ boo su ɛ, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aabaasa ɛ́ emwos elɛl nɛ epum elɛl tɔ bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, bot ɛ ghaada ɛ Niniv ɛ waazyɛ, zɛtyaa sok bhwoob bot ɛ di mos'aak étɛp ɛpit bɛ, deenek, bɛ neekwyesal ndjɛ sɔs. Etɛɛ náá, gwaka bɛ nagwak Yonas é ɛlyo bɛ mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ Niniv naaliig elyem bɔɔ. Ye nyɔ ɛ́, bi gu náá, mot di nenak wak'aak, nyɛ eedhaa Yonas. <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Dwoo Zɛɛb aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, mɛkoozi mɛ moma dɛl ɛ di pɛ kyɛ bɔs ɛ́ waazyɛ, zɛtyaa sok bhwoob bot ɛ di mos'aak étɛp ɛpit bɛ, deenek, bɛ neekwyesal bɛ ndjɛ sɔs. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ mɛdhik mɛ ɛtseta, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛgwak mbɛɛ mɛlyo mɛ etsoŋ e mɛkoozi Salomɔŋ. Ye nyɔ ɛ́ bi gu náá, mot di nenak wak'aak, nyɛ eedhaa Salomɔŋ!»<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbula ɛ embee esisim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>«É sok mbee sisim di ewyis tɔ nyel mot ɛ, nyɛ katɔ́ ɛ́ pɛ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, kɛsaa di nyɛ aakɛdi ɛ. É di nyɛ aakadi ààbela di nyɛ aadi ɔ, <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>nyɛ kake ɛ́ náá: “Mɛ pookosik pɛ ndjaŋ'am, ndjaa mɛ nawyis tɔ tak sok ɛ.” Tin, sika nyɛ aakasik ɛ, nyɛ aabela ndjaa tak toto, bɛ eezewaabal nɛ ɛkoobal yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Tin ɛ nyɛ aakatɔ́, kɛnɔɔ bɛdhiiti embee esisim bɛ na nyan-nyan bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá di edhaa nyɛ nɛ embee mɛsa ɔ. Tin, bɔɔ djas kabula ɛ́ tɔ ndjaa tak, da ɛ́ be di tin. Deenek, tsik yenɔk mot eezepulel dhaa-dhaŋak yii nabɛ sok ɛ. Yɛ aadi ɛ́ deenek étɛp bɛmbee ɛ bot di pak'ena mos'aak.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔn nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu bɛ nɛ nyɛɛg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Yezu dinaa kuku ɛlii, wɔ gwaa bɔn nyɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg zɛkum é di nyɛ nadi ɔ. Bɛ eezɛtyaa pɛ kel. Tin, bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛlii nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Dhiiti mot ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ Yezu náá: «Beea, nyoog nɛ bɛdhyeeb bɔ ɛ́ pɛ kel, bɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛlii nɛ nɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ mot'enɔk náá: «Nyaag'am ɛ́ zɛ, da mɔn nyaag'am ɛ́ kadi bɛ zɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlyo bɛdjekel bɛ nɛ djin. Nyɛy náá: «Beeka nyaag'am, nɛ bɔn nyaag'am di wak e. <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Etɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ mot di esa ɛkwosak ɛ Saag'am di tɔ gwoo ɔ, di mɔn nyaag'am, kɛl'am nɛ nyaag'am.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kana sɔsel mɛbhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Dwoo tak wat, Yezu nadus ɛ pɛ ndjaa nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́, kɛdisi pɛ ɛboŋ ɛ boo soob na djato-djato. Tin, nyɛ moo zɛlyo bot. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot zokazɛmaala é di tak. Dáa nyɛ nabee náá, zukamwaa nɛ mot naazɛsɛɛga tin ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛni tɔ dhiiti elɛɛd, nɔɔ nyel, disi. Nyɛ eezɛpus elɛɛd tɔ dii, ɛdhuu ɛ bot eezɛlik pɛ kyiid é ngwoob dii. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Mɛlyo mɛ nyɛ nalelyo bɛ ɛ nadyeebabu ɛ́ tɔ ekana. Tɔ ekana ee nyɛ nadi elyo bɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ, wat nabɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ sɔsel mɛbhek. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dhiiti dwoo mot ngɔt natɔ́ pɛ pyeeb kɛsɔs bhek. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Dáa nyɛ nakadi emwam bhek tak ɛ, kyee wat nakwyit ɛ́ é gba. Wɔ gwaa enen zokazɛdɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Yak kyee kakwyit ɛ́ kɔ bat ɛkok. Tin, ààkobɔya deenek, mɛbhek eezɛkwyil, etɛɛ náá, di tak nadi ɛ́, nɛ ba bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>É di gwyes na ghɛ-ghɛ nakakas ɛ, wɔ gwaa mɛbhek djas zɛsyee, etɛɛ náá, ekaŋal e tak nabɛ ɛ́ ààni tɔ bɔs ɛdimɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Yak pak mɛbhek nakakwyit ɛ́ tɔ engwyinini. Wɔ gwaa, engwyinini binek zokawyee, kala kɔ mɛbhek ààbɛ nɛ dáa mɛbhek wyee ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Tin, mɛbhek mɛ nakakwyit kɔ mbɛɛ bɔs ɛ, naakwyil ɛnyɔɛpe, wɔ gwaa ye kwyil bhum. É kwos wat, bhum mɛkam-mɛlɛl, é yak mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ wat, é yak tak bhum dhet.» <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, gwakeka ɛnyɔɛpe!»<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Étɛp yé Yezu di elii nɛ bot tɔ ekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Tin, bɛdjekel eezɛtiila pɛ pak Yezu nadi ɛ́, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ di elii nɛ nɔɔ tɔ ekana?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ, bi eezedjɛaa etsoŋ ɛgu ɛsuk ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Yɛ bɛ bɛsɔ bin ɔ, bɛ dinaa ààpaamɛt ɛsuk ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Etɛɛ náá, mot aadi nɛ ba bim sonok ɔ, bɛ waabil nyɛ dhiiti, étɛp ye neebu. Tin, mot aakadi toto ààbɛ nɛ sonok ɔ, bɛ waadɛk nyɛ dɔɔ nɛ eghutu-ghutu nyɛ lik nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Étɛp tak ɛ́ mɛ di elii nɛ nɔɔ tɔ ekana. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgwyák nɛ mis, ààbee. Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgwak nɛ mɛlɔ, dhi bɛ di ààsiiza sa ye di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ́, etɛp ee ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ ɛ́ aabela ɛsuk. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eeke náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Bi ɛ́ waagwak ɛnyɔɛpe, bi ɛ́ aanàkwaagu ɛsuk ɛ tɛp tak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">Bi ɛ́ waabee nɛ mis, bi aanàkwaasiiza ɛsuk ɛ tak.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ mbyak'ak nɛ kalyel elyem dhaa nyel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Bɛ nɛ kasa maa-ɛlɔ dhaa tyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Bɛ eezedipal mis mɔɔ étɛp bɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛbee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Bɛ eediyal mɛlɔ mɔɔ, ye nàgwak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Bɛ eezelu ɛtselal ɛ lɔɔ náá, ye nàgwak sonok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Tin, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbula, dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb neetsik bɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Eza 6.9-10</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>«Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ bɛ ɛmet ɔ, mɛnyɔ nɛ nen, etɛɛ náá, mis men ɛpebee, mɛlɔ men ɛpegwak! <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp ee tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Bɛtɛ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, bot ɛ epiki naadyeebakwos ɛbee nɛ ɛgwak sa bi di ebee nɛ gwak mos'aak. Bɛ ààpabela bhwoob ɛbee nɛ gwak sa bi di ebee mos'aak.»<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu moo lɛɛ ɛsuk ɛ kana sɔsel mɛbhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>«Biyɔ, bot bak! Gwakeka ɛsuk ɛ kana sɔsel mɛbhek: <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Bɔs é ngwoob gba di bhek nakwyit ɔ, ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ bot ɛ nadi egwak etɛp Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ kadi ɛ́, ààmɛt ɛsuk ɛ tak ɔ. Tin, Mbee Mot eetuula, nyɛ eezɛdɛk mɛbhek bɛaa tɔ elyem bɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Bɛdhiiti bot kadi ɛ́ dáa mɛbhek nakwyit kɔ bat ɛkok ɛ, é sok bɛ di egwak-gwakak mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, bɛ nɛ dyeebamyaala tɔ elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Tin, bɛ ààpakabet náá, mɛkpa mɛ tak pookoni bɛ tɔ ebhum elyem ɛnyɔɛpe. Bɛ kadi ɛ́, ààwa zii ɛbuɛpe tɔ ɛbaal ɛ mɛkpa mɛ tak. Tin, é ghɛŋ mezuk nɛ mɛbhowal aatuula bɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, ɛliig ɛ lɔɔ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ààbɔya. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Bɛdhiiti tɔ len gwak mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ dáa kyee mɛbhek nakwyit tɔ engwyinini ɛ. Bɛ nɛ gwak mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, ye kabela ɛ náá, yɔbɔ elyem ɛ́ tɔ ɛwyeeb ɛ esa e bɔs, mɛvu mɛ di ekɔɔ bot kɔ bɔs'ak ɛ, nɛ mbee esiiza tɔ elyem bɔɔ di enyal mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Tin, mɛbhek mɛ tak kadi ɛ́, ààwum. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Bɛdhiiti bot kadi ɛ́ dáa mɛbhek nakwyit kɔ mbɛɛ bɔs ɛ. Bɛ ɛpegwak mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, myaal yɛ nɛ lyem wat, bɛ kakɛ ɛ́ dáa Zɛɛb kwyɛl ɛ. Tin, yɛ waawum ɛbuɛpe. Yak mɛkam-mɛlɛl, yak mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ ngɔt, yak dhet.»<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana mbee bhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yezu zokabaalɛɛ bɛdhiiti kana sis: «Beeka dhiiti sonok di tyee Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ: Dhiiti mot ngɔt naabɛ mbɛɛ mɛbhek tɔ pyeeb'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Yak pum, é sok bot ɛ dɛl djas nadi é gɔ́ ɛ, wɔ gwaa dhiiti mot mɛbhuka mɛ zokazɛbɛ nyɛ mbee bhek tɔ pyeeb, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel sik. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Dáa mɛbhek nakawyee ɛ, yɛ eezɛwum, mbee mɛbhek menek eebaazɛwyee yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Tin, bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ nakuma pyeeb tak ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nɛ kukuma yɔbɔ náá: “Ghɛŋ, wɔ nabɛ tɔ pyeeb'ɔ ɛ́ mbɛɛ mɛbhek, etsal é? Ha yak mbee bhek kadus paa?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Ye ɛ́ mot mɛbhuka ɛ́ sa esesɛɛ binek.” Bhii tak, bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: “Bis sa dáa, wɔ kwyɛl ɛ́, bis kɛdis embee mɛbhek menek é?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Nyɛ eebaazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Hoo! Ààbɛ! Etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ kɛgu yɛ ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgu dɔɔ nɛ mbɛɛ mɛbhek lɔɔg wat nɛ yiizaag. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Deenek, betka náá, mɛbhek menek djas wyee lɔɔg wat, kɛkum dwoo yɛ aakabɛ náá, bi moo kɛdis ɛ. Tin, mɛ waalɛɛ nɛ bot aakɛdis ɔ náá, bɛ pookokan sok ɛdis ɛ mbee bhek, da bɛ ɛ́ kɔl yɛ é di wat étɛp bɛ needik yɛ. Bhii tak ɛ bɛ aakasɛɛg mbɛɛ bhek, kwom kɔ taŋ'am.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana ba mɔɔ bhek na sikɛ-sikɛ bɛ di edjóo «mutaad ɛ»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Wɔ gwaa Yezu baazɛlɛɛ bɛ yak kana sis, nyɛy náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, ye ɛ́ dáa bhek le di edjɛ bhum di edjóoaa mutaad ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bhek le di edjɛ bhum di edjóoaa mutaad ɛ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">le mutaad ɛ́ boo le di kwyil tɔ bɔk ɛ.</char></note> dhiiti mot nakɛbɛ pɛ tɔ pyeeb'ɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Bhum mutaad ɛ́ bhek na sikɛ-sikɛ dhaa mɛbhek djas di ebɛaa kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ nɛ mɛtɔɔl. Tin, é ghɛŋ yɛ di ekwyil ɛ, mɛbɔk mɛ di edhaa ele e bok djas nɛ mɛbɔk. Ye kadi ɛ́, ye moo le di náá, enen ɛpebatazɛlóo mɛk mɔɔ kɔ elɛɛ e tak.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana leviid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Yezu zokabaazɛdjɛ bɛdhiiti kana. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, ye ɛ́ dáa moma di enɔɔ ba mɔɔ deez pu leviid, sɛɛg nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ pu falin, étɛp nyɛ neesa tsim mapa nɛ yɛ ɛ. Mɔɔ ɛwala bhii tak, tsim'enek djas kadi ɛ́, yɛ eezeghamta.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Etɛp ee Yezu nadi elelyo bot tɔ ekana ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Mɛlyo mɛ Yezu nadyeebadjɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nabe-bɛ ɛ́ tɔ ekana. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ dhiiti mɛlyo, ààlɛɛ yɛ tɔ kana. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Nyɛ nasesa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, sa bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalɛɛ ɛ́ neebela ɛsuk. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naake náá: «Mɛ waalii nɛ nen tɔ ekana. Tin, mɛ waalɛɛ bɛ esa ee nadi syela kana bɔs nakusel ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Mɛd 78.2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlɛɛ ɛsuk ɛ kana mbee bhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Bhii tak, Yezu zokazɛdus tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot, nyɛ eezɛsik, tɔ́ pɛ ndjaa. Tin, bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozɛzyɛ pɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Lɛɛa bis ɛsuk ɛ kana mbee bhek tɔ pyeeb.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛni elɛɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Ye ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ di bɛ mbɛɛ mɛbhek. <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Pyeeb kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ mɛdhik djas di kɔ bɔs ɛ. Mbɛɛ mɛbhek kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ bot ɛ di ekɛ dáa Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb di kwyɛl ɛ. Mbee bhek kalyaal ɛ́ bot ɛ Mbee Mot. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Mot mɛbhuka nazɛbɛ bhek ɔ, kabɛ ɛ́ Dim mot mɛkɔŋ. Dwoo ɛkɛbɔ́k bhum kabɛ ɛ́ ɛsi ɛ bɔs, bot ɛ mɛsa kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ efofop. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Dáa ye di náá, embee mɛbhek ɛ́ waatsaalaa étɛp ɛkɛmwasaa tɔ du ɛ, yɛ aabaazodi ɛ́ deenek é ɛsi ɛ bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waalwom efofop bɛ, nyɛ waadis tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ bot djas di ezɛm ɛmyaal ɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bɔɔ ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ mbee mɛsa. <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>Nyɛ waamwas bɛ tɔ boo du di egoo na kɔm-kɔm ɛ. Penek, bot ɛbuɛpe aadi ɛ́ tɔ mɛgwyɛ nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Tin, bot ɛ epiki ɛ́ waakas tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Sɛɛg'ɔɔ dáa gwyes. Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, gwakeka ɛnyɔɛpe.»<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛkwom ɛ epata di syela ɛ nɛ esa e ghoŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>«Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ́ dáa di ɛkwom ɛ epata di syela tɔ pyeeb ɛ. Dáa dhiiti mot nakabela yɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boobaazɛsyel yɛ é di sis tɔ pyeeb'enek. É di'enek, nyɛ moo ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛkɛbɔmsa esa bɛ djas étɛp nyɛ neezɛbɔm pyeeb tak.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>«Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ baanɔŋel ɛ́, nɛ mot di esaa esa e ghoŋ étɛp nyɛ neebɔmsa ɔ. Nyɛ dyeebasaŋ ɛ́ tɛtɛ esa e ghoŋ na nyenyɔ-nyɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>Yɛ kabɛ náá, nyɛ eebela yii na nyenyɔnyɔ dhaa bɛsɔ djas nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ɔɔ, nyɛ kakɛbɔmsa ɛ́ esa bɛ djas étɛp nyɛ neezɛbɔm yii zaag na boo mɛtaŋ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana ɛwyet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>«Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, baanɔŋel ɛ́, nɛ ɛwyet bɛ di ela tɔ dii ɛ. Ɛwyet ɛ tak dyeebamɛt ɛ́ ekɔkɔ bɛsu djas. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, ɛwyet eezelwood ɔɔ, bɛlael ɛ mɛwyet kadul yɛ ɛ, zyɛ nɛ yɛ pɛ kyiid, da bɛ ɛ́ nɔɔ mɛnyel disi étɛp ɛdis ɛ́ bɛsu ɛ́ bel é ɛwyet ɛ tak ɔ. Tin, bɛ kabɛk bɛ edi ɛ́ bɛkak. Bɛ nɔɔ bɛtɛtɛ, wa tɔ mɛbɔɔl, yɛ kabɛ bɛ na sikɛ-sikɛ nɛ embee e tak ɔ, bɛ kamwas bɛ ɛ́ mwasak. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Ɛsi ɛ bɔs aadi ɛ́ deenek: Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadhis efofop bɛ zɛwa mbek pak mbee bot nɛ bot ɛ epiki. <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>Etɛɛ náá, mbee bot ɛ́ waakɛlóoaa tɔ boo du na kɔm-kɔm. Tin, bot ɛbuɛpe waadje mɛgwyɛ nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛvu mɛ na bes nɛ yii na mwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Yezu zokazɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi eemɛt ɛsuk ɛ etɛp binek é?» Bɔɔ náá: «Iyoo» <verse eid="MAT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp tak ɛ́ di náá: ghaa mɛkana mɛ etsi djas di ekwos ɛdi djekel étɛp Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ dáa kuma mot di enɔɔ ɛkwom ɛ lɛ pɛ tɔ mɛvu mɛ na mwa zɛnɔɔ yii na bes ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bot ɛ Nazalɛt ààmyaal Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Bhii Yezu nasilal ɛlyo bot tɔ ekana binek ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>Nyɛ natɔ́ ɛ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ nyɛ nawyee kɔ tak ɛ. Nyɛ moo tin elyo bot tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Tin, bot ɛ nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ, naadyeebadjoka ɛbuɛpe, bɛ moo tin eke náá: «Nyɛ kɛbela yak kwaambi etsoŋ nɛ mbi yak endem e mɛbwala paa? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Mɔn'ak tok wak mɔn salpande? Ye tok Maali di wak nyɛɛg é? Zak bɛ nɛ Zozɛf, nɛ Simɔŋ, zɛnɔɔ Yudas tok bɛdhyeeb é? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Haa ye tok bɛkɛl mena nɛ bɛ nɔɔ di mɛlu djas é di wat'aak é? Ha nyɛ kɛbela yenek mɛbwala paa?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Egeka binek djas ɛ́ nasa náá, ɛmyaal nɛ ɛbwaalel ɛ bot binɔk djas dus kɔ Yezu. É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb dyeebaduwalaa ɛ́, pɛ kyee sis, ààbɛ pɛ kɔ dɛl ɛ nyɛ nabyel kɔ tak ɛ, nɛghu tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ nɛ tɔ bil'ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala tin, étɛp mɛlyel mɛ elyem bɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɛsyee ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>É ghɛŋ tak Elood mot nadi mɛkoozi kɔ Yeluzalɛm ɔ, zokagwak menduk ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ náá: «Ye ɛ́ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot ɛ baagom ɛ́ gomak é! Étɛp tak ɛ́ nyɛ di nɛ ghwyil ɛsa bɛtɛ nɛ yenek endem e mɛbwala.»<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛkoozi Elood naalwom náá, bɛ mɛt Zaŋ, da bɛ ɛ́ kɔl nyɛ nɛ eghwooz. Bhii tak, bɛ naakɛwa nyɛ é membok. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp Elodiaad, mwaa tel Filip, <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ naake nɛ Elood náá: «Dum nɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz, ye ààgoka náá, wɔy dɛk Elodiaad<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Elodiaad </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɔ etsi eYuda, mot nabɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛba mwaa mɔn nyɛɛg sonok mɔn nyɛɛg dinaa nɛ tsik.</char></note> mwaa tel'ɔ!» <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Étɛp tak ɛ Elood nakadi esaa dáa nyɛ aasa étɛp nyɛ neegó Zaŋ. Nyɛ nadi ekaab ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ djas nakeke ɛ́ náá, Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nabɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Tinaak, é dwoo ɛbyoŋ ɛ Elood di eduwal ɛbyel ɛlɛɛ ɛ, ɛsyes ɛ Elodiaad naabɔl é mis mɛ bɛdjoŋ ɛ nadjóoaa é ɛbyoŋ ɔ. Elood naadyeebamyaala nɛ ko zɛŋ ɛsyes ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>Tin, mɛkoozi Elood ɛ́ booke nɛ ɛsyes ɛ mɔɔ moma yenɔk náá: «Myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mam! Waaba esa ee lyem'ɔ kwyɛl ɛ djas, mɛ waadjɛ wɔ!» <verse eid="MAT 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Ɛsyes ɛlenɔk zokazɛwaab sa nyɛɛg nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ. Nyɛy náá: «Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, wɔ djɛ mɛ nenak yak lo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot kɛla kɔ pɛt kongo na pyaaz!» <verse eid="MAT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Wɔ gwaa, ye sa Mɛkoozi Elood nyel «wɔyɔŋ» nɛ ghoŋ. Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabɛ nɛ tyee nyɛ pɛɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naazetuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ é mis mɛ bɛdjoŋ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nɛ bot bɛ náá, bɛ djɛ nyɛ sa nyɛ nawaab ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Tin, nyɛ eezɛlwom dhiiti mot étɛp nyɛ neekɛtsaal lo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot pɛ nyɛ nadi tɔ membok ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazyɛ nɛ lo ɛ Zaŋ kɔ pɛt kongo na pyaaz, bɛ eezɛdjɛ ɛsyes ɛ mɔɔ moma yenɔk. Tin, ɛsyes ɛ tak ɛ́ boonɔɔ yɛ, kɛdjɛ nɛ nyɛɛg. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Tin, bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ muu'ɛ, kɛdel. Bhii tak, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ kɛbaŋa Yezu etɛp djas nadhaŋ ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu naazɛdjɛ bot bɛmil ɛtɛn edee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Dáa Yezu nagwak etɛp binek djas ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boodus tin, nyɛ eezɛni tɔ elɛɛd, tɔ́, kɛsaa di ɛwala pɛ bot aadi ààbee nyɛ ɛ. Ghuna ɛdhuu ɛ bot naagu ze nyɛ natɔ́ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot nadus pɛ mɛl mɛ nadi é engwoob tin ɔ, zɛdu nyɛ nɛ mɛko mbaka-mbaka nɛ dii. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Dáa Yezu nasul tɔ elɛɛd ɛ, nyɛ kabee ɛ́ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, ye nabɛ ghoŋ naasa nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe. Nyɛ moo tin etsik bot mɛbɛ́ mɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Dáa bɛ nabee náá, dwoo moo ɛ́ bikoko ɛ, bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Dwoo eezeleega. Tɔ kakoŋ'ak, ye tok nɛ bɔɔ mɛl. Swaala bot bak étɛp bɛ neekɛsaa edee pɛ bɔɔ mɛl mɛ di é engwoob'aak.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ààgoka náá, bɛ swaalaa, djɛka bɛ edee biyɔ bɛ ɛmet!» <verse eid="MAT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Tin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Zuka nɛ sa bis di nɛ yɛ wak ɛ, ye ɛ́ etsim e emapa etɛn nɛ bɛsu ɛbá.»<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dhaka nɛ yɛ wak.» <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>É di'enek, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ náá, bɛ disi mendiindil kɔ bɔɔ eka e na bes. Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ emapa etɛn nɛ bɛsu ɛbá binek, nyɛ eezɛben mis pɛ ɛko, zɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ eezɛpyak emapa, nɔɔ, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ yɛ, kaa, djɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Mot nɛ mot naadɛ, djil. Wɔ gwaa, bɛdjekel baabula nɛ mɛbhubhwak mɛ emapa nɛ bɛsu ɛ nalik ɛ, ye naalwoodal mɛbhwaa kam nɛ ebá. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Bot ɛ nadɛ emapa nɛ bɛsu binek ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ tyee botom bɛmil ɛtɛn, ààkalaa mɛtaŋ mɛ boa nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛkɛ kɔ mɛdii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Batsa bhii tak, Yezu eezelwom bɛdjekel bɛ náá, bɛ ni tɔ elɛɛd, tsaal, tɔ́ pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato. Tin, nyɛ eezɛlik é ɛswaal ɛ zukamwaa nɛ bot binɔk pɛ mendjaa mɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Bhii nyɛ nazeswaal bɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boo zɛbyet kɔ ɛtsok étɛp ɛkɛdjaala Zɛɛb. Dáa ye nabɛ náá, dwoo nabɛ ɛ́ yɛ eezesila ɛ, nyɛ nakalik tin ɛ́ nyɛ ɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Elɛɛd nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ ɛboŋ. Wɔ gwaa, boo ghuu zɛpupal kɔ dii, tin, bhuuge moo tin enyuŋa e elɛɛd, etɛɛ náá, pup nadi ebulal bɛ elɛɛd pɛ bhis. <verse eid="MAT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Kuku pum, tɔ ghooghom, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛsul kɔ dii, nyɛ moo tin edu bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛ nadi ekɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛko mɛ kɔ dii. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Dáa bɛdjekel bɛ nabee nyɛ ekɛ kɔ dii ɛ, bwoo naasa bɛ ɛlyelɛpe. Bɔɔ náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ dim!» Bɛ moo tin etsim nɛ bɛbebwol. <verse eid="MAT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Batsa deenek, Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛ. Nyɛy náá: «Nàbemka ba. Saka mɛghaaz. Ye ɛ́ mam.»<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Dáa nyɛ nabee deenek ɛ, Pyɛɛd ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, yɛ bɛ náá, ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ye ɛ́ wɔy ɔɔ, kea náá, mɛ kɛ kɔ mɛdii, zyɛ pɛ wɔ di'enek.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Dha!» Tin, Pyɛɛd ɛ́ boozɛwyis tɔ elɛɛd, sul kɔ dii. É di'enek, Pyɛɛd moo kɛ kɔ dii nɛ mɛko mɛ, etɔ́ pɛ kyee Yezu nadi ɛ́. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Tinaak, dáa nyɛ nabee náá, ghuu naalyel pyep ɛ. Wɔ gwaa bwoo zɛsa nyɛ. É di tak wat, nyɛ moo ediida tɔ dii, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Ghɛŋ, tsika mɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>É di tak wat, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛsɛɛb mbɔ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokamɛt Pyɛɛd, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ be mɛso? Ɛmyaal ɛ lɔ ààdyeebabɔk.» <verse eid="MAT 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Bhii tak, bɔɔ djas bɛbá eezɛgo tɔ elɛɛd. Tin, ghuu yenek eezɛsila. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Tin, bɛdjekel ɛ nadi tɔ elɛɛd ɔ, zokazyɛ, zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko ɛ Yezu. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn Zɛɛb!»<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsik membel pɛ kyee dik Ghenezalɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Bhii bɛ nasɛɛ dii ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Ghenezalɛt. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Dáa bɛ nakum é di'enek ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ dɛl ɛ tak zokazɛgwyak Yezu. Tin, lɛŋ ɛ ɛkum ɛ Yezu zokadjala mɛl djas, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazyɛ nɛ membel djas bɛ nadi nɛ nɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Bot ɛ tak ɛ́ boozɛdjaala nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ bet membel djas, bɔɔ bɛ ɛmet zokee-keeak ɛlɔ ɛ ndjookuwa yɛ. Tin, bot djas namɛt nyɛ ɔ nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ naatsak.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Etsi ee bɛbhaab bina nalik ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Dhiiti dwoo eFalizyɛ nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi naadus pɛ Yeluzalɛm zɛboma nɛ Yezu, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>«Étɛp yé bɛdjekel bɔ di ààduwal etsi e bɛbhaab bina nalik ɛ? Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ bɛ ààgwyii mɛmbɔ, bɛ di náá, bɛ moo dɛ edee ɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di ààkɛ dáa etsi e Zɛɛb di lɛɛ ɛ? Bi kwyɛl ɛkɛ ɛ́ dáa etsi e mbyak'en di elɛɛ ɛ! <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ke ɛ́ náá: “Dila soog nɛ nyoog. Mot ɛ di ekal sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg ɔɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsyee.” <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔ, bi lyo bot ɛ́ náá, mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlɛɛ nɛ sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg náá: “Esa ee mɛ waakwyee bin nɛ ye ɛ, mɛ eenɔɔ kɛdjɛ étɛp ɛtuud ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ yɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>Mot ɛ́ ke deenek ɔɔ, nyɛ tok nɛ gwyes ɛkwyee sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg. É di'enek, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛpesa náá, mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb zɛhoola, étɛp ɛsa nɛ ɛduwal etsi bin biyɔ bɛ ɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ gham nɛ nyɛ nɛ ke náá:<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>“Bot ɛ mbyak'ak duwal mɛ ɛ́ duwela mɛkɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">elyem bɔɔ ɛ́ pɛ kyee sis.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Zɛɛga mendjaala mɔɔ, ye ɛ́ yii toto é mis mam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">etɛɛ náá, mɛlyo mɛ bɛ di elyo ɛ́ mɛlyo mɛ epuud<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Eza 29.13</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ esa ee di epul mot ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Wɔ gwaa Yezu zokazɛdjóo ɛdhuu ɛ bot, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɔɔ djas náá: «Biyɔ djas, gwakeka mɛ, da bi ɛ́ mɛt sa mɛ di elii'aak: <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Ye tok sa mot di ewa tɔ nuub'ɛ ɛ, di epul mot é mis ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Ye ɛ́ sa wyis tɔ nuub ɛ di epul mot tak é mis ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="MAT 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Tin, bɛdjekel ɛ́ boozyɛ, zɛlɛɛ Yezu náá: «Wɔ nɛ gu náá, etɛp ee wɔ lii'enek eedyeebakpaa eFalizyɛ tɔ elyem é?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛbhek djas di náá, ye tok Saag'am di tɔ gwoo ɛ nabɛ ɛ́, yɛ aadi ɛ́ guaa.» <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Betka bɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ bɛ na edhim ɛ di edjɛɛd bɛsɔ bɔɔ bɛ na edhim. Tin, ye nyɔ bi ɛ́ gu náá: Yɛ bɛ náá, ye ɛ́ mot edhim ɛ di edul sɔ mot edhim ze ɔɔ, ɛsik ɛ tak ɛ náá, bɔɔ djas ɛ́ waadjoola tɔ guk.» <verse eid="MAT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Tin, Pyɛɛd ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Lɛɛa bis sa ekana binek di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ biyɔ pe, bi tok nɛ etsoŋ ɛtiibal é? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Bi ààgu náá, esa djas mot di ewa tɔ nuub ɛ, dhaŋ ɛ́ tɔ mɔ yɛ. Bhii tak, ye kakɛwyis ɛ́ tɔ́ ɛbyeed é?» <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazɛke náá: «Sa di ewyis tɔ nuub mot ɛ ààpul edɛɛ e mot. Ye ɛ sa di edus tɔ lyem ɛ di epul edɛɛ e mot. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Etɛɛ náá, embee egeka dus ɛ́ tɔ lyem mot. Yɛ ɛ́ esiiza ɛ di elwom bot náá, bɛ gó bot, bɛ sa mɛzɔ, bɛ sa mɛpam, bɛ djii, nɛ ɛsu bɔn nyɛɛg bɔɔ etɛp nɛ mɛbhekel. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Yenek ɛ́ esesɛɛ ee di epul ɛgwakel pak bot nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ tɛp ɛdɛ edee ààgwyii mɛmbɔ ɔ, yɛ ààpul mot é mis mɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjoŋ moma eedum koŋ nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yezu zokadus tin, tɔ́ pɛ kyee dik eghaada Tiid nɛ Sidɔn. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Dhiiti moma dɛl ɛ Kanan nadidi kɔ kyee dik ɛ tak ɔ, zokazyɛ pɛ daa lɛ, nyɛ moo tin etsim náá: «Ghɛŋ, Mɔn Dhavid, geka mɛ ghoŋ, dhiiti kwaambi mbee sisim ɛpedhek mɔn ɛsyes ɛ lam, nyɛ tok ɛnyɔɛpe!» <verse eid="MAT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Tin, Yezu gwyem'enek, ààbis moma tak. Wɔ gwaa bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Sɔa nyɛ, étɛp nyɛ ɛpedu mena nɛ etsim lookɛbok mos.» <verse eid="MAT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ nadhisaa ɛ́, kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl di bɛ eezediib dáa bɔɔ ebhata ee di ààbɛ nɛ mbaalel ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Tin, wɔ gwaa moma yenɔk zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko ɛ Yezu. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, kwyeea mɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ àànyɔ náá, bɔn bɛbhyɛ djɛaa emapa di náá, ye ɛ́ yii bɔn bot ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Wɔ gwaa moma yenɔk baazɛpesal náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ gham, Ghɛŋ! Tin, bɛbhyɛ aazodedɛ ɛ́ bɔɔ eghutu-ghutu emapa dyeebakwyit é mesa kukuma yɔɔ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ moma yenɔk náá: «Hee moma! Ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ bɔk. Étɛp tak ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadjɛ wɔ sa lyem'ɔ di ekwos ɛ.» É di tak wat, wɔ gwaa mɔn zokatsak.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik membel ɛbuɛpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛdus tin, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛboŋ ɛ boo soob na djato-djato Ghalile. Nyɛ eezɛbyet kɔ mɔɔ ɛtsok, nɔɔ nyel, disi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Bot mɛdhuu-mɛdhuu zokazyɛ nɛ bot ɛ edjam, bot ɛ edhim, eboka e bot, ebubu e bot, nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ membel. Bɛ eezɛsil bɛ sok bhwoob'ɛ. Tin, Yezu zokazɛtsik bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Ɛdhuu ɛ bot naadyeebadjoka dáa bɛ nadi ebee ebubu moo lii ɛ, bot ɛ edjam nɛ eboka moo kɛ ɛ, bot ɛ edhim moo nyaa sok ɛ. Bɛ moo tin eduwal Zɛɛb Yisalaɛl.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdjɛ bot bɛmil ɛna edee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «“Ha” kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot bak e! Mena nɛ bɛ nɔɔ moo mos ɛ́ mɛlu mɛlɛl e di wat. Bɛ tokapɛ nɛ edee e dek. Mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛswaal bɛ pɛ mendjaa mɔɔ tɔ emɔ toto, bɛ waazuk, ze ɛ ze.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Tin, bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mena aabela edee ee ɛdhuu ɛ bot bak djas aadɛ, djil nɛ yɛ ɛ paa? Menabɛl ɛ́ dika kuku kakoŋ'aak?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi ɛ́ nɛ emapa edhen?» Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza náá: «Etɛn nɛ ebá nɛ ba bɔɔ bɛsu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot náá, bɛ disi é bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ emapa etɛn nɛ ebá nɛ bɛsu binek zɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛpyak yɛ ebil-ebil. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ yɛ náá, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, bɛ neekaa bot djas. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Mot nɛ mot naadɛ, djil. Bɛdjekel bula nɛ yii nabwak ɛ. Mɛbhubhwak naalwoodal bɛbhwaŋ ɛtɛn nɛ ebá. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Bot ɛ nadɛ ɔ, naakum botom bɛmil ɛná (4 000), ààlaa-laŋak boa nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb. <verse eid="MAT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Bhii tak Yezu ɛ́ boozɛswaal bot ɛ tak bɛ sik pɛ mendjaa mɔɔ. É di'enek wat, nyɛ eezɛni tɔ elɛɛd, bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Maghadan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">EFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ ɛpesaa dhiiti ndem mɛbwala aadus pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>EFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ naazyɛ pɛ dáa Yezu étɛp ɛsaŋ ɛ ɛlóo ɛ nyɛ pɛ ɛko, da ɛ́ bwood nyɛ pɛ kiyɛ. Bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá, nyɛ lyaal bɛdhiiti ndem mɛbwala di edus pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Yezu ɛ́ boo kabulal bɛ dáak: «Dwoo ɛ́ sila ɔɔ, bi ke ɛ́: “Yɛ aadi ɛ́, mbɛɛ dwoo, etɛɛ náá, gwoo moo ɛ́ tɔɔbelaa.” <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Kɛɛŋ tɔ mɛlem, bi dyeebake ɛ́: “Bhi ɛ́ waanee mos, etɛɛ náá, gwoo ɛ́ tɔɔbelaa.” Bi nɛ gu ɛbɛk embi e gwoo; ghuna bi ààgu ɛbɛk embi e endem di edhaa mɛlu mak ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Biyɔ, bot ɛ mɛlu mak, bi ɛ́ bɛmbee ɛ bot, bot ɛ di ààbɛ sosoob é mis mɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Bi kasaŋ ɛ́ endem e mɛbwala. Yɛ aanàkwaadjɛaa bin bhis yɛ Yonas nasael ɛ.» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbet bɛ, zɛtɔ́.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Leviid e eFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>É di bɛdjekel nadhaa pɛ yii kyiid soob ɔ, bɛ eezɛdjisa ɛnɔŋ ɛ emapa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yezu ɛ́ boolɛɛ bɛ náá: «Dika nɛ etsoŋ, da bi ɛ́ kyee leviid e eFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ di nɛ yɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Bɛdjekel moo tin é nyiiŋela pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ lii deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mena ààpanɔɔka emapa.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yezu eezɛgu sa bɛ nadi enyiiŋela ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di elii pak'en: Ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, mena tok nɛ mapa é? Dáa ɛbwaalel ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb di batsa ɛ! <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Bi dinaa ààpaamɛt ɛsuk, bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtaala emapa etɛn mɛ nakaa botom bɛmil ɛtɛn yɛ ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛbhwaa bi nabula nɛ yɛ ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtaala emapa etɛn nɛ ebá mɛ nakaa bot bɛmil ɛna yɛ ɛ, nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛbhwaŋ ɛ bi nabula nɛ ye ɛ́? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Étɛp yé bi di ààgu náá, mɛ bɛ ɛ́ ààlii nɛ nen étɛp emapa é sok mɛ lii nɛ nen ɛ? Mɛ ke ɛ́ náá: “Kyeeka emapa eFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ”.»<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>É di tak, bɛdjekel eezɛgu náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààke náá, bɛ kyee leviid di waaa tɔ emapa ɛ. Ghuna ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛlyo mɛ eFalizyɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd eezɛlɛɛ náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yezu zɛkum ko bɔs ɛ Sezaad ɛ Filip. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Bot ke dáa dum nɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bɛdhiiti ke ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot, bak náá, wɔ ɛ́ Eli. Bɛdhiiti kabaake ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Zelemi nɛghu dhiiti ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="MAT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: «Haa! Biyɔ, bi ke náá, mam ɛ́ zɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Tin, Simɔŋ Pyɛɛd zɛbɔɔza náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ Mɛsia, Mɔn Zɛɛb di nɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛnyɔ nɛ nɔ, Simɔŋ mɔn Zaŋ, etɛɛ náá, ye tok mot epuud zetel wɔ yenek etsɛɛtsɛ, gua náá ye ɛ́ Saag'am di tɔ gwoo ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Yɛ bɛ mam ɔ, mɛ ɛpelɛɛ wɔ, wɔy Pyɛɛd wɔ ɛkok, kɔ ɛkok ɛ tak ɛ́ mɛ aakus di zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala mam. Ɛsyee aanàkwaakwak yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Mɛ waaboodjɛ wɔ bɛsap ɛ ndjaa Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Sa wɔ aalu kɔ bɔs ɛ, yɛ waaluel tɔ gwoo. Sa wɔ aadjɛ ze kɔ bɔs ɛ, ze ɛ́ waadjɛel tɔ gwoo.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛlu bɛdjekel bɛ náá, sa bɛ ààlɛɛ mot náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Mɛsia.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlɛɛ ɛsyee ɛ lɛ nɛ ɛgom ɛ lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>É di'enek, Yezu moo zɛlɛɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mɛ tɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, étɛp mɛ neekɛzuk ɛbuɛpe é mɛmbɔ mɛ bɛpaa eYuda, bɛ nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, zɛnɔɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi. Bɛ waagó mɛ, bhii mɛlu mɛlɛl, mɛ waagom.» <verse eid="MAT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>É di'enek, Pyɛɛd eezɛdul nyɛ é ngwoob bɛ nɛ nɛ bɛbá, nyɛ moo djɛ nyɛ mɛbɛ: «Zɛɛb baal wɔ, Ghɛŋ! Yenek aanàkwaakosael.» <verse eid="MAT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbhɛm nyɛ. Nyɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Dusa! Tɔ́a ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nam, Satan! Wɔ ɛ́ ɛbɛk é ze yam, etɛɛ náá, esiiza bɔ tok dáa yii Zɛɛb, gua náá, yɔ esiiza ɛ́ yii bot.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Mot ɛ́ ke náá, nyɛ aazyɛ bis nɛ nɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ bet ɛsiiza etɛp nyel'ɛ, nyɛ bɛp mɛlaaba mɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ du mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Etɛɛ náá, mot di ekwyɛl ɛtsik ɛ nyel'ɔ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ waasu nyel'ɛ. Ghuna mot aasu nyel'ɛ étɛp'am ɔ, nyɛ waabela yɛ! <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Duma yé mot aadi nɛ yɛ, nyɛ bela dik djas, da nyɛ ɛ́ kasu ɛ tsik'ɛ ɔ? Ye ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti sa mot aadjɛ étɛp ɛbɔm ɛ tsik'ɛ? Mam ààbee! <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aazyɛ tɔ duma Sɛɛg, bɛ nɛ efofop bɛ. É di'enek ɛ́ nyɛ aadjɛ mot nɛ mot efute mɛsa mɛ tyee nyɛ nadi eke ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di wak ɔ, bɛ aanàkwaagwyɛ ɛsok nɛ bɛ nɛ bee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ezyɛ tɔ Mɛkoozi mɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eeswoola bhwoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ wat bhii tak, Yezu naanɔɔ Pyɛɛd, Zak nɛ Zaŋ mɔn nyɛɛg ɛ Zak. Nyɛ naazɛtɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ kɔ vyɛɛg-vyɛɛg ɛtsok é di tak bɛ nadi ɛ́ bɔɔ bɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>É di'enek, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛswoola bhwoob é mis mɔɔ. Bhwoob'ɛ moo tin ɛkasɛpe dáa gwyes, ekaad bɛ moo ɛkasɛpe dáa dwoo. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>É di tak wat, bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛbee Moiiz nɛ Eli elɛɛ elɛŋ bɛ nɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Wɔ gwaa Pyɛɛd zokazɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Ghɛŋ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mena di wak. Wɔ kwyɛl ɔɔ, mɛ ɛ́ sum epɛt elɛl: wat yɔ, yak yɛ Moiiz, yak wat kadi ɛ́, yɛ Eli.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Dáa nyɛ nadi nyɛ dinaa elii ɛ́, wɔ gwaa eguud na kas-kas zɛdipal bɛ. Bhii tak, gwood zokazɛgék náá: «Yenɔk ɛ́ mɔn'am mɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɔ, ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ́ mɛ natɔ. Gwakeka nyɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>É di bɛdjekel nagwak gwood'enek ɛ, bwoo naazɛsa bɛ ɛlyelɛpe, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛkwyit mɛboŋ mɔɔ, bhwoob si. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Yezu naazɛtiila pɛ daa lɔɔ, nyɛ eezɛmɛt bɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Wyɛlka. Nàdika nɛ bwoo.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Tin, bɛ nakaben mis ɛ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabee dhiiti mot bhii Yezu nyɛ ɛmet. <verse eid="MAT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Dáa bɛ nadi ewyeed ɛtsok ɛ, Yezu naazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa mot ààlɛɛ mot esesɛɛ mɛbwala mɛ bi bee ɛ. Baalka yɛ kɛkum dwoo Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Bhii tak, bɛdjekel naazɛdji Yezu náá: «Étɛp yé bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi dyeebake náá, Eli ɛ́ kwaaleezyɛ ɛsok?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Nyɛ naazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ye ɛ́ deenek. Eli ɛ́ di egoka nɛ ɛzyɛ sok étɛp ɛzɛkoobal etɛp djas. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Gwakeka, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, Eli eezezyɛ, bot ààpagwyak nyɛ. Bɛ kasa nyɛ ɛ, dáa elyem bɔɔ di ekwyɛl ɛ. Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ, bɛ aatiig Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>É di'enek, bɛdjekel naazɛgu náá, nyɛ nalii nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ dum nɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtsik mɔn nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ djem ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Dáa bɛ nakum é di ɛdhuu ɛ bot nadi ɔ, wɔ gwaa mot ngɔt zokazyɛ é bhaaz ɛ Yezu, zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>Nyɛy náá: «Ghɛŋ, geka mɔn'am ghoŋ, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ djem. É sok ye dyeebamɛt nyɛ ɛ́, ye nɛ lwak nyɛ, kɛghɛɛg nyɛ tɔ du, é dhiiti ɛwala, ye ghɛɛg nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ dii. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Mɛ naazyɛ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa bɛdjekel bɔ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwak ɛtsik nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>É di'enek, Yezu naazɛkim ɛlyelɛpe, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ bɛmbee ɛ bot di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ! Membu medhen mɛ aabaadi di wat nɛ nen sama? Mɛ baamaad bin, kɛkum yaa ɛlu? Dhaka mɛ nɛ mɔn'enɔk wak.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Tin, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛbhɛm mbee sisim. Mbee sisim tak naazɛwyis tɔ mɔn'enɔk. É di'enek wat, mɔn'enɔk naazɛtsak.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>É di'enek, bɛdjekel eezɛtiila é bhaaz ɛ Yezu nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet, bɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Étɛp yé bisɔ nadi ààkwak ɛsɔ mbee sisim'enek?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ tɔɔl. Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Bi ɛ́ pe di nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛbɔkɛpe dáa bhek le mutaad ɔɔ, pe bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛke nɛ ɛtsok ɛlak náá: “Dusa wak. Tɔ́ penek,” pe yɛ waadus. Tin, pe ye tok nɛ sa wat aadi nɛ ghwyil dhaa bin. [ <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Guka náá, ye ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil mendjaala nɛ ɛtsi ɛ edee ɛ wɔ aadis mbi yenek embee esisim.]»<verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eebaalɛɛ náá, nyɛ waagwyɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ baagom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Dwoo wat, bɛdjekel eezɛdi é di wat pɛ Ghalile. Tin, Yezu eezɛlɛɛ bɛ náá: «Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waakaaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot. <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>Bɛ waagó nyɛ, mɛlu mɛlɛl bhii tak, nyɛ waagom.» Tin, ghoŋ naazɛmɛt bɛdjekel dhaa nyel.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lapo Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>É ghɛŋ Yezu nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nakum pɛ ghaada Kapɛlnaum ɛ, bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo Ndjaa-ebuwa zokazyɛ pɛ kyee Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Lyoel yen ààtuud lapo Ndjaa-ebuwa?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Pyɛɛd ɛ naazɛbɔɔza náá: «Hee, nyɛ nɛ tuud.» É ghɛŋ Pyɛɛd nani tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ, Yezu nadi ɛ́ mot mɛkɛn ɛlii. Nyɛy náá: «Wɔ gek dáa, Simɔŋ? Ɛzɛ di egoka nɛ ɛtuud lapo nɛghu bɛdhiiti etuud pɛ dáa bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bɔs'ak? Ye ɛ́ bot ɛ dɛl “ohoo” nɛghu ye ɛ́ bɛdjoŋ?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Pyɛɛd ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Ye ɛ́ bɛdjoŋ.» É di'enek, Yezu eezɛpesal náá: «Wɔ bee ɔɔ, bot ɛ dɛl ààgoka nɛ ɛtuud lapo. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Ye ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mena ɛ́ zɛkɛdhusal bot binɔk. É di tak, Tɔ́a pɛ boo soob na djato-djato. Lóoa ngwyep tɔ dii, nɔŋa su mɛkɛn wɔ aabela ɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ dii nuub'ɛ, wɔ waabela pata aagoka nɛ ɛtuud ɛ lapo yam nɛ yɔ ɛ. Nɔŋa yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ tuud mena yenabɛl lapo.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Ye ɛ́ ɛzɛ di boo-mot tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>É ɛwala ɛlenek, bɛdjekel naazɛtiila é bhaaz ɛ Yezu, bɛ naazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Ye ɛ́ ɛzɛ di boo-mot tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>É di'enek, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛdjóo mɔɔ dhyeeb, zɛtel nyɛ é mis mɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Bi ɛ́ di ààswoola mɛfulu men, da bi ɛ́ di dáa bɔɔ dhyeeb ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaani tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Boo-mot tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ, ye ɛ́ mot di esil nyel'ɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ di dáa mɔn'ak ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Mot ɛ́ be ɛnyɔɛpe mɔɔ dhyeeb dáa mɔn'ak kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ lam ɔɔ, nyɛ be ɛ́ mam.»<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛdulaa mɛlɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛkwyesal ɛ bot tɔ mesyem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>«Mot aakwyesal mɔn ngɔt tɔ sama bɔn zedum koŋ nɛ nam tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bɛ tiŋal nyɛ boo ɛkok é tsuŋ. Bhii tak, da bɛ ɛ́ lóo nyɛ tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn, da nyɛ ɛ́ diida kɛkum pɛ si. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>“Haa” kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ bot ɛ di kɔ bɔs ɔ, etɛɛ náá, mɛbɛk mɛ di ekwyesal bot tɔ mesyem ɔ nɛ bu! Ye tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi ààbɛ. Tin, “haa” kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ mot aadi mɛbɛk menek ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, ye ɛ́, mbɔ'ɔ, nɛghu ko'ɔ ɛ́ di esa náá, wɔ gheekwye-kwyɛ tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, tsaala yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ mwas yɛ ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɔ. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ ni tɔ mbɛɛ tsik nɛ tsaala mbɔ, nɛghu tsaala ko, ààbɛ náá, wɔ baal mɛmbɔ mɛmbá nɛ mɛko mɛmbá, bhii tak, wɔ kakɛmwasaa ɛ́ tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, dis ɛ lɔ, di esa náá, wɔ kwyɛ, tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, piida yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ mwas yɛ ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɔ. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ ni tɔ mbɛɛ tsik nɛ tiila dis, ààbɛ náá, wɔ baal mis mɛmbá mɔ, bhii tak, wɔ kakɛmwasaa ɛ́, tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana bhata nabelaaa bhii nyɛ nazediib ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>«Bi ɛ́ koobaka! Sa mot ààbyasal mot ngɔt tɔ bɔn bak etɛɛ náá, efofop bɔɔ dyeebadi ɛ́, é di wat é mɛwala djas bɛ nɛ Saag'am di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ. [ <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>Etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛtsik bot ɛ nabɛ náá, bɛ eezediib ɔ.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>«Bi ke dáa? Pookogekeka náá, dhiiti mot ngɔt nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ebhata dhet (100). Tin, ngɔt zokazɛdiib, nyɛ aanàkwaalik ebhata mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛná nɛ etɛn nɛ ená (99) kɔ ɛtsok, étɛp nyɛ neekɛsaa ngɔt diib ɔ? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, nyɛ bela nyɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ waadi tɔ mɛmyaala ɛbuɛpe étɛp bhata wat'enɔk, dhaa ebhata nadi ààdiib ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Ye ɛ́ tyɛ wat nɛ Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ. Nyɛ ààkwyɛl náá, mot ngɔt tɔ bɔn bɛ djas wo ze.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">É sok mɔn nyoog di ekwyɛ ndjɛ sɔs ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>«Yɛ bɛ náá, mɔn nyoog eesa wɔ ɛbiyo ɔɔ, tɔ́ kɛbee nyɛ wɔy wɔ ɛmet. Da wɔ ɛ́ kɛlyaal nyɛ ɛbiyo ɛ lɛ. Nyɛ gwak wɔ ɔɔ, tin, wɔ eekwak ɛbulal ɛ nyɛ é ze. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Yɛ kabɛ náá, nyɛ ààpagwak wɔ ɔɔ, djóoa dhiiti mot ngɔt nɛghu bot ɛbá. Dáa ekwyala di elyaal ɛ náá: “Etɛp djas koobelaa ɛ́ é mis mɛ bɛtetɛp ɛbá nɛghu bɛlɛl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:15">Dɛt 9.15</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Tin, nyɛ byen ɛgwak bɛ ɔɔ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ sok bhwoob bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala. Nyɛ byen ɛgwak bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ɔɔ, tin, bi kaabee nyɛ ɛ́ dáa mot di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, dáa bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>«Mɛ ɛpelɛɛ bin, ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, etɛp djas ee bi ààpɛɛ wak kɔ bɔs ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waapɛɛ yɛ tɔ gwoo. Etɛp djas bi aamyaal wak kɔ bɔs ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waamyaal yɛ tɔ gwoo.<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>«Mɛ kabaalɛɛ bin ɛ náá, wak kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs, bot ɛbá ɛ́ gwakel, da bɛ ɛ́ waab sonok bɛ aakwyɛl ɛwaab tɔ mendjaala mɔɔ ɔɔ, Saag'am di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ waadjɛ bɛ sa bɛ waab ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛbá nɛghu bot ɛlɛl ɛ́ sɛɛga kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ lam ɔɔ, mɛ aadi ɛ́ tin, pak'ɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana mot-mɛsa di epɛɛ ɛpel ɛ́ mɔn nyɛɛg ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Wɔ gwaa Pyɛɛd zokazyɛ pɛ pak Yezu nadi ɛ́. Tin, nyɛ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, mɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛpel mɔn nyaag'am esok edhen nyɛ sa mɛ ɛbiyo ɔɔ? Tyee esok etɛn nɛ ebá?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yezu naazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ààbɛ, mɛ ààpalɛɛ nɛ nɔ náá, ye di esok etɛn nɛ ebá. Mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́, ye di esok mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá (70), esok etɛn nɛ ebá.<verse eid="MAT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>«Étɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ nɔŋel ɛ, nɛ dhiiti mɛkoozi nadi ekwyɛl ɛkoobal etɛp bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ nakola epata bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Tin, é ghɛŋ nyɛ nakan ɛdjóo ngɔt-ngɔt ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ zokazyɛ nyɛ nɛ mot-mɛsa mɛ ngɔt nakola epata ɛbuɛpe ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Mot'enɔk nabɛ ɛ́, ààbɛ nɛ sa nyɛ aabulal epata e kukuma tak nɛ yɛ. Kukuma yɛ ɛ́ boodjɛ ɛlee náá, nyɛy nɛ myɛl nɛ bɔn zɛnɔɔ esa bɛ djas bɔmsaa, etɛp epata e tak neebulal kola nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Tin, mot-mɛsa menɔk eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si sok bhwoob kukuma yɛ tak. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: “Sila lyem, da wɔ ɛ́ gek mɛ ghoŋ. Mɛ waazɛbulal wɔ epata binek djas!” <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Kukuma yɛ zokazɛgek nyɛ ghoŋ, nyɛ eezɛpel nyɛ nɛ epata ee nyɛ nakola ɛ djas. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbet nyɛ, nyɛ tɔ́.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>«Dáa mot-mɛsa menɔk nawyis tin ɛ, nyɛ eezɛboma nɛ dhiiti mɔn nyɛɛg nyɛy nakola nyɛ ba bɔɔ epata ɔ. Nyɛ eezɛvyɛk, mɛt nyɛ é tsuŋ “gbak”, nyɛ moo tin enyam nyɛ é tsuŋ ɛkɛɛ, nyɛ aagó nyɛ góak. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: “Tuuda mɛ kola yam nenak!” <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Mɔɔ sɔ zokazɛkwyit mɛboŋ si sok bhwoob'ɛ, nyɛ eedjaala nɛ nɛ náá: “Sila lyem, da wɔ ɛ́ gek mɛ ghoŋ. Bwooda batsa mɛ waatuud kola yɔ!” <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Wɔ gwaa nakuma epata zokapɛɛ. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ zokakɛkɔɔl mɔn nyɛɛg é mbok é bwood dwoo nyɛ aabulal epata bɛ ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>«Dáa bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mɛsa nabee deenek ɛ, ye naakpaa bɛ tɔ elyem. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́, kɛlɛɛ kukuma yɔɔ etɛp djas dhaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Tin, kukuma yɔɔ ɛ́ boozɛbaadjóo mot-mɛsa menɔk, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: “Wɔ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa mɛ di náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ mbee lyem! Mɛ bɛ mbembɛ ɛ́, mɛ eepel wɔ nɛ epata bam wɔ nakola ɛ, etɛɛ náá, wɔ bɛ ɛ́, wɔ eedjaala nɛ nam náá, mɛ bet wɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Ye goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ gek mɔɔ sɔ'ɔ ghoŋ dáa mɛ gek wɔ ghoŋ ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, kukuma eezebiyo ɛlyelɛpe, nyɛ ɛ́ boolwom náá, bɛ mɛt mot-mɛsa menɔk. Nyɛ kɛsa mɛsa mɛ bhel kɛkum dwoo nyɛ aaboobulal kola yenek djas ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ Saag'am di tɔ gwoo ɔ aasa nɛ nen, yɛ bɛ náá, mot nɛ mot ààpapel sɔ nɛ lyem wat ɔɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo ɛ Yezu dum nɛ tɛp ɛbel ɛ ɛba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Bhii Yezu nasilal ɛlyo bot pɛ kyee dik Ghalile ɛ, nyɛ naazɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Yude, pɛ yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Tin, zukamwaa nɛ mot baazɛdu nyɛ, Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokatsik bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ mɛ bɛ nazyɛ nɛ nɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Tin, wɔ gwaa bɛdhiiti eFalizyɛ zokazyɛ, zɛlaab nyɛ nɛ dhiiti mɛdjin. Bɔɔ nɛ Yezu náá: «Etsi bina ɛpemyaal náá, mot pɛɛ myɛl kɔ ɛsu ɛ etɛp mbɛs é?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ààlaa sa di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ Zɛɛb é? “É ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nakus bɔs ɛ, nyɛ nakus ɛ moma nɛ motom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Mɛk 1.27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5.2</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>Nyɛ eebaazɛbil náá: “Étɛp tak ɛ́ ye di náá, motom ɛ́ waalik sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg, étɛp nyɛ neekɛsɛɛga bɛ nɛ myɛl. Tin, bɔɔ bɛbá aakadi ɛ́, bɛ moo mot ngɔt. <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>É di'enek, bɛ tokapɛ bot ɛbá, bɛ aakadi ɛ́, bɛ moo mot ngɔt. Sa mot ààbɛk sa di náá, Zɛɛb eesɛɛg ɛ.”»<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>EFalizyɛ ɛ́ boo baadji nyɛ náá: «Étɛp yé Moiiz nalɛɛ náá, yɛ bɛ náá, motom ɛpekwyɛl ɛsɔ myɛl ɔɔ, nyɛ kwyal nyɛ mɛkana mɛ di lɛɛ mɛsɔ mɛ nyɛ pɛɛ nyɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Moiiz namyaal náá, bi pɛɛ bɛl bin ɛ́, étɛp mɛlyel mɛ elyem bin. Etɛɛ náá, é ɛkɛn ɛ bɔs, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ deenek. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, motom ɛ́ pɛɛ myɛl, da nyɛ ɛ́ baakɛba dhiiti moma sis, ààbɛ náá, myɛl tak eesa ɛzɔ ɔɔ, tin, motom'enɔk eesa ɛzɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Tin, bɛdjekel eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, etɛp ɛba goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ deenek pak moma nɛ motom ɔɔ, ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, mot di yɛ kɔ, ààba moma.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>É di'enek, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bot djas ààdyeebakwyɛl mbi mɛlyo mak. Tin, ye ɛ́ bot ɛ Zɛɛb yii nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet aadjɛ ghwyil ɔ aapaakwak yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Ye ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ etɛp di elu náá, bot nàba ɛ. Ye ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ nabyel náá, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛba yɔbɔ ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɔ, ye ɛ́ bɛsɔ bɔɔ bot ɛ aapaasa náá, bɛ nàkwyɛl ɛba. Bɛdhiiti aadi ààba ɛ́, étɛp Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Deenek yɛ bɛ náá, mot ɛpekwyɛl ɛmyaal mɛlyo mak ɔɔ, nyɛ myaal.»<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛsɛɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb mɛtel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Dhiiti dwoo, bot naazɛzyɛ Yezu nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb étɛp nyɛ needjaala bɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ɛkɛl ɛ bɛ mɛmbɔ. Wɔ gwaa bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛlu bot ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Dáa Yezu nabee deenek ɛ́, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛdjekel náá: «Betka bɔɔ dhyeeb, bɛ zyɛ pɛ daa lam! Nàluka bɛ etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ goka nɛ bot ɛ di tyee bɔɔ ɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛkɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ. Bhii nyɛ nakasilal ɛ, nyɛ boozɛnɔɔ nyel tɔ́.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɔɔ ngbaaz na ekum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Dáa bɛ nadi gba-gba é goŋ ɛ, dhiiti mot zokazyɛ pɛ daa Yezu, mot tak nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel! Mɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa yaa tɛtɛ sonok étɛp mɛ neebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ di edji mɛ mɛdjin dum nɛ tɛtɛ etɛp? Ye ɛ́ Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di tɛtɛ mot. Wɔ kwyɛl ɛni tɔ tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɔ, wɔ goka ɛ́ wɔ looba nɛ sa mɛtiŋ di elɛɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Mot'enɔk eezɛdji Yezu náá: «Yaa mɛtiŋ?» Yezu ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Sa wɔ ààgó mot. Sa wɔ ààsa mɛzɔ. Sa wɔ ààdjii sa mot. Sa wɔ ààlɛɛ elɛŋ e etsal dum nɛ mot. <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>Duwala soog nɛ nyoog. Kwyɛla sɔ'ɔ mot dáa wɔ di ekwyɛl nyel'ɔ wɔ ɛmet ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Ngbaaz'enɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛtiŋ menek djas mɛ nɛ duwal yɛ. Mɛ kabaasa yé?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>É di'enek, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl ɛdi tɔ epiki ɔɔ, tɔ́ kɛbɔmsa esa bɔ djas, da wɔ ɛ́ nɔɔ epata tak, djɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot. Tin, wɔ waabela mɛvu tɔ gwoo. Bhii tak, da wɔ ɛ́ zyɛ, zɛdu mɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Dáa ngbaaz'enɔk nagwak deenek ɛ, «kiyooo» nyɛ eeliigel, sik yɛ, etɛɛ náá, ye naatek nyɛ nyel, étɛp ekum ee nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛbuɛpe ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp ee tsɛɛtsɛ náá: Ɛkɔɔla náá, bot ɛ di nɛ mɛvu ɔ ni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ! <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Mɛ baalɛɛ bin ɛ náá, ɛkɔɔla náá, boo yaaga kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ dhaa tɔ ba mɔɔ ɛlen ɛ dhɔɔ. Yɛ kabɛ bɛkum ɛ bot ɔ, ɛni ɛ lɔɔ tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb eebaadhaa-dhaŋak ɛni ɛ yaaga tɔ ɛlen ɛ dhɔɔ nɛ mɛlyel.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Dáa bɛdjekel nagwak mɛkpa menek ɛ, bɛ naadyeebadjoka. Bhii tak, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji Yezu náá: «Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, ɛzɛ aabela tsik?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yezu zokabɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ye ɛ́ ɛpipɛpe é mis mɛ bot. Tin, mot ɛ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, yɛ waasael.» <verse eid="MAT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Gwaka! Bis eezekat mɛze mes nɛ etɛp bis djas étɛp ɛdu ɛ wɔ. Yisɔ efute aakadi tin yé?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, é ghɛŋ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aadi kɔ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ nɛ duma tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ na bes ɛ, biyɔ, bot kam nɛ bɛbá namyaal ɛdu ɛ mɛ ɔ, bi aadi ɛ́, kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ mɛkoozi kam nɛ ebá, étɛp ɛpɛ́ɛ ɛ membyak kam nɛ ebá ɛ Yisalaɛl. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Bot ɛ di ebet mendjaa mɔɔ, bɔn nyɛɛg bɔɔ, nɛ bɛkɛl bɔɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛsɛɛg bɔɔ nɛ bɛnyɛɛg bɔɔ, bɔn bɔɔ, zɛnɔɔ epyeeb bɔɔ étɛp'am ɔ, bɛ waabela bɛdhet nɛ bɛdhet kala kɔ yii. Bɛ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Tin, ye kabela ɛ́ náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ di mos é lɔɔg ɛsok ɔ, bɛ aakaswaala ɛ́ bot ɛ ɛbhis. Bot ɛ di mos pɛ lɔɔg ɛbhis ɔ, bɛ aaswaala ɛ́ bot ɛ lɔɔg ɛsok.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Kana bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ nalwomaa kɛsa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>«Beeka dhiiti sa di enɔŋel nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ: Dhiiti kukuma naazɛwyis tɔ ghooghom mɛlem kɛsaa bot étɛp bɛ neekɛsa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Bɛ nɛ bɛ nɔɔ zokagwakel náá, efute bɔɔ aadi ɛ́, dáa bot di ezyɛ nɛ ɛfutaa sok ɛ, nɛghu falanga wat tɔ ɛlu ɛ wat. Tin, nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ, bɛ kɛsa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb'ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>«Nyɛ eebaazɛwyis é ɛwala etɛn nɛ ená yii mɛlem, wɔ gwaa nyɛ baazɛboma nɛ bɛdhiiti bot metetel kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ dɛl, bɔɔ tin, ààbɛ nɛ mɛsa. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Biyɔ pe, tɔ́ka, kɛsaka mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin'am, mɛ aadjɛ bin efute dáa ye di egoka ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Tin, bot binɔk ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, tɔ́.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:5">«Bhii tak, kukuma yenɔk naabaazyɛ kuku mwos dwoo dɔɔ nɛ é ɛwala elɛl yii bikoko. Nyɛ nabaazolii ɛ́ dáa nyɛ nazolii nɛ bot ɛsok ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Nyɛ eebaazɛwyis bikoko, dwoo eezesila. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boo baazɛboma nɛ yak ɛdhuu ɛ bot. Nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: “Étɛp yé bi di wak, kana mɛlem, kɛyaka nɛ yak ɛwala, ààsa sonok?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Bot binɔk zokazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ: “Ye ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bis tok nɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛsa.” Bhii tak, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Dɔɔ nɛ biyɔ pe, tɔ́ka, kɛsaka mɛsa tɔ pyeeb vin'am.”»<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>«Dáa dwoo nakabɛ, ye moo bikoko ɛ, kukuma ɛ́ booke nɛ mot nadi kɔ elo e bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ djas ɔ náá: “Djóoa bot ɛ mɛsa, da wɔ ɛ́ djɛ mot nɛ mot efute bɛ. Wɔ kan ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ nadjóoaa ɛbhis ɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛsilal nɛ bot ɛ́ nakanaa ɛdjóoaa sok ɔ.”»<verse eid="MAT 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>«Tin, bot ɛ nakan mɛsa bikoko ɔ, zokazyɛ, zɛbela yɔbɔ efute e pata wat. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Dáa bot ɛsok nakazyɛ yɔbɔ ɛ́, bɛ nagek tɔ elyem bɔɔ ɛ náá, bɛ waabela efute dhaa bot ɛ nakan bikoko ɔ. Tin, bɛ nazokabaadjɛ bɛ ɛ́ efute e pata wat. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Beea bɛ nabee deenek ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛni é byak kukuma pyeeb. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>Bɔɔ náá: “Bot ɛ kan mɛsa nenak bikoko ɔ, bɛ zosa ɛ́ mɛsa é di ɛwala wat. Tin, wɔ kadjɛ bɛ efute ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ dáa wɔ djɛ bisɔ ɛ? Bot ɛ kan mɛsa tɔ mɛlem ɔ, si kas-kas gwyes nɛ etuŋ, zɛnɔɔ mɛnyel na ‘wɔyɔŋ’ ghwyil djas eezesi.”»<verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>«Tin, kukuma ɛ́ boobɔɔza nɛ ngɔt pak'ɔɔ náá: “Mɔn nyaag'am, ye tok nɛ ɛbiyo mɛ sa ɛ. Tin, mena bɛ ààgwakel náá, wɔ sa mɛsa ɛ étɛp wɔ neebela etuud e pata wat, di egoka náá, ye djɛaa nɛ mot sa mɛsa mɛ dwoo wat ɔ, etsal é? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Nɔŋa pata yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ tɔ́ yɔ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ neebaadjɛ nwyak mot kalik'aak dáa mɛ djɛ wɔy ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbe esa bam dáa lyem'am di ekwyɛl ɛ? Étɛp yé wɔ di ebyen náá, mɛ sa enɛm esa?”»<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ bookabaazɛpesal náá: «Yɛ aadi ɛ́ deenek, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ́ di bot ɛ mɛsik'aak, bɛ kaaswaalaaa ɛ́, bot ɛ ɛsok. Bot ɛ ɛsok'aak aaswaalaa ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛsik.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ye moo ɛ́ tyee esok elɛl ee Yezu di elɛɛ tɛp ɛsyee nɛ ɛgom ɛ lɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Dáa Yezu nadi etɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, nyɛ naazɛnɔɔ bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá bɔɔ bɛ ɛmet. Tin, dáa bɛ nadi ekɛ ze ɛ ze ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ bɛdjekel náá: <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>«Gwakeka, mena tɔ́ka wak ɛ́, pɛ Yeluzalɛm pɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aakɛkaaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ, étɛp bɛ needjɛ nyɛ epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Bhii tak, bɛ waaka nyɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, étɛp bɛ needim nyɛ nɛ ɛduk nyɛ. Bɛ waanyuu nyɛ nɛ eghwyɛs bhii tak, da nyɛ ɛ́ kɛbemaa kɔ mɛlaaba. Tin, é mɛlu mɛlɛl bhii ɛsyee ɛ lɛ, nyɛ waagom.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngwyeebel ɛ nyɛɛg ɛ Zak bɛ nɛ Zaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Wɔ gwaa, mwaa Zɛbɛdɛ zokazyɛ nɛ bɔn bɛ bɛbá zɛbee Yezu. Dáa bɛ nakum é di Yezu nadi ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ sok bhwoob'ɛ étɛp nyɛ neewaab sonok pɛ daa lɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ saa yé?» Moma tak ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Beea bɔn bam bɛbá bak. Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, wɔ kɛk mɛ náá, bɛ bela duma di náá, ngɔt di pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bɔ, nwyak ngɔt pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɛ lɔ, é sok waadi tɔ mɛkoozi mɔ ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza náá: «Bi ààgu sa bi di ewaab ɛ. Bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbɛp kɔm mezuk mɛ mam aabɛp ɛ?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Hɛɛɛ! Bis ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbɛp.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɔn bɛ bɛbá náá: «Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ! Bi ɛ́ waabɛp kɔm mezuk mam. Yɛ kabɛ dum nɛ tɛp ɛdi pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bam nɛghu pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɛ lam ɔ, mam tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ bin edi é tak. Etɛɛ náá, Saag'am ɛ di egu bot ɛ nyɛ aadjɛ edi binek ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Dáa bak bɛdjekel kam nalik ɛ nagwak deenek ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye naakpaa bɛ elyem nɛ sa Zak bɛ nɛ Zaŋ nasa ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ bookazɛdjóo bɔɔ djas, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi kabɛ edjak náá, mɛsa mɛ ekukuma e bot ɛ bɔs ɛ́ ɛnyal bot ɛ́ di ezuk ɔ. Mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ di djóoaa eboo bot ɛ bɔs ɛ, ye ɛ́ ɛnyal bot ɛ di eduwal bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Ghuna, yɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛsɛ́ɛ deenek pak'en. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, ngɔt pak'en ɛ́ kwyɛl ɛdi kɔ elo bɛsɔ ɔɔ, nyɛ di mot-mɛsa mɛ bɛsɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>É di'enek, mot aakwyɛl ɛdi pɛ sok bɛsɔ ɔ, di kwom bɛsɔ djas. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Étɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, ɛzyɛ ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eezɛliig bot, bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ. Nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ, étɛp ɛzɛdi mot-mɛsa mɛ bot, nɛ ɛzɛdjɛ bot tsik'ɛ nyɛ ɛmet tyee etuud étɛp ɛpɛk bɛtɛ nɛ bot.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik bot ɛ edhim bɛbá pɛ Yeliko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Bhii bɛ nawyis kɔ dɛl ɛ Yeliko ɛ, zukamwaa nɛ mot naazɛdu Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Tin, wɔ gwaa bot ɛ edhim bɛbá nadidi é ngwoob gba ɔ, zokagwak menduk náá, Yezu ɛpedhaa tin. Wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛbo etsim náá: «Ghɛŋ, Mɔn Dhavid! Geka bis ghoŋ!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi edu Yezu ɔ, moo tin ebhɛm bɛ étɛp bɛ needi gwyem. Wɔ gwaa bɛ zokabaaben ebhyeed bɔɔ ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Ghɛŋ, Mɔn Dhavid! Geka bis ghoŋ!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>É sok'enek, Yezu eezɛtyaa. Wɔ gwaa nyɛ zokadjóo bɛ. Nyɛ eezɛdji bɔɔ bɛbá náá: «Bi kwyɛl náá, mɛ sa bin yé?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Bot binɔk ɛ́ boopesal náá: «Ghɛŋ, bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bis nyaasok.» <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Tin, Yezu zokazɛgek bɛ ghoŋ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ kɔ mis. É di tak wat, mis mɔɔ eezebɛŋel, tin, bɛ eezɛdu nyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛni tɔ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Dáa bɛ nadi, bɛ moo ekunaa nɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, bɛ moo é ngwoob dɛl ɛ bɛ di djóo Bhɛtfaze, pɛ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv ɛ, Yezu eezɛlwom bɛdjekel bɛ bɛbá: <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka kɔ dɛl ɛ di pɛ sok'enek. Tuula bi aatuula kɔ dɛl ɛ tak ɛ, bi ɛ́ waabela dhiiti mbi myɛl tit di edjóoaa an ɛ nɛ mɔɔ swooz tak kɔla é di wat. Tiika bɛ, da bi ɛ́ zyɛ mɛ nɛ nɔɔ wak. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Mot ɛ́ dji bin náá: “Bi tɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ wo ɔɔ?” Lɛɛka nyɛ náá: “Ye ɛ́ Ghɛŋ ɛ́ di nɛ gwyes nɛ nɔɔ ɔ.” Tin, bɛ waaleedjɛ bin bak.»<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Esesɛɛ binek goka nɛ ɛsael, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ neebela ɛsuk:<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>«Lɛɛka nɛ ɛsyes ɛ ghaada Siɔŋ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">“Beea, mɛkoozi mɔ ɛpezyɛ pɛ daa lɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Nyɛ zyɛ ɛ́ nɛ enɛm esa, nyɛ ɛ́ ndiindil kɔ mɔɔ swooz an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Nyɛ zyɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ɛbet, nyɛ ɛ́ ndiindil kɔ mɔɔ swooz an<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zal 9.9</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Bhii tak, bɛdjekel eezɛtɔ́. Dáa bɛ nakakum é di tak ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛsa tyee Yezu nalɛɛ bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛsik nɛ myɛl an, nɛ swooz an tak Yezu nawaab ɛ. Bɛ moo tin ezɛkɛl bɛ endjookuwa bɔɔ kɔ ekoŋ. Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛkalal kɔ tak, disi. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>É di tak wat, bot ɛbuɛpe naabaazɛdja yɔbɔ endjookuwa gba-gba, bɛdhiiti nadi etsaal yɔbɔ ɛ́ ebhuuz e le, étɛp ɛdja é gba. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Ngoŋ bot ɛ́ nadi ekɛ pɛ sok ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ nakabɛ pɛ bhis ɔ, moo tin ekyeeb: «Hozanna nɛ Mɔn Dhavid! Duu nɛ Zɛɛb! Zɛɛb goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsɛɛ mot di ezyɛ nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ mbɛɛ mɛtel! Hozanna nɛ Zɛɛb pɛ tɔ gwoo!»<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Dáa Yezu nakani tɔ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, bot djas kɔ dɛl nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo «nyaa-nyaa», bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji: «Yenɔk ɛ́ nwyaa mot?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Mɛdhuu mɛ bot nadi ebɔɔza náá: «Ye ɛ́ ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, Yezu mɔn dɛl ɛ Nazalɛt pɛ kyee dik Ghalile.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Bhii tak, Yezu naazɛni tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Deenek, nyɛ moo tin esɔ bot ɛ nadi ebɔmsa esesɛɛ bɔɔ ɔ. Nyɛ baadi esɔ dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ́ nadi ebɔm-bɔmak nadi tin ɔ, nyɛ naawaaz emesa ee bɛ nadi eswoola epata kɔ tak ɛ, nɛ mɛbhóó mɛ bot ɛ́ nadi ebɔmsa mɛghum ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛbaakaada bɛ náá: Ye tok kwyala tɔ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb náá: «Ndjaŋ'am aadjóoaa ɛ́, “ndjaa mendjaala” Mɛ bee ɛ́ ɛkɛɛ, biyɔ, bi eezeliig yɛ, ye moo ɛ́ zɛɛga bot ɛ ɛzɛm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Eza 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Zel 7.11</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>É di tak wat, bot ɛ nadi nɛ edhim ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ nadi nɛ edjam ɔ, naazyɛ pɛ daa Yezu tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, nyɛy zokatsik bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Tin, bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ebee esesɛɛ binek djas Yezu nasa ɛ. Bɛ naabee pe dáa bɔɔ dhyeeb nadi eduwal nyɛ nɛ etsim tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ. Bɛ nadi kyeeb ɛ́ náá: «Duu nɛ Mɔn Dhavid!» Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛkpaa elyem. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Bot binɔk ɛ́ boozɛdji Yezu náá: «Wɔ ɛpegwak dáa bɔɔ dhyeeb di eke'enek é?» Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ: «Iyoo! Mɛ ɛpegwak. Bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààlaa tɔ mɛkana mɛ Zɛɛb é di nakwyalaa náá: “Tɔ enuub e bɔɔ dhyeeb nɛ bɔɔ etɔlɔɔ, wɔ eelyaal dáa bis di egoka nɛ ɛduwal wɔ ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:3">Mɛd 8.3</ref></char></note>?”» <verse eid="MAT 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ zɛwyis, tɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Bhetani pɛ bɛ nakɛdjaasi ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛkal le fiigh di ààdjɛ bhum ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Yak mɛlem, é ghɛŋ bɛ nadi esik pɛ boo dɛl ɛ, wɔ gwaa za zɛmɛt Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Nyɛ eezɛbee le fiigh é ngwoob gba. Tin, Yezu eezɛtiila si le tak étɛp nyɛ neebɔ́k. Dáa nyɛ nakakum si le ɛ, nyɛ kabela eka nɛ eka, ààbɛ nɛ bhum. É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ le tak náá: «Kana dwoo pan mos'ak, wɔ aanàkwaakabaawum!» É di tak wat, wɔ gwaa le syee. <verse eid="MAT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Dáa bɛdjekel nabee deenek ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naadyeebadjoka, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji Yezu náá: «Étɛp yé le fiigh zosyee é di wat deenek?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: bi ɛ́ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ di ààsa mɛso ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa esa mɛbwala dhaa yii mɛ sa nɛ le fiigh'ak ɛ. Bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛke nɛ ɛtsok ɛlak náá: “Ghɛɛa nyel tin, dusa, kɛghaaga tɔ boo dii,” yɛ ɛpesɛ́ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Bi ɛ́ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, esesɛɛ djas bi aawaab tɔ mendjaala ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadjɛ bin yɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛzɛ nadjɛ Yezu eghɛŋ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛni tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, nyɛ moo tin elyo bot mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda zokazyɛ pɛ daa lɛ zɛdji nyɛ náá: «Kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ wɔ di esa esesɛɛ binek? Ɛzɛ nadjɛ wɔ eghɛŋ e tak?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bwoodka, mɛ pookodji bin kiya wat. Bi ɛ́ bɔɔza mɛ ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ mɛ aakalɛɛ bin kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ mɛ di esa esesɛɛ binek. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Ye ɛ́ ɛzɛ nadhis Zaŋ, nyɛ zɛduu bot Zɛɛb? Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb “ohoo”, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mot?» É di'enek, bɛ moo tin esɔs pak'ɔɔ. Bɔɔ náá: «Mena aake nenak náá: “Ye ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ́ nadhis nyɛ” ɔɔ, nyɛ waadji mena náá: “Étɛp yé bi nadi ààmyaal Zaŋ?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Mena aakake nenak náá: “Ye ɛ́ bot ɛ nadhis nyɛ” ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bis kaab ɛdhuu ɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, bɛ dyeebake ɛ́ náá, Zaŋ nabɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Bis ààgu.» Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbulal nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ mam pe, mɛ aanàkwaalɛɛ bin kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ mɛ di esa esesɛɛ binek.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana bɔn bá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>Yezu eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yak kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ bin yé? Motom ngɔt nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɔn bɛbá. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ yii mɛgwyak náá: “Mɔn'am, dwoo ɛlak mos, tɔ́ kɛsa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb'am e vin.” <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ sɛɛg: “Hoo, mɛ aanàkwaatɔ́.” Ba ɛwala eezɛdhaa bhii tak, mɔn'enɔk eezɛdjɛ lyem mɛbɛ, tin, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́ pɛ pyeeb vin sɛɛg nalwom nyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Wɔ gwaa sɛɛg'ɔɔ baazɛlwom mɔɔ dhyeeb. Mɔn tak eezɛmyaal: “Iyoo, mɛ waatɔ́.” Bhii tak, nyɛ kadi ɛ́, ààtɔ́. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Tin, tɔ bɔn binɔk bɛbá, ɛzɛ looba dum nɛ lwomel sɛɛg'ɔɔ?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Ye ɛ́ mɔn mɛgwyak.» Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo nɛ boa ɛ mɛzɔ ɛ́ waaleeni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛsok nɛ nen. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ Nduuel-bot nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛlyaal bin ze epiki, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààmyaal nyɛ. Tin, bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo nɛ boa ɛ mɛzɔ naamyaal nyɛ. Bela náá, dáa bi naabee yɛ ɛ, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààliig elyem bin, bi ààpakomyaal-myaalak nyɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ bɛ na embee elyem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>«Gwakeka dhiiti kana. Mot ngɔt naabɛ pyeeb ele di edjɛ bhum bɛ di esa mɛnyok mɛ vin nɛ yɛ ɛ. Nyɛ eezɛpeeb pyeeb tak, pu guk tɔ ɛkok é di bɛ aadi esyaal mɛdii mɛ bhum tak ɔ, baasum ndjaa, étɛp bot aadi ebaal pyeeb ɔ. É di tak, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bot ɛ di egu mɛsa mɛ vin ɔ etɛp bɛ neesa mɛsa tɔ tak. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́ mɛdjoŋ. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Tin, mbu epyeeb e tak di ewum ɛ, yɛ eezɛkum. Wɔ gwaa, nakuma pyeeb zokazɛlwom bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ pɛ daa bot ɛ nyɛ nalik bɛ nɛ pyeeb ɔ, étɛp bɛ needjɛ nyɛ yɛ pak vin bɛ bela ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ nalik nɛ pyeeb ɔ, zokazɛmɛt bɛ. Bɛ eezɛduma ngɔt é nyel nɛ mɛbin, bɛ eenɔɔ nwyak gó nyɛ, zɛnɔɔ nwyak tak, bɛ eezɛwus nyɛ nɛ mɛkok, gó nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Bhii tak, nakuma pyeeb ɛ́ boozɛkyeed bot ɛbuɛpe dhaa bot ɛ nyɛ nalwom sok ɔ, pɛ pyeeb tak, bɛ nabaazosa nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ deenek. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlwom mɔn'ɛ met. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ geka náá: “Bot binɔk ɛ́ waamyaal nyɛ nɛ ɛdjɛ nyɛ duu, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mɔn'ɛ met.” <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Dáa bot ɛ nadi esa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb ɛ nabee mɔn'enɔk ɛ, bɔɔ náá: “Yawee! Beeka mot aalik nɛ mɛvu mak djas ɔ! Dhaka, mena góka nyɛ. Tin, mɛvu mak aakadi ɛ́, yenabɛlka.” <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛmɛt nyɛ, mwas nyɛ bhii pyeeb vin, bɛ eezɛgó nyɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>Yezu ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: «É di'enek, é sok nakuma pyeeb aakazyɛ ɛ́, nyɛ goka nɛ ɛsa bot binɔk dáa?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Yala yɔbɔ kabɛ ɛ́ náá: «Ye goka ɛ́ nakuma pyeeb gó bot ɛ nadi esa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb'ɛ ɔ ààgek bɛ ghoŋ. Bhii tak, da nyɛ ɛ́ nɔɔ pyeeb, djɛ nɛ bot ɛ sis aazɛdjɛ nyɛ yɛ pak ɛkɛɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi dinaa ààpaalaa mɛkpa mak tɔ ekwyala e Zɛɛb é?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Ɛkok ɛ bɛsumel mwas ɛ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">ye moo ɛ́ ɛkok ɛ di epyet ndjaŋ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ye ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Ghɛŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ye ɛ́ tin ɛ boo mbyok étɛp'ena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Mɛd 118.22-23</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>Yezu eebaazɛkɛl náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bi ɛ́ waadɛkaa Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp ye needjɛaa nɛ bot ɛ mbyak aadi edjɛ bhum ɔ. [<verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Mot aaduma kɔ ɛkok ɛ tak ɔ, nyɛ waabik. Yɛ kabɛ náá, ɛkok ɛ kakwyit kɔ mot ɔɔ, mot tak ɛpetwaalel. Nyɛ moo eghutu-ghutu.]»<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Gwaka bɛ nagwak kana tak ɛ, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ eFalizyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eegu náá, Yezu nalii ɛ́ nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛkan ɛsaa mɛpek étɛp bɛ neemɛt nyɛ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ bwoo ekaab mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ. Bot ɛ tak nake ɛ́ náá, Yezu ɛ́ ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Kana ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yezu eebaazɛkan ɛlii nɛ bot tɔ kana. Nyɛy náá: <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>«Beeka sa di enɔŋel nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ: Dhiiti mɛkoozi naazɛdjóo ɛbyoŋ étɛp ɛba ɛ mɔn. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Ye ɛ́ nyɛ kazɛlwom bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ, bɛ kɛdjóo bot étɛp ɛdɛ edee ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛba. Tin, bot ɛ tak ààpakakwyɛl ɛzyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Bhii yenek, nyɛ eebaazɛlwom bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ é yak kɔkɔ nɛ bhaadal náá, bɛ kɛlɛɛ bot náá: “Edee moo ɛ́ ndjaaba. Mɛ eezegó engɔmbɛ nɛ etaa bam na mɛdɛl. Esa djas moo ɛ́ koobela. Dha dɛka ɛbyoŋ.” <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Tin, bot ɛ nadjóoaa ɔ, ààkobis-bisak, mot nɛ mot naaghɛɛ yɛ nyel, tɔ́ mɛze mɛ. Nwyak tɔ́ pɛ pyeeb'ɛ, nwyak tɔ́ pɛ nyɛ di ebɔmsa esa bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>Bak bot zokazɛmɛt bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ kukuma yenɔk nalwom ɔ, duma bɛ é mɛnyel nɛ mɛbin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛgó bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Mɛkoozi zokazɛkpaa lyem: nyɛ ɛ́ bookazɛlwom esodja bɛ, bɛ gó bot ɛ nagó bot bɛ ɔ. Bhii tak, da bɛ ɛ́ dik eghaada bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlɛɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ náá: “Edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛba moo ɛ́ koobela. Bot ɛ djóoaa bɛ zɛdɛ ɔ, ààkɔa nɛ ɛdɛ edee e tak. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Wyiska, da bi ɛ́ tɔ́ kɔ eboo egba. Djóoka mot djas bi aaboma nɛ nɔɔ ɛ, bɛ zɛdɛ edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛ ɛba.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Bot ɛ mɛsa zokazɛtɔ́ egba nɛ egba, kɛdjóo bot djas bɛ aaboma nɛ nɔɔ ɔ, bɛmbee ɛ bot nɛ bɛmbɛɛ bot. Tin, koo bɛ nakoobal étɛp ɛbyoŋ ɛ naalwood “kpep”.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>«Tin, mɛkoozi eezɛni tɔ koo tak, étɛp nyɛ neekabee bot ɛ zyɛ zɛdɛ edee ɛbyoŋ ɔ. É di'enek, nyɛ kabee kuku bot ɛ́ dhiiti mot ààbɛ nɛ kaad di egoka nɛ ɛbɔtaa é mɛbyoŋ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ boodji nyɛ náá: “Mɔɔ sɔ'am, wɔ ni wak dáa, wɔy ààbɛ nɛ kaad bot di egoka nɛ ɛbɔt étɛp ɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ?” Tin, mot'enɔk kadi ɛ́, ààbɔɔza kiya mɛkoozi menɔk. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Tinaak mɛkoozi eezɛlwom bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ náá: “Mɛtka mot'enɔk, da bi ɛ́ kɔl nyɛ mɛko nɛ mɛmbɔ. Bhii tak, da bi ɛ́ mwas nyɛ pɛ kel, tɔ ghooghom. Penek aadi ɛ́ mɛgwyɛ nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok.”»<verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Yezu eebaazɛbil náá: «Ye ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waadjóoaa. Tin, bot aasɛ́ɛaa ɔ ààdyeebabu.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efute e lapo nɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>EFalizyɛ zokakɛboma étɛp ɛdjek dáa bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛsa, bɛ neekwyesal Yezu nɛ mɛdjin étɛp nyɛ neebela ndjɛ kɔ mɛkpa mɛ ɛmet ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛkyeed bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel bɔɔ, nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga ɛ mɛkoozi Elood, bɛ zɛlɛɛ nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel, bis nɛ gu náá, etɛp ee wɔ di elɛɛ ɛ, ye ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ. Wɔ lyo bot ɛ́ epiki dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛkɛ dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Wɔ ààbem ba nɛ sa mot di egek tɔ lyem'ɛ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, wɔy ààdyeebagwyák sa bot di esa étɛp bɛ neetela mɛnyel ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Lɛɛa bis, tɔ yɔ egeka dáa wɔ di ebee ɛ: etsi bina lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, bot tuud lapo nɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad, mena tuudka ohoo mena nàtuudka?»<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Dáa Yezu nadi egu mbee mɛpek mɔɔ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Étɛp yé bi di ekwyɛl ɛwa mɛ tɔ mɛbhowal? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Pookolyaalka mɛ falanga wat bot di etuud lapo nɛ yɛ ɛ, étɛp mɛ neebee.» Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛzyɛ nyɛ nɛ mɔɔ falanga wat. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: «Kɔ ghwooz'ak, ye lulaa ɛbhwoob ɛ zɛ? Ye ɛ́ din ɛ zɛ di kwyala kɔ tak?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Bot binɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Ye ɛ́ yɛ Sezaad.» Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Djɛka mɛkoozi Sezaad sa di náá ye ɛ́ yɛ Sezaad ɛ, da bi ɛ́ djɛ Zɛɛb sa di náá, ye ɛ́ yɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Gwaka bɛ nagwak eyala ɛ Yezu deenek ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naadyeebadjoka ɛlyelɛpe. Bhii tak, bɛ boozɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, tɔ́ yɔbɔ.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛdjin dum nɛ tɛp ɛgom bhis ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Dwoo tak wat, bɛdhiiti eSaduseɛ zokazyɛ pɛ daa Yezu. ESaduseɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di ke náá, bot aanàgom bhis ɛsyee ɔ. Bɛ eezɛdji kiya, <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>bɔɔ nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel, mɛkana ɛ Moiiz lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Mot ɛ́ gwyɛ ààlik mɔn ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, dhyeeb mot lik ɔ, ba kus myɛl étɛp nyɛ neekwyiida tel gwyɛ ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Dɛt 25.5-6</ref>.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Bela tin, tɔ lɔɔg'es, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɔn botom ɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá. Mot mɛgwyak eezɛba, dáa nyɛ kagwyɛ ɛ́, nyɛ kalik kus myɛl nadi ààbɛ nɛ mɔn ɔ nɛ dhyeeb. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Mot nabɔɔba nyɛ ɛ́ kanɔɔ moma bhii koŋ'ɛ. Nyɛy eebaazɛkpaa nɛ mɛsyee, gwyɛ, ààlik mɔn. Tyee wat nɛ mot nabaazyɛ bhis yenɔk ɔ. Tin, bɔɔ djas bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá kadi ɛ́, ààbya nɛ moma yenɔk. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Bhis ɛsyee ɛ bɔɔ djas, moma eebaazɛkpaa nɛ mɛsyee, gwyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Dwoo bot aagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ, moma yenɔk aakadi mwaa zɛ pak bɔɔ bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá? Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ djas nabɛ ɛ́ botom bɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ tɔ ɛdjak, etɛɛ náá, bi ààmɛt ɛnyɔɛpe sa di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Bi ààgu ghwyil ɛ Zɛɛb! <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ bot aagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ, botom nɛ boa aanàkwaabaabael. Boa pe aanàni mɛba, etɛɛ náá, bot djas aadi ɛ́, dáa efofop tɔ gwoo. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Dum nɛ tɛp ɛgom bhis ɛsyee, bi dinaa ààpaalaa sa Zɛɛb lɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ? Nyɛ naake ɛ́: <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>“Ye ɛ́ mam, Zɛɛb ɛ Abalaam, yɛ Izak, nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ Zakɔɔb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ɛwy 3.6</ref></char></note>.”» Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Zɛɛb tok Zɛɛb bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb bot ɛ di nɛ tsik ɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Ye nabɛ ɛ́, mɛlyo mɛ tak naadyeebakwyɛsa tɔ elyem e mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsi di edhaa etsi djas ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Dáa eFalizyɛ nagwak náá, Yezu naadiyal eSaduseɛ enuub ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛsɛɛga. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Dhiiti lyoel etsi e Zɛɛb naazɛkwyɛl ɛbhoal Yezu. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>«Lyoel, yaa tsi di edhaa etsi djas?»<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yezu kabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «“Wɔ goka ɛ́, wɔ kwyɛl Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'ɔ, nɛ lyem'ɔ djas, nɛ sisim'ɔ djas, nɛ ɛtselal ɛ lɔ djas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Dɛt 6.5</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Yenek ɛ́ di boo tsi. Ye ɛ́ tsi di dhaa etsi djas ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Gwaka tsi di ebɔɔba yii mɛkɛn ɛ: “Wɔ goka ɛ́, wɔ kwyɛl sɔ'ɔ mot dáa wɔ di ekwyɛl nyel'ɔ ɛmet ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:18">Mɛs 19.18</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Etsi ɛ Moiiz djas nɛ mɛlyo mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb pyet ɛ́ kɔ etsi binek ebá.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu Klisto ɛ́ mɔn zɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Efalizyɛ nadi ɛ́, tɔ yɔbɔ zɛɛga. Yezu ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>«Tɔ yebɔ egeka, Mɛsia ɛ́ zɛ?» Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Nyɛ ɛ́ dha ɛ Dhavid.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>É di'enek, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ye nakosa dáa náá, Dhavid nɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ djóo nyɛ “Ghɛŋ”? Etɛɛ náá, Dhavid naake náá:<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>“Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nake nɛ Ghɛŋ'am ɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Dha disi pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Mɛ waalwom bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɔ lwoma bhel náá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">bɛ zɛdhaa si mɛko mɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mɛd 110.1</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>«Yɛ bɛ náá, Dhavid nyɛ ɛmet naadjóo nyɛ “Ghɛŋ” ɔɔ, é yaa tyɛ Mɛsia aakabaadi dha yɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Bɔɔ djas moo tin «kup», ààbɛ nɛ ɛkpa ɛlóo bhis étɛp djas Yezu nalii ɛ. Kana dwoo ɛlenek, bot nabɛ ɛ́ ààkadjheebal ɛdji nyɛ mɛdjin.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdul bot mɛlɔ dum nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛlii nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛsa mɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ zɛlyo bot dum nɛ dáa etsi ɛ Moiiz di egoka nɛ ɛkɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlooba nɛ nɔɔ, da bi ɛ́ sa esesɛɛ bɛ aalwom bin ɛ, djas. Yɛ kabɛ mɛfulu mɔɔ ɔ, sa mot ààsa dáa bɔɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ ààsa esesɛɛ ee bɛ di elyo bot ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Bɛ ɛpekaŋal mɛkɔm mɛ na dil-dil di ɛlyelɛpe é ɛbɛp ɛ, bɛ kakɛl ɛ́ kɔ mɛbyak mɛ bot. É di'enek, bɛ kadi ɛ́, ààkwyɛl ɛkokee-keeak nɛ djin bɛ neekogek mɛdil mɛ mɛkɔm mɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Bɛ sa esesɛɛ bɔɔ djas ɛ́, étɛp bɛ neetela mɛnyel. Deenek, yɛ kabɛ ekwyala ee mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb bɛ di ebɛk é ebhata-bhwoob bɔɔ nɛ é mɛmbɔ mɔɔ ɔ, bɛ sa epɛk e tak ɛ́ ɛbɔkɛpe. Yɔbɔ ekel ee di lataa kɔ ekaad ɛ, nɛ elɔbɔ bɔɔ nɛ dyeebadjaa dhaa tyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Tɔ mɛbyoŋ, bɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛdisi ɛ́ kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ koobelaa étɛp bot ɛ duu ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ tɔ́ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɔ, bɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛnɔŋ ɛ́ mɛbhóó mɛ pɛ sok é di bɛ aatela mɛnyel ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Bɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛ́ bot swos bɛ nɛ duu kɔ mɛbɛsɛɛ é di bot di ɛbuɛpe ɔ. Bɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, bot djóo bɛ “Lyoel”.<verse eid="MAT 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>«Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔ, nàkeka náá, bi djóoaa “Lyoel”, etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas ɛ́ bɔn sɛɛg ngɔt. Bi ɛ́ nɛ lyoel ngɔt. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Sa mot ààdjóo mot kɔ bɔs'ak “Sɛɛg'es” etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas ɛ́ bɔn sɛɛg ngɔt, Sɛɛg'en ngɔt di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Nàkwyɛlka náá, bot djóo bin “Kukuma” etɛɛ náá, kukuma yen ɛ́ ngɔt, Mɛsia. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Mot ɛ́ kwyɛl ɛdi mot ɛsok ɛ lɔɔg ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ nyɛ di tyee mot-mɛsa mɛ bɔn nyɛɛg. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Mot di eben nyel tɔ bɛsɔ ɔ, nyɛ waasilaa. Mot di esil nyel tɔ bɛsɔ ɔ, nyɛ waabenaa.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ɛpelyaal mɛkɔŋ mɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>«Haa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi ɛpediyal bot ɛbɛ ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Biyɔ bɛmet, bi aanàkwaani, tin, bi ààkwyɛl náá, bot ɛ di ekwos ɛni ɔ, bɛ ni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ tak.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 23:13">[<verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>«Haa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi ɛpedɛk bɛkus ɛ boa esa bɔɔ djas. É di tak wat, bi nɛ kwyɛl ɛdul ɛ mendjaala na “kpɔkɔlɔm” étɛp ɛtela mɛnyel tɔ bot. É tɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, bi ɛ́ waapɛ́ɛaa ɛ́ epɛ́ɛ wat di na lyel-lyel, ààbɛ nɛ ghoŋ ɛ!]<verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>«Haa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi ɛ́ ɛpetɔ́ mɛdjoŋ é edi djas kɔ bɔs nɛ kɔ eboo mɛdhii mɛ mɛsɔn, étɛp ɛsaa mot ngɔt di emyaal ɛdjaala Zɛɛb eYuda ɔ. Tin mot ɛ́ kadu bin ɔɔ, bi kaliig yii zaag mot ɛ mbi mot di egoka nɛ du na kɔm-kɔm ɛ, dhaa-dhaŋak biyɔ bɛmet.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>«Haa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ biyɔ bot ɛ edhim, biyɔ bot ɛ́ di edjɛɛd bot ɔ. Bi dyeebalɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Mot ɛ́ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔɔ, yɛ aanàsa sonok. Nyɛ katuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ lɔɔd di tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa sa nyɛ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Bi ɛ́ endjemet e bot, bot ɛ edhim! Ɛyé di dhaa mɛtaŋ tin, yɛ lɔɔd “ohoo” nɛghu Ndjaa-ebuwa di edjɛ lɔɔd edɛɛ ɛ?<verse eid="MAT 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>«Bi baalɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Mot ɛ́ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ mesa ebuwa ɔɔ, yɛ aanàsa sonok. Nyɛ katuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ buwa di kɔ mesa ebuwa tak ɔɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa sa nyɛ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Biyɔ bot ɛ edhim! Ɛyé di dhaa mɛtaŋ tin, ɛsa e buwa “ohoo” nɛghu mesa ebuwa bɛ di eka gha kɔ tak ɛ? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, mot eetuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ kɔ mesa ebuwa ɔɔ, nyɛ tuwal yɛ ɛ́ kɔ mesa ebuwa dɔɔ nɛ kɔ esa e buwa ee di kaaa kɔ mesa ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Mot ɛ́ di etuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ kɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔɔ, nyɛ tuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ tak ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ kɔ din ɛ Zɛɛb mot di tɔ ndjaa tak ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Mot di etuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ, da nyɛ ɛ́ nɔɔ gwoo dáa tyaasɛs ɔɔ, nyɛ tuwal yɛ ɛ́ kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ din ɛ Zɛɛb, mot di kɔ tak ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>«Haa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi dyeebakwyɛl ɛ́ ɛtuud Zɛɛb nɛ endiyal kam e nadjeebe nɛ eka e na mbɛɛ mɛnuub zɛnɔɔ aghomkɔtɔ. Tin, bi kadjisa ɛ́ etɛtɛ mɛlyo mɛ di nɛ boo mɛsuk tɔ etsi ɛ. Mɛlyo mɛ tak ɛ́: epiki, enɛm esa, nɛ ɛkɛ dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Yenek djas ɛ́ sa di egoka náá, bot du mɛlu djas nɛ zii, ààbet dhiiti sonok ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Biyɔ, bɛdjɛɛdel, bot ɛ edhim! Bi ɛpesyal mɛnyok men ekaab náá, ba mɔɔ kuŋ ɛ́ zɛkɛdhaa tɔ tak, ghuna bi ɛpemin boo tu yaaga kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ!<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>«Haa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi gwyii ɛ́ koŋ bɛɛlɛ nɛ koŋ saan, tin pɛ tɔ mɔ tak kadi ɛ́ “tɔɔɔ” nɛ mendi mɛ embee mɛfulu men: esa e djii nɛ embee mɛkwosak men. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Biyɔ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ edhim! Pookogwyiika sok tɔ mɔ bɛɛlɛ. Tin, pɛ koŋ tak ɛ waadjhaazal.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>«Haa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi ɛ́ dáa mɛvit nasumaa ɛnyɔɛpe da ɛ́ lɔɔbaa ɛpyaab ɛ. Enɛm e tak nyen ɛ́ pɛ kel é mis mɛ bot, ghuna tɔ tak, ye ɛ́ ɛbyok ɛ egwyes ààbɛ nɛ tsik nɛ ebet esonok. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Ye ɛ́ dáa biyɔ, bot ɛ di ebee bin ɔ, bɛ ke ɛ́ náá, bi ɛ́ bot ɛ epiki. Ghuna pɛ tɔ len, ye ɛ́ “tɔɔɔ” nɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si nɛ embee esesɛɛ.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>«Haa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen, biyɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Bi ɛpesum embɛɛ mɛvit étɛp bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Bi ɛpekoobal nɛ ɛsɔn ɛ mɛvit mɛ bot ɛ epiki. <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>Bi dyeebake ɛ́ náá: “Mena ɛpedi ɛ́, dika é ghɛŋ bɛbhaab binaka ɔɔ, pe mena nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwakel nɛ nɔɔ étɛp ɛgó ɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.” <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Deenek, bi ɛpemyaal biyɔ bɛmet náá, bot ɛ nadi egó bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ nabɛ ɛ́ bɛbhaab bin. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Ɛbɛsɛɛ'enek tsabidibila, belaka, duka ko bɛbhaab bin nalik bin yɛ ɛ. Silalka mɛsa mɛ bɛ nakan ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Bɛnyɔ, mbyak mɛgel! Bi aasa dáa étɛp bi needi ààkɛdyak tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm?<verse eid="MAT 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>«Gwakeka mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe: mɛ waadhis bin bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot, nɛ embɛɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi. Bi ɛ́ waagó bɛdhiiti, bi ɛ́ waabem bɛdhiiti tak é mɛlaaba. Bi ɛ́ waabi bɛdhiiti nɛ eghwyɛs tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda men. Bi ɛ́ waadu bɛ nɛ swaka eghaada nɛ eghaada étɛp bi neegó bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Tinaak, guka náá, ɛbiyo djas bot di esa kɔ bot ɛ epiki kana ɛsyee ɛ Abhɛl mot epiki, kɛyaka nɛ yɛ Zakali mɔn Balakyi bi nagó pak Di na Dɛɛ ɛ Ghɛŋ nɛ mesa-ebuwa ɔ, yɛ waabulelaa kɔ len. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, efute e embee esesɛɛ binek ɛ́ waabulelaa kɔ bot ɛ di é dwoo mena dika mos'aak.»<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eedje kɔ ɛsu ɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>«Yeluzalɛm! Yeluzalɛm wɔy mot di egó bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, wɔy mot di egó bot ɛ Zɛɛb di edhis ɔ, nɛ mɛkok. É sok edhen mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛsɛɛg bot ɛ di kɔ dɛl ɛ lɔ dáa nabwa-kuu di esɛɛg bɔn bɛ si mɛbhap mɛ ɛ, biyɔ ààkwyɛl! <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Deenek guka náá, ndjaŋ'en ɛ́ waalik wum! <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bi aanàkabaabee mɛ, kana dwoo pan mos'ak, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo bi aake náá: “Mɛnyɔ nɛ mot aazyɛ nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ!”»<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eelii dum nɛ tɛp ɛwaaz ɛ Ndjaa-ebuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Dáa Yezu nadi ewyis tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ́, bɛdjekel eezɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ étɛp bɛ neelyaal nyɛ zumal Ndjaa-ebuwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Tin, Yezu moo zɛlii nɛ nɔɔ, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛpebee esa djas di tin ɛ? Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ɛkok wat aanàkwaalik yak kɔ yii. Djas ɛ́ waawaazel.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mezuk nɛ mɛtiiga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Yezu eezɛdisi kɔ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv, bɛdjekel eezɛdu nyɛ é ngwoob. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Lɛɛa bis esesɛɛ binek sael den? Lyaala bis endem e bis aagu náá, wɔ moo ɛ́ kɔ ɛbula nɛ náá, bɔs moo ɛ́ kɔ ɛsi ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dika nɛ etsoŋ, sa mot ààkɔɔ bin. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Etɛɛ náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ́ waazyɛ nɛ din ɛ lam. Bɛ waalɛɛ bin náá: “Ye ɛ́ mam ɛ́ di Mɛsia!” Bɛ waasa náá, bot ɛbuɛpe kat ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Bi ɛ́ waagwak bot elii etɛp e mɛɛb é ngwoob'en nɛ menduk mɛ mɛɛb mɛ di pɛ ɛtseta ɛ. Sa mot ààbem ba etɛɛ náá, ye goka ɛ́, esesɛɛ binek sɛ́ɛ. Tin, guka náá, yenek tok mɛsi mɛ bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Dhiiti mbyak ɛ́ waaghɛɛ, kɛlumela dɛɛb nɛ yak mbyak. Dhiiti ɛyoŋ ɛ́ waakɛghɛɛ, kɛlumela dɛɛb nɛ yak ɛyoŋ. É bɛdhiiti edi, bɔs ɛ́ waakuu, pwom edee ɛ́ waani kɔ mɛl. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Mɛzel menek djas aadi ɛ́ dáa endem e mɛkɛn ɛsuula ɛbyel ɛ mɔn. <verse eid="MAT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>Bot ɛ́ waakɛpit bin, étɛp bi neezukaa. Tin bot ɛ́ waagó bin. Membyak djas ɛ́ waabhina bin kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>É sok'enek, bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ́ waakat ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Bot ɛ́ waapitel pak'ɔɔ. Bɛdhiiti ɛ́ waabhina bɛsɔ bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Bɛtɛ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ ɛ́ waatuula, bɛ waakɔɔ bot ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Dáa ye di náá, embee esa ɛ́ waazɛdhaa tɔ elyem e bot ɛ, kwyɛl tɔ elyem e bot ɛbuɛpe waatyaala. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Tin, mot aakɛ nɛ ɛwa zii, kɛkum pɛ ɛsik ɔ, nyɛ waabela tsik. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Mbɛɛ Bhaadal dum nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb aadi ɛ́ egoolel kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak djas, étɛp, bot djas di ààgu Zɛɛb ɔ neegwak yɛ. Bhii tak ɛ ɛsik ɛ bɔs aakakum.»<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Boo mezuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>«Bi aabee mot na mbee mesyem mɛ na lyel-lyel dáa ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Daniel nalɛɛ ɛ, nyɛy ebe di tɔ Di na Dɛɛ. Ye goka ɛ́ bot ɛ di egu ɛlaa mɛkana ɔ tiibal ɛnyɔɛpe! <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>Étɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, bot aadi pɛ kyee dik Yude ɔ, kan ekaab, tɔ́ pɛ tɔ mɛtsok. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Mot aadi kɔ mii ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔ nàbaasul pɛ si zɛni tɔ ndjaa étɛp ɛkɛnɔɔ sonok. <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Mot aadi tɔ pyeeb ɔ, nàbaasik pɛ dɛl, kɛnɔɔ ndjookuwa yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Haa kpaa-ghoŋ dwoo ɛlenek nɛ boa aadi nɛ mɛbum ɔ, zɛnɔɔ boa aadi nɛ bɔn edɛ mɛbel ɔ! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Djaalaka nɛ Zɛɛb étɛp, bi ɛ́ zɛkɛwyis ekaab é mbu bɛbhi, nɛghu é dwoo saba! <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Etɛɛ náá, é ɛwala tak, mezuk ɛ́ waadhaa mezuk mɛ mena zebee, kana bɔs nakusel ɛ, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo pan mos'ak. Yɛ aanàkwaakabaabɛ nɛ mbi mezuk deenek. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet ɛpedi ààbɛk bim mɛlu mɛ tak ɔɔ, pe ye tok nɛ mot aatsak. Ye nyɔ ɛ́, bi gu náá, Zɛɛb bɛk bim mɛlu mɛ mezuk menek ɛ́, kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ nyɛ nazɛsɛ́ɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>Dhiiti mot ɛ́ lɛɛ bin náá: “Beeka Mɛsia di wak e!” nɛghu bɛ lɛɛ náá: “Mɛsia ɛ́ poon!” ɔɔ, sa mot ààmyaal. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Etɛɛ náá, bɛmɛsia mɛ etsal nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ ɛ́ waatuula ɛbuɛpe. Bɛ waasa etɛp e mɛbwala nɛ bɛmɛvyɛkɛlɛ ɛbuɛpe étɛp bɛ neekɔɔ bot, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ Zɛɛb nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Gwakeka, mɛ dul bin mɛlɔ ɛsok nɛ esesɛɛ binek kum tɔ len.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>«Yɛ bɛ náá, bɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: “Beeka, nyɛ ɛ́ pɛ tɔ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii!” ɛ, nàtɔ́ka. Nɛghu bɛ kalɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: “Beeka, yɛ sɔwa ɛ́ wak!” Sa mot ààmyaal, nyɛ tok tin. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Dáa ngwyes di ekas tɔ gwoo, dus pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo, kɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛbil ɛ dwoo ɛ, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aazyɛ ɛ́ deenek. <verse eid="MAT 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>Enen ee di edɛ epuud ɔ dyeebasɛɛga ɛ́ é di muu tit di ɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛbula ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>«Ààbɔya batsa bhii ɛwala ɛ mezuk menek aadhaŋ ɛ, bi ɛ́ waabee náá, gwyes ɛ́ waagwyiid dhɔɔ, ngɔn aanàkabaakas, ekwyikwyen ɛ́ waadus tɔ gwoo, kwyit é bɔs, esa e mɛbwala djas di tɔ gwoo ɛ waadheegel. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Tin, ndem ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waanyen tɔ gwoo. Membyak djas di kɔ bɔs ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́, tɔ etsim nɛ mɛgwyɛ. Tin, bɛ waabee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot esul tɔ eguud tɔ gwoo nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛbwala nɛ duma. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Boo tɔŋ ɛ́ waalɔɔel. Tin, nyɛ waalwom efofop pɛ é edum e bɔs djas, bɛ neekɛsɛɛg bot djas Zɛɛb nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ, kan yak edum e bɔs, kɛyaka nɛ yak edum.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ le fiigh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>«Nɔɔka etsoŋ nɛ kana le fiigh: dáa mɛdii mɛ le fiigh aadi, ye moo byet tɔ elɛɛ e tak ɛ, eka moo baakwyil é tak ɛ, bi nɛ gu náá, mbɛɛ mbu eezekunaa. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Ye ɛ́ tyɛ wat nɛ biyɔ, é sok bi aabee endem binek moo nyen ɛ, guka náá, ɛbula ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot moo ɛ́, yɛ eezekɔ. Yɛ aasael ɛ́ deenek. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bot ɛ membu mak aanàkwaagwyɛ djas esonok bak ààsael. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Gwoo nɛ bɔs ɛ́ waadhaa, ye ɛ́ kabɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, yɛ aanàkwaadhaa.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zɛɛb nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ di egu ɛwala ɛ mɛsik mɛ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>«Yɛ kabɛ dum nɛ dwoo nɛ ɛwala ɛ esesɛɛ binek aasael ɛ, ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt di egu, ààkobɛ-bɛak efofop tɔ gwoo, dɔɔ nɛ Mɔn Zɛɛb pe ààgu dwoo tak. Ye ɛ́ Sɛɛg nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di gu. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Ɛbula ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aadi ɛ́, dáa sa nasɛ́ɛ é ghɛŋ Noe ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ tak, ɛsok nɛ boo bhyoŋ nɛ zyɛ, bot nadi ɛ́, tɔ mɛmyaala, edɛ edee, edɛ bɛmɛnyok, eba boa, ekyeed mɛsyes mɔɔ é mɛba, kɛkum dwoo Noe nani tɔ mɛsuwa ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Bot nabɛ ɛ́ ààbis, kɛkum dwoo boo bhyoŋ nazɛsilal bɔɔ djas na “bhɛɛɛ” ɛ. Yɛ aabaadi ɛ́, deenek dwoo Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aabula ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>É ghɛŋ tak ɛ́ di náá, bot ɛbá ɛ́ waadi tɔ pyeeb. Ngɔt ɛ́ waanɔŋaa, nwyak ngɔt ɛ́ waalik. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Boa ɛbá ɛ́ waadi edum bhum tɔ bwak wat. Ngɔt ɛ́ waanɔŋaa, nwyak ngɔt ɛ́ waalik.<verse eid="MAT 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>«Dika nɛ etsoŋ! Bɛɛka mis etɛɛ náá, bi ààgu dwoo Ghɛŋ'en aaboozyɛ ɛ́. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Gwakeka sa mɛ di elɛɛ ɛ́, yɛ bɛ náá, nakuma ndjaŋ ɛpedi egu ɛwala ɛ pum mot djii aazyɛ zɛdjii tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔɔ, pe nyɛ aanàkwaadja gɔ́, étɛp nyɛ neelu mot djii yenɔk, nyɛ nàni tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Ye ɛ́ mɛ di elɛɛ bin náá, bi bɛ ɛ́ mis, nàpeebaka, etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aatuula ɛ́ é ɛwala bi aadi ààbwood nyɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot-mɛsa mɛ na sosoob nɛ etsoŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>«Ɛzɛ di mot-mɛsa mɛ na sosoob nɛ etsoŋ? Ye ɛ́ mot-mɛsa kukuma yɛ djɛ nyɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛbaal ɛ bɛsɔ nɛ ɛdjɛ bɛ edee bɔɔ é ɛwala bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Mɛnyɔ nɛ mot-mɛsa menɔk, yɛ bɛ náá, kukuma yɛ aabula, nyɛ ɛ́ zɛbela nyɛ, nyɛy esa mɛsa mɛ menek ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá: kukuma yenɔk ɛ́ waadjɛ mot-mɛsa menɔk esa bɛ djas nyɛ baal. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Yɛ kabɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mbee mot-mɛsa di ààbɛ sosoob nɛ etsoŋ ɔɔ, nyɛ aake ɛ́ náá: “Kukuma aanàkwaaleebula.” <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>Deenek, nyɛ aadi ɛ́, ezuk bɛsɔ di esa mɛsa bɛ nɛ bɛ nɔɔ ɔ, nɛ ɛkɛdedɛ bɛ mɛnyok bɛ nɛ bot ɛ zegel mɛnyel mɔɔ tɔ mɛnyok ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>Tin, kukuma yɛ aabula ɛ é dwoo nyɛ aadi ebwaal náá, nyɛ aanàkwaazyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Kukuma yenɔk ɛ́ waasɔ mot-mɛsa menɔk. Da nyɛ ɛ́ wa nyɛ é di mezuk, é di wat nɛ bot ɛ lwalɛŋ. Bhii tak nyɛ ɛ́ wus nyɛ pɛ kel pɛ bot ɛ di edje mɛgwyɛ nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok di ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Kana mɛsyes kam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>«Ɛni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ́ aadi ɛ́, dáa kana mɛsyes kam nanɔɔ elama bɔɔ, wyis, étɛp bɛ neekɛboma nɛ motom di ekwyɛl ɛba ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Bɛtɛn pak'ɔɔ nadi ɛ́, endjemet e mɛsyes. Bak bɛtɛn kadi ɛ́ bɛtsoŋ ɛ bɔɔ boa. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Endjemet e mɛsyes menɔk nanɔɔ yɔbɔ elama ɛ́, àànɔɔ ba mul, nɛ gu yii di tɔ elama ɛ́ waasi. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Yɛ kabɛ bot ɛ nadi bɛtsoŋ ɔ, bhii bɛ nanɔɔ elama ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ naatɔ́ nɛ yak bim bɛmul bɛ nakwom ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Tin, motom kadi ɛ́, ààleetuula. Gɔ́ naazɛsa bɔɔ mɛsyes menɔk, wɔ gwaa, bɔɔ djas zɛkpaa nɛ gɔ́ ndjaasi.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>«É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, boo tuud zokazɛgék kuku ɛgha ɛ pum náá: “Beeka motom ɛba! Kɛbomaka nɛ nɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Tin mɛsyes kam menɔk ɛ́ boozɛdjem, bɛ moo tin ekoobal elama bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Tin, mɛsyes mɛ nadi endjemet ɔ naazɛke nɛ bɛtsoŋ náá: “Bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbɛk bis ba mul mɛ lama batsa, etɛɛ náá, elama bis ɛpedim.” <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Mɛsyes mɛ nadi bɛtsoŋ ɔ ɛ́ boobɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Hooo, ààbɛ! Etɛɛ náá, bim bis di nɛ yɛ ɛ, yɛ aanàkwaadjala menabɛlka djas. Ye nyɔ ɛ́, bi kɛbɔm yebɔ tɔ edjando.” <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Tin, endjemet e bɔɔ mɛsyes menɔk eezɛtɔ́, kɛbɔm yɔbɔ bɛmul. Bhii koŋ'ɔɔ, motom ɛba eezɛkum, nyɛ zokanɔŋ ɛ́ bɛtɛn ɛ nadi bɛtsoŋ ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛni nɛ nɔɔ tɔ ndjaa nakoobelaa étɛp ɛba ɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛkɔɔl ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa nɛ ɛngoŋ. <verse eid="MAT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>Bhii ba ɛwala kadhaŋ ɛ, bɛdhiiti bɔɔ mɛsyes menɔk eezɛbula, bɛ moo tin etsim náá: “Ghɛŋ, Ghɛŋ diia bis ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa!” <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Motom ɛba eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Mɛ lɛɛ bin nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ́ náá, mɛ ààgu bin.”» <verse eid="MAT 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bɛɛka mis, nàdjaka egɔ́. Dika nɛ etsoŋ etɛɛ náá, bi ààgu dwoo nɛ ɛwala ɛ tak.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana bot ɛ mɛsa bɛlɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>«Yɛ aadi ɛ́, dáa dhiiti motom nadi ekwyɛl ɛtɔ́ mɛdjoŋ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdjóo bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ, da ɛ́ lik bɛ nɛ esa. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd ɛtɛn, djɛ mot mɛkɛn. Mot nabɔɔba ɔ, nyɛ kadjɛ nyɛ ɛ́ mɛdhɛɛb mɛ elɔɔd ebá. Mot nazyɛ bhii mot bhɔɔba ɔ, nyɛ kadjɛ nyɛy ɛ́ ɛdhɛɛb lɔɔd wat. Nyɛ zokadjɛ mot nɛ mot ɛ sa di edjala nɛ ghwyil'ɛ ɛ, bhii tak nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Mot-mɛsa nabela mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd ɛtɛn eezɛtɔ́, yɛ kɛliig mɛmbɔ nɛ lɔɔd'enek. Wɔ gwaa nyɛ baazɛbela mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd ɛtɛn kɔ yii nyɛ nadjɛaa sok ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Ye ɛ́ tyɛ wat nɛ mot nabela mɛdhɛɛb mɛmbá ɔ, nyɛ nabaasa yɛ ɛ́ dáa mot ɛsok nasa ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ baabela mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd membá kɔ yii nyɛ nalikaa nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Mot nabela ɛdhɛɛb ɛ lɔɔd wat ɔ, nyɛ naatɔ́ kɛpu bɔs, da ɛ́ nɔɔ yɛ, syel yɛ pɛ si bɔs.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>«Bɛtɛ nɛ mɛlu bhii tak, kukuma bot ɛ mɛsa menɔk eezɛbula. Bhii tak nyɛ moo zɛdji bɛ dáa bɛ nadi ebe lɔɔd nyɛ nalik bɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ bhii koŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Mot-mɛsa na mɛdhɛɛb mɛtɛn ɛ́ boozɛlyaal yɛ mɛdhɛɛb mɛtɛn mɛ nyɛ nabaabela ɛ. Nyɛy nɛ kukuma yɛ náá: “Ghɛŋ, wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ́ mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd mɛtɛn. Beea dhiiti mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd mɛtɛn mɛ mɛ baabela ɛ́.” <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Kukuma yɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: “Ɛnyɔɛpe! Wɔ ɛ́ mbɛɛ mot-mɛsa nɛ esosoob. Wɔ eesa mbɛɛ mɛsa nɛ sa dem. Mɛ waadjɛ wɔ yii di bu ɛ. Dha myaala é di wat nɛ nam.” <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>Mot-mɛsa nabela mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd ebá ɔ, baazyɛ yɛ. Nyɛy náá: “Ghɛŋ, wɔ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ́ mɛdhɛɛb mɛ lɔɔd ebá. Mam eebaabela yak mɛdhɛɛb membá kɔ tak. Beea yɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Tin, kukuma yɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: “Ɛnyɔɛpe! Wɔ ɛ́ mbɛɛ mot-mɛsa nɛ esosoob. Wɔ eesa mbɛɛ mɛsa nɛ sa dem. Mɛ waadjɛ wɔ yii di bu ɛ. Dha myaala é di wat nɛ nam.”<verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>«Bhii tak, mot nabela ɛdhɛɛb ɛ wat ɔ, nyɛ eezɛzyɛ é yɛ kɔkɔ. Nyɛ nɛ kukuma náá: “Ghɛŋ, mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔy nɛ goo lo dhaa nyel. Wɔ dyeebakɛnɔɔ edee ɛ́ tɔ epyeeb ee wɔ di ààbɛ ɛ. Wɔ dyeebakɛbɔ́k bhum ɛ́, tɔ pyeeb wɔ nadi ààbɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>É tɛp tak ɛ́ mɛ gwak bwoo. Mɛ ɛ́ bookɛsyel lɔɔd'ɔ tɔ bɔs. Beea lɔɔd'ɔ, nɔŋa.” <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>É di'enek, kukuma ye ɛ́ boobɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Mbee mot-mɛsa, tyaabel. Wɔ ke ɛ́ náá, wɔ nɛ gu náá, mam dyeebakɛnɔɔ esa e dɛk ɛ́ tɔ pyeeb mɛ di ààmwam bhek ɛ. Mɛ kɛbɔ́k bhum ɛ́ tɔ pyeeb mɛ nadi ààbɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Gwaka mɛ, wɔ di àànɔɔ lɔɔd'am, kɛwa tɔ eboo mendjaa mɛ bɛ di ebaal epata e bot ɛ, étɛp yé? Wɔy ɛpedi ɛ́, di tsoŋ mot ɔɔ, pe bula mɛ bula ɛ, mɛ kazɛbela ɛ́ dhiiti lɔɔd eezekala kɔ yii mɛ nalik ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Dɛkeka nyɛ ɛdhɛɛb ɛ lɔɔd'enek, da bi ɛ́ djɛ mot di nɛ mɛdhɛɛb kam ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Etɛɛ náá, mot aadi nɛ ba bim sonok ɔ, bɛ waabil nyɛ dhiiti, étɛp ye neebu. Tin, mot aakadi toto ààbɛ nɛ sonok ɔ, bɛ waadɛk nyɛ dɔɔ nɛ eghutu-ghutu nyɛ lik nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Yɛ kabɛ mbee mot-mɛsa mak ɔ, zyeegalka nyɛ pɛ kel, tɔ ghooghom, tɔ di mɛgwyɛ nɛ di ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok.”»<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dáa bot aapɛ́ɛaa é ɛsik ɛ bɔs ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>«É sok Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aazyɛ tɔ duma yɛ bɛ nɛ efofop bɛ djas ɛ, nyɛ waazɛdisi kɔ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Membyak djas di kɔ bɔs ɛ́ waazɛsɛɛga sok bhwoob'ɛ, bhii tak nyɛ waawa membɛk pak bot dáa mbaalel mɛsaa di ewa mbɛk pak ebhata nɛ etaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Nyɛ waanɛɛg ebhata pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ, etaa pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Tin, mɛkoozi waalɛɛ nɛ bot aadi pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɔ náá: “Biyɔ, bot ɛ Saag'am zesɛɛ mɛtel ɔ, dhaka pɛ kak. Dhanika tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb naloozekoobal bin yɛ é sok nyɛ nadi ekus bɔs ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Etɛɛ náá, za naasa mɛ, bi naadjɛ mɛ edee. Mɛ naagwak gwyes mɛdii, bi naadjɛ mɛ mɛdii. Mɛ nadi ɛ́ ndjoŋ, bi naamyaal mɛ tɔ mendjaa men dáa mɔn nyɛɛg'en. <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>Mɛ nadi ɛ́ ben toto, bi naabet mɛ. Mɛ naabɛ́, bi naagwom mɛ. Mɛ naani membok, bi naazyɛ zɛbee mɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>«Deenek bot ɛ nakɛ tɔ epiki ɔ aabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: “Ghɛŋ! Yaa dwoo bis nabee wɔ nɛ za, da bis ɛ́ djɛ wɔ edee? Yaa dwoo wɔ nadi nɛ gwyes mɛdii, da bis ɛ́ djɛ wɔ mɛdii? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Yaa dwoo wɔ nadi ndjoŋ, da bis ɛ́ djɛ wɔ di tɔ mendjaa mes? Yaa dwoo wɔ nadi ben toto, da bis ɛ́ bet wɔ? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Yaa dwoo wɔ nadi ebɛ́, da bis ɛ́ zyɛ, zɛgwyák wɔ? Yaa dwoo wɔ nadi é membok, da bis ɛ́ zyɛ zɛbee wɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Mɛkoozi kabɔɔza ɛ́ náá: “Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, esonok djas bi di esa nɛ mot mɛsik tɔ bɔɔ nyaag'am ɛ, bi sa mbɛɛ esa binek ɛ́ nɛ nam.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>«Bhii tak, kukuma ɛ́ waake nɛ bot aadi pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɔ náá: “Duska mɛ é mis. Tɔ́ka ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nam, biyɔ, bot ɛ Zɛɛb zelek ɛbiyoɛpe ɔ. Tɔ́ka tɔ du di ààdim ɛ. Ye nakoobelaa ɛ́, étɛp Dim mot mɛkɔŋ bɛ nɛ efofop bɛ! <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ za, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ mɛ edee. Mɛ naagwak gwyes mɛdii, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ mɛ mɛdii. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Mɛ nadi ɛ́ ndjoŋ, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ mɛ di tɔ mendjaa men. Mɛ nadi ɛ́ ben toto, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààbet mɛ kaad. Mɛ nadi ebɛ́, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwom mɛ. Mɛ naani mbok, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààzɛgwyak mɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>«Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛbɔɔza náá: “Ghɛŋ, yaa dwoo bis nabee wɔ nɛ za, nɛ gwyes mɛdii, nɛ nɛghu ndjoŋ? Yaa dwoo bis nabee wɔ ben toto, wɔy ebɛ́, nɛghu wɔy é membok, da bis ɛ́ kadi ààkyee wɔ?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Kukuma ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: “Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, esok djas bi nadi ààsa esonok binek nɛ mot mɛsik tɔ bɔn nyaag'am ɛ, bi nadi ààsa yɛ ɛ nɛ nam.” <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Bɛ waatɔ́, kɛbee mɛsuk na kɔm-kɔm. Yɛ kabɛ bot ɛ epiki ɔ, bɛ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Zɛɛga ekukuma egwakel étɛp ɛgó ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Bhii Yezu nasilal mɛlyo mɛ djas ɛ, nyɛ naazɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>«Bi nɛ gu náá, ye kalik ɛ́ mɛlu mɛmbá, etɛɛ náá, ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak neesael. Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waaseebaa, étɛp nyɛ neekɛbemaa kɔ mɛlaaba.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Tin, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda naazɛsɛɛga tɔ ndjaa mɛkoozi Kayif, mot nadi boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Wɔ gwaa, bɔɔ djas zokazɛgwakel náá, bɛ mɛt Yezu tɔ syaab, bhii tak, da bɛ ɛ́ gó nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Bɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá: «Sa mena ààmɛtka nyɛ dwoo ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak, é kaab náá, bot ɛ́ zɛkɛkpaa elyem, da bɛ ɛ́ sa ɛzɛm.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhiiti moma eezɛso Yezu mɛnanas kɔ lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Dáa Yezu nadi pɛ Bhetani tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ Simɔŋ mot na ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>wɔ gwaa, dhiiti moma zɛni tɔ ndjaa tak zeza nɛ di Yezu nadi ɛ́. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ bɛɛb nasael nɛ ɛkok ɛ albat ɛ «tɔɔɔ» nɛ mɛnanas di nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ɛ. Moma tak zokazɛso mɛnanas menek kɔ lo ɛ Yezu é sok bɛ nadi kɔ mesa ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Dáa bɛdjekel bɛ nabee deenek ɛ́, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye nakpaa bɛ elyem. Bɔɔ náá: «Yak ɛ́ yaa kwaambi puluk? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Ɛnyɔ ɛ́ náá, bɛ bɔmsa mɛnanas mɛ tak nɛ boo mɛtaŋ, da ɛ́ nɔɔ epata e tak, djɛ nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot!»<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu naagu sa bɛ nadi enyiŋela pak'ɔɔ ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Betka moma yak gwyem. Étɛp yé bi di ezɛm nyɛ? Sa nyɛ sa kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ, ye ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Yɛ bɛ étɛp bɛdjel ɛ bot ɔ, bi nɛ bɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ aapaazodi mɛlu djas ɛ é di wat. Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔ, bi aanàdi sama nɛ nam mɛlu djas. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Moma yak so mɛ mɛnanas é nyel'am ɛ́, étɛp nyɛ neekan ɛkoobal nyel'am e dwoo mɛdela mam. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, é edi djas Mbɛɛ Bhaadal aadi egoolaa kɔ bɔs ɛ, tseŋa moma yak sa ɛ waakaadaaa mɛdhik nɛ mɛdhik. Tin, bot ɛ waataala enɛm esa nyɛ sa kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudas eezɛka Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Tinaak, djekel ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá ɛ Yezu, nadi edjóoaa Yudas Iskaliɔt ɛ, zokazɛtɔ́ pɛ daa eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>Nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Mam ɛ́ ka bin Yezu ɔɔ, bi kadjɛ mɛ yé é di tak?» Tin, wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ tak zɛwyisal efalanga mɛkam-mɛlɛl e epata, nɔɔ, laa, bhii tak bɛ eezɛdjɛ nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Kana tin, Yudas nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ moo saa mɛpek étɛp nyɛ neeka bɛ Yezu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eezɛdɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>É dwoo mɛkɛn mɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ emapa ee di ààwaaa leviid ɛ, bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu zɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl náá, bis kɛkoobal wɔ di mena aadɛka edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak wo é?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka pɛ dɛl, pɛ daa dhiiti mot, da bi ɛ́ lɛɛ nyɛ náá: “Lyoel ke ɛ́ náá: Ɛwala ɛ lam eezekum. Mam nɛ bɛdjekel bam aadɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak'ak ɛ pɛ tɔ ndjaŋ'ɔ.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Tin, bɛdjekel ɛ́ bookɛsa dáa Yezu nalɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Bɔɔ zokazɛkoobal nɛ ɛdjaab edee ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Dáa dwoo nakabɛ, ye moo bikoko ɛ, Yezu eezɛdisi kɔ mesa bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Dáa bɛ nadi kɔ mesa edɛ ɛ, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ngɔt pak'en ɛ́ waaka mɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Bɛdjekel djas moo tin nɛ ghoŋ tɔ elyem, bhii tak, ngɔt-ngɔt moo tin ezɛdji nyɛ: «Ghɛŋ, ye ɛ́ mam é?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ye ɛ́ mot duu mbɔ tɔ saan wat bis nɛ nɛ ɔ aapaaka mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waagwyɛ dáa ekwyala di elɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ. Tinaak, boo ghoŋ nɛ mot aakɛka nyɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ mbee bot ɔ. Ye nabɛ ààgoka náá, mot'enɔk byel!» <verse eid="MAT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Yudas, mot nadi ekɛka nyɛ gha ɔ ɛ́ boodji náá: «Lyoel, ye kabɛ ɛ́ mam é?» Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ye ɛ́ wɔ ɛmet ɛ ke deenek».<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Dáa bɛ nadi edɛ kɔ mesa ɛ, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛnɔɔ mapa. Nyɛ eezɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛpyak mapa tak, nɔɔ, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛy náá: «Nɔɔka yɛ, da bi ɛ́ dɛ, etɛɛ náá, yak ɛ́ nyel'am.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ bɛɛlɛ nadi nɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin tɔ tak ɛ, nyɛ eezɛbaazɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nɔɔka yɛ, da bi ɛ́ dɛ biyɔ djas, <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>etɛɛ náá, yak ɛ́ ghiya yam. Yɛ ɛ́ ghiya di edjɛ bot ze ɛni tɔ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, ghiya nasee kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛbuɛpe étɛp mesyem mɛ bot neepelel ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: kana dwoo pan mos'ak, mɛ aanàkabaadɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin, kɛkum dwoo mɛ aakabaakɛdɛ mɛnyok mɛ na bes menabɛlka tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Saag'am ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Tin, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛduwal Zɛɛb tɔ mɛdjeeb. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, tɔ́ pɛ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlɛɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd náá, nyɛ waaswonal nyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Tin, Yezu zokake nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «É pum'ak mos, biyɔ djas ɛ́ waadhuugal mɛ, etɛɛ náá, ekwyala lɛɛ náá: “Mɛ waagó mbaalel ebhata. Tin, ɛsaa djas ɛ́ waawyɛɛza na gwyiiŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zal 13.7</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Yezu eebaazɛbil ɛkpa náá: «Bhii ɛgom ɛ lam, mɛ waatɔ́, kɛbwood bin pɛ Ghalile.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Pyɛɛd zokake nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, bot djas ɛ́ waakaab wɔ ɔɔ, mam aanàkwaakaab wɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Tinaak, Yezu kabɔɔza nɛ nɛ ɛ́ náá: «Gwaka, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ náá, é pum'ak mos, ɛsok nɛ kuu nɛ kɔk, yɛ aabela ɛ́, wɔ eezelɛɛ nɛ bot esok elɛl náá, wɔ ààgu mɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛke nɛ bot náá, mɛ ààgu wɔ, ye nakoozobɛ ɛsyee, mɛ ɛpemyaal náá, menabɛl bɛbá gwyɛ.» É di'enek, ye nabɛ tin ɛ́, bɛdjekel djas moo ɛkpa wat.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eekɛdjaala Zɛɛb pɛ Ghɛtɛsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Bhis yenek, Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ naazɛkum pɛ di di edjóoaa Ghɛtɛsemani ɛ. É di tak, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Likeka wak. Mɛ pookotiila poon, kɛdjaala Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Tin, nyɛ kanɔŋ ɛ́ Pyɛɛd, nɛ bɔn Zɛbɛdɛ bɛbá, tɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ. É di'enek, ye nabɛ ɛ́, keŋ nɛ ghoŋ moo sa nyɛ ɛbuɛpe tɔ lyem. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sisim'am ɛ́ tɔ ghoŋ saa-saŋak náá mɛ gwyɛ. Likeka wak dika ndjem sama nɛ nam. Nàdjaka egɔ́, djaalaka Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtiila batsa pɛ sok, zɛkwyit mɛboŋ bhwoob si na «ghɔkɔ», nyɛ moo tin edjaala nɛ Zɛɛb náá: «Saag'am, wɔ kwyɛl ɔɔ, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdis bɛɛlɛ mezuk mak sok bhwoob'am. Ye goka ɛ́ djas sael tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ, ààkabɛ yam ɛkwosak.» <verse eid="MAT 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛsik, tɔ́ pɛ nyɛ lik bɛdjekel bɛ bɛlɛl binɔk ɛ, nyɛ kazɛbela bɛ ɛ́ é gɔ́. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Deenek, bi eedja gɔ́! Bi ààpakodi-diak mis membek sama nɛ nam é ɛwala wat é? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Dika ndjem, djaalaka Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ zɛkɛkwyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal. Sisim ɛ́ ghiŋ, tin, epuud nɛ bu elɛtɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Yak kɔkɔ, nyɛ eebaazɛsik pɛ pak nyɛ nadi sok ɛ, nyɛ kadjaala é sok tak ɛ́ dáak: «Saag'am, yɛ kosael náá, bɛɛlɛ mezuk mak dhaa mam ààdɛ yɛ ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ sael.» <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Yezu eebaazɛbula pɛ nyɛ nalik bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ, nyɛ kabaazobela bɛ é egɔ́, etɛɛ náá, mis mɔɔ nadi ɛ́ ɛdilɛpe. <verse eid="MAT 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Yak sok, Yezu eebaazɛlik bɛ, zɛbaasik, nyɛ eezɛtseta nɛ nɔɔ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, ɛtɔ́ ɛ lɛ tyee esok elɛl nyɛ nadi etetɔ́ kɛdjaala dáa nyɛ nadjedjaala sok ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛbula pɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nadi ɛ́, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi dinaa é gɔ́? Bi ɛpewala? Guka náá, ɛwala Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aaseebaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ mesyem ɛ eezedjala. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Wyɛlka, ghɛɛka mɛnyel, mena tɔ́ka, etɛɛ náá, mot ka mɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot binɔk ɔ, moo ɛ́ ɛkunaaɛpe nɛ nena.»<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛmɛtaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Yezu dinaa ààpaakosilal ɛlii deenek, Yudas, ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛtuula nɛ boo ɛdhuu ɛ bot nɛ epɛl nɛ ebhil e ele é mɛmbɔ. Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda ɛ́ nalwom bɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Kabela tin ɛ́, Yudas, mot naka bɛ Yezu gha ɔ naazelyaal bɛ geka, bɛ aagwyak Yezu nɛ yɛ ɛ: «Mot mɛ aakɛbeedal ɔ, ye ɛ́ nyɛy, mɛtka nyɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Batsa deenek, Yudas eezɛtuula, nyɛ eezɛtiila pɛ daa Yezu, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ eeswos wɔ, Lyoel!» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbeedal nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>É di tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɛn sɔ'am! Lela ɛsa sa wɔ zyɛ zɛsa ɛ.» Bhii tak, bot ɛ nazyɛ bɛ nɛ Yudas ɔ ɛ́ boozɛmɛt Yezu.<verse eid="MAT 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Tin, wɔ gwaa, ngɔt pak bot ɛ nadi bɛ nɛ Yezu ɔ, zokawaal pɛl, tsaal dhiiti mot-mɛsa mɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɛlɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Yezu eezɛke nɛ mot'enɔk náá: «Nɔŋa pɛl'ɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ bulal tɔ pɛp, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ di egó bɛsɔ bɔɔ bot nɛ epɛl ɔ, bɛ aabaazogwyɛ ɛ́ nɛ pɛl. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Wɔ ààgu náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjóo Saag'am, nyɛ zɛkwyee mɛ? É di tak wat, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdhis mɛ ɛdhuu ɛ esodja efofop ɛbuɛpe kum-kumak mɛdhuu kam nɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Mɛ sa deenek ɔɔ, etɛp ee di tɔ ekwyala aakasael dáa? Etɛɛ náá, ekwyala lɛɛ náá, ye goka ɛ́ etɛp binek sael deenek.»<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot náá: «Ye goka nɛ nen ɛ́ náá, bi zyɛ nɛ epɛl nɛ ebhil e ele étɛp bi neezɛmɛt mɛ tyee náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot ɛzɛm é? Dhi mɛlu djas mɛ di ndiindil tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa é lelyo, biyɔ ààmɛt mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Esesɛɛ binek sael ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee nakwyalaa tɔ mɛkana mɛ Zɛɛb dum nɛ nam ɛ́ neebela ɛsuk.» Tinaak, bɛdjekel djas ɛ́ boo zɛghuma nɛ ekaab tɔ́ yɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu sok bhwoob bot ɛ boo kwan eYuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Bot ɛ namɛt Yezu ɔ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa Kayif, mot nadi kɔ elo e bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ, é di bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda nakɛsɛɛga ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Pyɛɛd nadi edu bɛ, nyɛy ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɔɔ, batakɛni tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ ndjaŋ ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb. Nyɛy zokani tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ, nɔɔ nyel, disi bɛ nɛ bot ɛ di ebaal ndjaa tak ɔ, étɛp nyɛ neebee dáa tɛp tak aakɛ sik ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 26:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ boo kwan eYuda nadi esaa dhiiti esua-esua étɛp bɛ needjɛ Yezu epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Ye nakoozodi náá, bot ɛbuɛpe naazezyɛ zɛpit nyɛ nɛ etɛp esua-esua, tin, bɛ nakadi ɛ́, ààbela sonok. É di tak, wɔ gwaa, bot ɛbá zokazyɛ zɛpit nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>Bɔɔ náá: «Mot tak naake náá: “Mɛ waabwak kok Ndjaa-ebuwa e Zɛɛb, da mɛ ɛ́ sum yɛ tɔ mɛlu mɛlɛl.”»<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Tin, boo ghaa-Zɛɛb eezɛwyɛl, zɛdji Yezu náá: «Tɔ mɛpita mɛ bot bak zɛpit wɔ'aak, wɔ ààkataŋal yɔ é?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɔɔza nyɛ. Boo ghaa-Zɛɛb baazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Tuwala myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɔ nɛ din ɛ Zɛɛb. Lɛɛa bis tsɛɛtsɛ tyee mwaado: Lɛɛa bis nɛghu wɔy ɛ́ di Mɛsia Mɔn Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="MAT 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ye ɛ́ wɔy, wɔ ɛmet ɛ́ ke deenek! Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, kana ɛwala mena dika'aak, bi ɛ́ waabee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ndiindil pɛ kyee mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb mɛbwala. Bi ɛ́ waabee nyɛ ezyɛ kɔ eguud tɔ gwoo.»<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, boo ghaa-Zɛɛb zɛnyaa ekaad bɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Nyɛ eelee Zɛɛb! Mena tokapɛ nɛ gwyes náá, mot zɛlɛɛ mena sa nyɛ di esa ɛ! Bi eegwak ebyas ee nyɛ byasal Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Biyɔ kake dáa?» Bɔɔ djas eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ndjɛ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsyee.» <verse eid="MAT 26:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛsɛɛ nyɛ mɛtel é bhwoob, bɛ moo tu nyɛ nɛ ekutupo. Bɛdhiiti bot moo tin epak nyɛ mɛbhɛɛz. <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Naŋa! Wɔy Mɛsia, yɛ ɛ́ zɛmyak wɔ?»<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd eezɛkɛla Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́ ndiindil pɛ kel tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ. Dhiiti moma nadi esa mɛsa tɔ ndjaa boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ, zɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔy pe, wɔ nadi ɛ́, bi nɛ Yezu, mot Ghalile yenɔk.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛswonal. Nyɛy náá: «Mɛ ààgu sa wɔ di kwyɛl ɛlii'enek.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Bhii tak, Pyɛɛd eezɛswoola di tɔ peeb ɛbɛsɛɛ, tɔ́ kɛtyaa pɛ ɛniel. Tin, wɔ gwaa, dhiiti moma mɛsa baazɛgwyak nyɛ. Moma tak eezɛlɛɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ náá: «Mot'ak nadi ɛ́, bɛ nɛ Yezu, mot Nazalɛt.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Tin, wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd baazɛkɛla Yezu kɛla sis, nyɛ eetuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ nɛ din ɛ Zɛɛb náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mɛ ààgu mot'enɔk.»<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Bhii tak, bot ɛ nadi é di'enek bɛ nɛ bɛ nɔɔ eezɛtiila pɛ Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ! Wɔ ɛ́ mot'ɔɔ, etɛɛ náá, ɛlii ɛ lɔ ɛpelyaal pɛ kyee dɛl wɔ dus ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>É di'enek, Pyɛɛd eezɛben gwood, kɛla. Nyɛ ɛ́ bookalal: «Zɛɛb Mɛkaake! Mam ààgu mot bi di eke'enɔk!» Batsa deenek, kuu ɛsok eezɛkɔk. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛtaala sa Yezu nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ: «Ɛsok nɛ kuu nɛ kɔk, yɛ aabela ɛ́, wɔ eezeswonal mɛ esok elɛl». É di'enek, Pyɛɛd eezɛwyis, tɔ́, nyɛ moo tin edje ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ Yezu sok bhwoob ɛ Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Tɔ ghooghom mɛlem, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda zokazɛsɛɛga. Tɔ zɛɛga tak, bɛ nagwakel ɛ́ náá, bɛ neegó Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Bɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ, kɔl nyɛ mɛmbɔ, zɛnɔɔ nyɛ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa Pilat mot nadi kukuma dɛl ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛsyee ɛ Yudas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Dáa Yudas, mot naka nyɛ gha nagwak náá, Yezu eemɛtaa étɛp nyɛ neekɛgóaa ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naadyeebadjɛ lyem mɛbɛ. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ bookanɔɔ efalanga mɛkam-mɛlɛl e epata ee eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda nadjɛ nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ eekɛbulal yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ eekwyɛ ndjɛ! Mɛ eemyaal náá, mɛ eeka mot baa gwyes nyɛ góaa!» Bot binɔk ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yenek ààkagwyák bisɔ, ye gwyák ɛ́ wɔy.» <verse eid="MAT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Wɔ gwaa Yudas zokanɔɔ epata binek, mwas tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́, kɛtiŋal kel é tsuŋ yeeda.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Bot ɛ nadi kɔ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ ɛ́ boozɛtek epata binek. Bɔɔ náá: «Etsi bina lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, mbi epata dáak ààgoka nɛ ɛbaakɛkwomaa tɔ di epata di ekwomaa tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, yenek moo ɛ́ epata e ghiya.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Bhii bɛ nazegwakel ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ epata binek, kɛbɔm pyeeb mɛel mɛbhe mɛ dyak. Bɛ nabɔm yɛ ɛ́ étɛp ye needi, di mɛvit mɛ bɛdjoŋ. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Étɛp tak ɛ, bɛ naget pyeeb tak «pyeeb ghiya», kɛkum dɔɔ nɛ dwoo pan mos'ak. <verse eid="MAT 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Djas yenek nasael ɛ́ dáa ngoolel-mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Zelemi nalɛɛ ɛ́: «Bɛ eenɔɔ bɔɔ efalanga mɛkam-mɛlɛl epata binek, mɛtaŋ mɛ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl nazetiŋal kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>Tin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ epata e tak, bɔm yɛ nɛ pyeeb ɛ mɛel mɛbhe mɛ dyak, dáa Ghɛŋ nalɛɛ mɛ ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zal 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:2-3">Zel 18.2-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:1-2">19.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:6-15">32.6-15</ref>. </char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu sok bhwoob ɛ Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Yezu eezɛpɛ́ɛaa pɛ daa kukuma. Pilat eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda?» Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Wɔy, wɔ ɛmet eelɛɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Bhii tak, dáa eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa eYuda nakadi esu nyɛ zukamwaa nɛ etɛp ɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Pilat eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ààgwak mɛpita mɛ bɛ di epit wɔ yenek é?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Tinaak, Yezu kadi ɛ́ ààbɔɔza bɛ ɛkpa wat. Kukuma naadyeebadjoka nɛ dáa Yezu nadi gwyem, ààbɛɛ nuub ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ eezɛpɛ́ɛ Yezu epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Esok djas yii eYuda nadi ebebɔl ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak ɛ, ekukuma bɔɔ nabebɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛfulu mɛ ɛpel ɛ mot membok ngɔt yii ɛdhuu ɛ bot aasɛ́ɛ ɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ wyiselaa é membok. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>É di tak, tɔ membok, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti ngék mot membok. Din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu Bhaalabas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Pilat ɛ́ boozɛdji ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ náá: «Bi kwyɛl náá, mɛ bet bin zɛ? Yezu Bhaalabas “ooho” Yezu, mot di djóoaa Klisto ɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Tin, Pilat nadi egu náá, Yezu namɛtaa ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mbee lyem nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Dáa Pilat nadi kɔ bóó epɛ́ɛ bɛ ɛ, myɛl zokadhis nyɛ bhaadal náá: «Sa wɔ ààsa mot epiki yenɔk ɛbiyo, etɛɛ náá, mɛ eedyeebazuk é pum'ak mos tɔ dhyam kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>É di'enek, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda moo tin ebesal ɛdhuu ɛ bot, bɛ lɛɛ nɛ Pilat náá, nyɛ wyisal bɛ Bhaalabas, da bɛ ɛ́ gó Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Wɔ gwaa, kukuma Pilat baazɛdji bɛ náá: «Tɔ bot ɛbá bak, bi kwyɛl náá, mɛ bet bin nwyaa?» Ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk kabulal ɛ́ náá: «Bhaalabas.» <verse eid="MAT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilat ɛ́ boozɛbaadji bɛ náá: «Mɛ sa dáa nɛ Yezu di djóoaa Klisto ɛ?» Bɛ kabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bema nyɛ kɔ mɛlaaba!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Pilat eebaadji bɛ náá: «Yaa etɛp e ɛbiyo nyɛ sa?» Wɔ gwaa, bɛ baazɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe: «Bema nyɛ kɔ mɛlaaba!»<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Dáa Pilat nabee náá, bot nadi enenal ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ mɛdii, gwyii mɛmbɔ mɛ é mis ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɛp ɛsyee ɛ mot'ak ààkagwyák mɛ. Ye kagwyák ɛ́ biyɔ bɛ ɛmet!» <verse eid="MAT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ zokazɛbɔɔza náá: «Beta náá, esesɛɛ binek djas kwyɛ kɔ elo bis nɛ kɔ elo e bɔn bis!» <verse eid="MAT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Tin, Pilat ɛ́ boozɛwyisal bɛ Bhaalabas, é di'enek nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ, bɛ bi Yezu nɛ eghwyɛs, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛ Yezu, étɛp bɛ neekɛbem nyɛ kɔ mɛlaaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esodja ɛpeduk Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Esodja ɛ Pilat zokatɔ́ nɛ Yezu tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ pɛ daa kukuma, é di'enek, bɛ eezɛwa nyɛ kuku ɛbwak. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Bɛ eezɛsɔ nyɛ kaad nyɛ nabɔt ɛ, bhii tak bɛ eezɛbet nyɛ ndjookuwa na tɔɔbelaa. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Tin, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ lɛɛ le mɛgɔk, pyeed nyɛ kɔtɔ mɛkoozi nɛ yɛ. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ sɔm nyɛ yɛ ɛ é lo, bɛ eezɛsɛk nyɛ mɔɔ le ghwaazok é mbɔ eghɛŋ bɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ sok bhwoob'ɛ, bɛ moo tin eduk nyɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Bis eeswos wɔ, mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda!» <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Bɛ moo tin esɛɛ nyɛ mɛtel é nyel. Bɛ eezɛdɛk mɔɔ le ghwaazok nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ é mbɔ ɛ, bɛ eezɛmyak nyɛ nɛ yɛ é lo. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Bhii bɛ nasilal ɛduk nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdis nyɛ ndjookuwa bɛ nazebet nyɛ ɛ́, bɛ eebaazɛbet nyɛ ekaad ee nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ sok ɛ. Bhii tak bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ étɛp nyɛ neekɛbemaa kɔ mɛlaaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eebemaa kɔ mɛlaaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>É ghɛŋ bɛ nadi ewyis kɔ dɛl ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛboma nɛ dhiiti mot dɛl Silɛn. Din ɛ mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Simɔŋ. Tin, esodja ɛ́ boolwom nyɛ nɛ bhel náá: Nyɛ kwyee Yezu é ɛbɛp mɛlaaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Tin, bɛ eezɛkum é di bɛ nadi edjóo: Ghologhota ɛ. Din ɛ tak kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ: «Di Bhobho Lo». <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>É di'enek, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdjɛ Yezu mɛnyok puuza nɛ dhiiti sonok mɛnyan na gwyee-gwyee. Bhii nyɛ nabowal ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛpɛɛ ɛdɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛbem nyɛ kɔ mɛlaaba. Bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ ɛ́ boozɛkaa ekaad bɛ, bhii bɛ nasa ɛgwyeeg étɛp bɛ neesɛ́ɛ mot aanɔɔ ekaad e tak ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdisi tin ebaal Yezu.<verse eid="MAT 27:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eekwyal kɔ lo'ɛ, kɔ ɛko ɛ mɛlaaba mɛsɔ mɛ nyɛ nagóaa étɛp tak ɛ. Ye nakwyalaa ɛ́ náá: <char style="sc">«Nwyak ɛ́ Yezu, mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda.»</char> <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ ɛzɛm nɛ etuub bɛbá naabemaa é yɔbɔ mɛlaaba dwoo tak wat, ngɔt pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Yezu, nwyak tak pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɛ lɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Bot ɛ nadi edhaa tin ɔ, bɛ nadi elee nyɛ, nɛ ɛsyaal elo. <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔy mot di ekwyɛl ɛwaaz kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, da bhii tak, wɔ ɛ́ baawyɛl yɛ bhii mɛlu mɛlɛl ɔ, tsika nyel'ɔ wɔ ɛmet. Yɛ bɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn Zɛɛb ɔɔ, sula kɔ mɛlaaba!»<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Dɔɔ nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, zɛnɔɔ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda moo tin eduk nyɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>«Nyɛ ɛpetsik bot ɛ sis, nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik nyel'ɛ nyɛ ɛmet! Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ́ di mɛkoozi mɛ Yisalaɛl é? Nyɛ pookokasul kɔ mɛlaaba étɛp mena needumka koŋ nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Nyɛ naadyeebadum koŋ'ɛ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛy batake náá: “Mɛ ɛ́ Mɔn Zɛɛb”. Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, Zɛɛb nɛ kwyɛl nyɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ katsik nyɛ é di'enek nenak!» <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Bot ɛ ɛzɛm ɛ nadi mbema é mengwoob ɛ Yezu ɔ, moo tin ebaalee nyɛ pe mɛkpa mɛ wat tyee bot ɛ ɛsok nadi elee nyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛsyee ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Dáa ye nakum kuku mwos ɛ, wɔ gwaa, ɛgwyitok zɛgwyiidela kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas, mɛghomla menek naabɔya mɛwala mɛlɛl. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Tin, é ghɛŋ ye nadhaa mɛwala mɛlɛl bhii kuku mwos ɛ, wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛbo boo tsim: <char style="tl">Eli</char>, <char style="tl">Eli</char>, <char style="tl">lema sabatani</char>? Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Zɛɛb Saag'am, Zɛɛb Saag'am! Étɛp yé wɔ bet mɛ mɛ ɛmet deenek?» <verse eid="MAT 27:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Bɛdhiiti bot pak bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, zokagwak dáa Yezu natsim ɛ. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛsɔ bɔɔ náá: «Gwakeka! Nyɛ ɛpedjóo Eli!» <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Tin, mot ngɔt pak'ɔɔ eezɛwyis kaab, kɛnɔɔ pes kaad, zɛkɔl é bil le ghwaazok, duu tɔ mɛnyok mɛ na bwaaz-bwaaz, nyɛ eesɛɛb Yezu yɛ ɛ, nyɛ needɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Tin, wɔ gwaa, bɛdhiiti bot zokake náá: «Bwooda, mena pookobeeka nɛghu Eli ɛ́ waazyɛ, zɛdis nyɛ é mɛlaaba.» <verse eid="MAT 27:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Bhis yenek, wɔ gwaa, Yezu baazɛbo boo tsim, bhii tak nyɛ zɛsil eswos.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>É di'enek wat, wɔ gwaa, boo lɛmbɛ nadi tɔ Di na Dɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ zokazɛnyɛɛ kuku tak kan pɛ ɛko kɛkum pɛ si. Bɔs dheegel, mɛkok bel, <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>mɛvit diiel. Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛbuɛpe nagwyɛ bɔɔ edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ zokagom. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Bɔɔ zokawyis tɔ mɛvit, bhis ɛgom ɛ Yezu, bɔɔ zokani tɔ Yeluzalɛm dɛl ɛ na dɛɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛbuɛpe nabee bɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Kukuma tɔ lɔɔg esodja nɛ esodja ee nadi tin ebaal Yezu ɔ naabee dáa bɔs nadheegel ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ edjema djas nasael tin ɛ. Boo bwoo naazɛsa bɛ ɛlyelɛpe, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Mɔn Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Bɛtɛ nɛ boa nadi ɛ́ tin, bɔɔ ebee ɛtsetaɛpe sa nasɛ́ɛ ɛ. Boa tak nadidi ɛ́, bɛ nɛ Yezu, kana pɛ Ghalile. Mɛsa mɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ɛkwyee ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Pak boa ɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́: Maali, moma dɛl Makdala, Maali nyɛɛg ɛ Zak bɛ nɛ Zozɛf, zɛnɔɔ nyɛɛg bɔɔ Zɛbɛdɛ.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muu ɛ Yezu eekɛwaaa tɔ ɛvit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Dáa ye nabɛ dwoo moo bikoko ɛ, dhiiti kuma mot dɛl Alimate zokazyɛ, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Zozɛf. Nyɛ nabaabɛ ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokatɔ́ pɛ daa kukuma Pilat, kɛwaab muu ɛ Yezu. Tin, Pilat ɛ́ booke náá, bɛ djɛ nyɛ muu ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Tin, Zozɛf ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ bes bheeza na puu, pil muu ɛ Yezu tɔ tak. <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokanɔɔ muu tak, kɛwa yɛ tɔ ɛvit ɛ nyɛ nakpak tɔ bat ɛkok ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ zokabiŋal boo ɛkok ɛ bɛ nasa étɛp bɛ neediyal ɛvit ɛ tak nɛ yɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, sik, tɔ́ pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Tin, kabela ɛ́, Maali, moma dɛl Makdala nɛ nwyak Maali nadi ebee di bɛ nawa muu ɛ Yezu ɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esodja ee nadi ebaal ɛvit ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Ɛlu ɛwat bhii tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ dwoo saba. Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ eFalizyɛ zokazɛtɔ́ kɛsɛɛga pɛ daa Pilat. <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, ye bɛ ɛ́ bis eetaala náá, na ghaa mɛkɔŋ menɔk, é ghɛŋ nyɛ nadi, nyɛ dinaa nɛ tsik ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naalɛɛ náá: “É ghɛŋ mɛ aagwyɛ ɛ, mɛlu mɛlɛl bhii tak, mɛ waagom.” <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Ye goka ɛ́, wɔ lwom bot náá, bɛ kɛbaal ɛvit mɛlu mɛlɛl, etɛɛ náá, bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛzɛdjii muu, tɔ́ nɛ yɛ, da bɛ ɛ́ kake náá: “Nyɛ eegom!” Tin, mɛkɔŋ menek ɛ́ waabaagék dhaa-dhaŋak yii nabɛ sok ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilat ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Beeka esodja étɛp ɛkɛbaal é. Tɔ́ka, kɛbaal ɛvit dáa bi di ekwyɛl ɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́, kɛkoobal dáa bɛ aakɛbaal ɛvit ɛ. Bɛ ɛ́ boopyet ɛkok é ɛbɛ ɛ ɛvit ɛ tak ɛlyelɛpe. Esodja é tak eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, disi tin é ngwoob ɛvit.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɛgom ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Dáa dwoo saba nadhaŋ ɛ, kɛŋ tɔ mɛlem mɛ dwoo mɛkɛn mɛ yenga, wɔ gwaa, Maali moma dɛl Makdala, nɛ nwyak dhiiti Maali zɛtɔ́, kɛbee ɛvit. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Dáa bɛ katɔ́ ɛ́, bɛ kasɛka ɛ́, bɔs moo dheegel ɛlyelɛpe. Fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt eedus pɛ tɔ gwoo, sul é bɔs, nyɛ eezɛbiŋal boo ɛkok ɛ bɛ nadiyal ɛbɛ ɛ ɛvit nɛ yɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, disi kɔ ɛkok ɛ tak. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, ɛkasɛpe dáa ngwyes bhi, ekaad bɛ mɛpum dhaa nyel. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Tin, esodja ee nazɛbaal ɛvit ɔ, moo tin syeela nɛ bɛbebwol, bɛ moo tin «gbegbagba» epwak nɛ bwoo, saa dáa bɛ sa. <verse eid="MAT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>É di'enek, wɔ gwaa fofop zokake nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nàdika nɛ bwoo, mɛ nɛ gu náá, bi saŋ ɛ́ Yezu, mot nabemaa é mɛlaaba ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Nyɛ tokapɛ wak. Nyɛ eezegom dáa nyɛ nalɛɛ bin é ghɛŋ nyɛ nadi, nyɛ dinaa nɛ nen é di wat ɛ. Dha beeka di bɛ nakɛl muu'ɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Lelka, tɔ́ka, kɛlɛɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: “Nyɛ eezegom! Nyɛ eetɔ́, kɛbwood bin pɛ Ghalile. Ye ɛ́ penek ɛ bi aakɛboma nɛ nɛ.” Bhaadal mɛ kwyɛl mɛ neelɛɛ bin ɛ, ye ɛ́ yenek.»<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>É di tak wat, boa binɔk eezɛwyis tɔ ɛvit, bɔɔ zɛsum kaab. Tɔ elyem bɔɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bwoo nɛ mɛmyaala ɛlyelɛpe. Bɔɔ zokasik kɛgoola lɛŋ pɛ daa bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MAT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>É di tak wat, Yezu zokazɛboma nɛ boa binɔk. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ eeswos bin!» Tin, boa binɔk eezɛtiila pɛ dáa Yezu, bɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ é mɛko, bɛ moo tin nɛ ɛduwal nyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa bi ààdi nɛ bwoo. Kɛlɛɛka nɛ bɔn nyaag'am náá, bɛ tɔ́ pɛ Ghalile. Ye ɛ́ penek ɛ bɛ aakɛbee mɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛŋ esodja ee nadi ebaal ɛvit ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Boa binɔk dinaa é ze, bɛdhiiti bot tɔ esodja ee nanɛɛgaa étɛp ɛbaal ɛvit ɔ eezɛkum pɛ dɛl. Bɛ moo tin elɛɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb esesɛɛ ee nadhaa penek ɛ djas. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Bot ɛ nadi kɔ elo e bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ, nɛ bɛpaa eYuda zokasɛɛga é kwan. Bhii bɛ nazegwakel ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ djɛ esodja binɔk bɛtɛ nɛ epata. <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>Bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi lɛɛ bot ɛ náá: “Bɛdjekel bɛ eezyɛ é pum, zɛdjii muu mot'ɔɔ, bisɔ é egɔ́.” <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Tin, kukuma yen ɛ gwak ɔɔ, yɛ aanàkwaasa sonok, etɛɛ náá, bis ɛ́ waagu dáa bis aasil nyɛ lyem ɛ. Bis ɛ́ waasa náá, bi nàbela etɛp pɛ di mɛsa men.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Esodja é tak ɛ́ boonɔɔ epata é tak. Sika bɛ nakasik ɛ́, bɛ ɛ́ bookɛsa dáa bɛ nalɛɛ bɛ náá, bɛ sa ɛ. Deenek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ menduk mɛ etɛp binek naagék tɔ mɛlɔ mɛ eYuda djas, kɛkum dwoo pan mos'ak.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtel nyel nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ ngɔt nalik ɔ, nadi etɔ́ pɛ ze Ghalile, pɛ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ Yezu nalyo bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Dáa bɛ nakum ɛ, bɛ eezɛbee nyɛ. Bhii tak bɛ moo tin eduwal nyɛ. Ye kabela tin ɛ́, bɛdhiiti nadi ɛ́, nɛ mɛso tɔ elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yezu ɛ́ bootiila pɛ bɛ nadi ɛ́, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ye nabɛ ɛ́, Zɛɛb eedjɛ mɛ eghɛŋ nɛ mɛbwala mɛ djas pɛ tɔ gwoo nɛ kɔ bɔs. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Deenek, tɔ́ka pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak djas di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ, da bi ɛ́ kɛsa náá, bɔɔ djas liigel, da bɛ ɛ́ di bɛdjekel bam. Duuka bɛ Zɛɛb nɛ din ɛ Sɛɛg, nɛ Mɔn, nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>Lyoka bɛ, bɛ kɛlooba nɛ esesɛɛ djas mɛ nalyaal bin ɛ. Tin, bi ɛ́ waabee náá, mena waadika lɔɔg wat mɛlu djas, kɛkum dwoo bɔs'ak aabookɛsi ɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
